<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EZK" style="id">Ezekiel</book>
  <para style="h">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="mt">Ezekiel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saltaan kum sawmthumna halina, khum ha ni nga niin tambang ahing hi a, Kebar lui gei a saltangte lah a ka um laiin, vante ahing kihonga Pasian apat kilahnate ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khumi ha ni nga niin, tuakhu leengpa Jehoiakin saltan kum ngana kum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kaldaite gam a Kebar luipi gei ah Buzi tapa siempu Ezekiel kungah Mangpa thu ahing tunga, tualeh khunah Mangpa khut atungah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka et leh Ngai vawi, mallam akipat in huipi hattah ahing langa, meilum thupitah meikuong in akimkot a apumtuom ahing umdoh a; avahin a kimvel atanvah a asunga mei-am laitah ah sia am banga am a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh tua lah a kipat in silhing li kibahpi ahing pawtdoh hi. Tambang amel puoh dan uh ahi a, mihing mel toh kibahna anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mai li a nei chiet ua, tualeh ha li anei chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Akengte uh atang zetzot a, akengtaw uh bawngnou kengtaw abanga, tuate khu sum-eng kinot val sitset bangin ataang zuol zuol zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaun apang li ua, ahate uh nuoi ah, mihing khut bangbang anei chiet uhi. Ali un maitang li leh ha li anei chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahate uh khat leh khat akisutuo chiet hi, apei chieng un akihei vateh sih ua, hinanleh amaizawn chiet uah tangtah in apei chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaitangte uh tambang ahi: mihing maitang bang anei chiet ua, azietlam pang uah humpibahnei maitang bang anei chiet ua, aveilam pang uah bawngtal maitang bang anei chiet ua, ali un muvanlai maitang bang anei chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tambang khu amaitangte uh ahi. Ahate uh vanlam ah azahtou chiet uhi. Aha nite uh khat leh khat akisutuo chiet ua, tualeh aha nite un atahsapumpi uh akhu chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh amaizawn chiet uah tangtah in apei chiet ua, hagau deina lam lam ah apei uhi, tualeh apei chieng un akihei vateh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua silhingte a melpuoh dan u’leh akilat dan u’khu suong meihol am kuong leh meisel kuong bangmai ahi ua, tua khu sil hingte lah ah asuh atungin apei hi; tua mei khu atangpha mama a, tua meikuong lah ah tunphe aphezot zot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh sil hing lite khu tunphe phezot zot bangin mailam a tai in, anua tai kia zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua sil hingte ka et laitah in, Ngai vawi, sil hingte maitang lite pang a leilah ah kangtalai keng khat chiet um khu ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua kangtalaite melpuohdan, anasep dan u’khu beril suong bangmai ahi a, ali un amelpuoh uh akibang chiet hi. Anasep dan uh kilah dan ahileh kangtalai khat laikim tah a, kangtalai keng dangkhat um bangmai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Apei chieng un aning lite ngatna lang khat pou pou ah apei ua, apei chieng un akihei vateh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Akangtalai keng kuol uh asang mama a, achizat huoi uhi, akuol lite kimvel khu mit in adim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Silhingte apei chiengun, kangtalai kengte zong apang uah apei uhi; tualeh silhingte leitung apat dopkanga a um chiengun, kangtalai kengte zong dopkangin a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hagau pei utna lam lam ah, amauh zong apei ua, kangtalai kengte zong ama utoh zoh in apei zel uhi, tualeh kangtalai kengte tunglam ah amautoh dopkang in a um uhi; aziehpen silhing lite hagau khu kangtalaite sungah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Silhingte apei chieng un, Kangtalai kengte zong apei ua, tuate akhawl chiengun tamte zong akhawl uhi, tualeh tuate khu leitung apat dopkang ahi chiengun tua kangtalai kengte zong amautoh dopkang khawm ahi zel uhi, aziehpen silhingte hagau khu kangtalai kengte sungah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Silhingte lutung zawn a vanthamzawl kilat dan khu Kristal suong bang te-selsol chizat huoi tah bang ahi a, alutung zawn uah akipha zeizoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh vanthamzawl nuoi ah ahate uh khat leh khat kisutuo chiet in tangtah in azah chiet uhi. Aha nite chiet un atahsapumpi uh langkhat akhu ua, aha ni dangte un alangkhat akhu chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Apei chiengun ahazap ging ukhu tui luong ging bang, Bangkimbawlthei aw ging bang leh galkap hon husa thupitah ging bangin ka za hi. Amaute akhawl chiengun ahate uh akhup uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Akhawl ua, ahate uh akhup chiengun, alutung zawn ua vanthamzawl tunglam a kipat aw khat ahing ging hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh alutung zawn ua vanthamzawl tunglam ah Mangtoupha bang khat, saphire suong bang melpuo a um a, tualeh Mangtoupha bang tunglam sangtah ah, mihing lim leh melpuo khat a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh akawng tunglam sie sum-eng mei a kihal am banga kilang, asung lam kimkot a meikuong banga kilang ka mu a, tualeh akawng nuoilam sie zong meikuong hileh kilawm melpuo in ka mu a, avah kimvel sengsong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Guo chiin ni a meilum lah a sakhituihup kilatdan bang khu akimvel a vah kilatdan ahi. Tua khu Mangpa thupina kibahpi a kilat dan ahi. Tuachi’n tami ka mu tahin ka mai lei toh sutuo in khupboh in ka pua a, ahing houpi aw khat ka za hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aman ka kungah: “Mihing tapa na kengin dingin, na kunga thu gen ding ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka kunga thu agen laitah in, ka sungah Hagau ahing lut a, ka kengin ahing dingtou sah a, ka kunga athugen ka zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman ka kungah “Mihing tapa Israel tate, nam helhat, ka tunga helte kunga hing sawl ding ka hi. Ama uleh apu apate un tuni mama chieng dong in ka tungah atawnkhiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaute mi genha leh lungtang phengphi hahlesuonte ahi uhi. Amaute kunga ka hing sawl ahia, akung uah Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, na chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaun ngaikhie in, ngaikhe sih tale u’zong innkuon helhat mawng ahi uh, hinanleh alah uah guolnei ana umta chi athei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh nang mihing tapa amauh giing sinlen, athu gente u’zong zau sin, khau lingneite leh lou lingneite’n hing imkuol in, mom aite lah ah teng nanlachin athugen uh zau sinlen, innkuon helhat hinan u’leh ahing du et vang un zong lungke tuom sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Helhat innkuon ahizieh un, ngaikhie in ngaikhe tasih u’leh zong ka thu amaute kunga na gen teitei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Hinanleh nang mihing tapa, na kunga ka thugen ngai in. Tua innkuon helhatte bangin hel sin; na kam kaah inlen, nang ka hing pieh khu ne in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi a ka et leh ngai vawi, kei lam hing sawh khut khat ka mu a, en vawi, laibuziel khat akhut sungah a tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ka mai ah apha a, asung leh apuo ah, kaanate, lusunnate leh tunggihnate akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuathamlouin aman ka kungah, “Mihing tapa ahing kipie khu ne in, tam laibuziel ne inlen, tualeh pei inlen Israel innkuonte kungah thu va gen in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka kam ka kaah a, tua laibuziel ahing nesahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh aman ka kungah, “Mihing tapa tam laibuziel ka hing pieh ne inlen na gil va sah in,” achi hi. Tuachi’n ken tuakhu ka neta a, ka kam ah khuoizu bangin a hum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman ka kungah, “Mihing tapa, Israel innkuonte kungah pei inlen akung uah ka thute vagen in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen ham tuom leh ham thei loute kunga hing kisawl na hisih a, hinanleh Israel innkuonte kunga hing kisawl na hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na thei ngailou ham leh aham uh theiha nasah mite kunga hing sawl ka hi sih hi. Tuabang mite kunga hing sawl hileng pen na thugen angaikhe tham ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Israel innkuonten kei a ahing ngaikhieh lou zieh un, nang thugen zong angaikhe sih ding uhi. Aziehpen Israel innkuonte zousie milungpheng leh lungtangkhau ngen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai in amai uah na mai ka khau sahta a, na talpang amaute talpang masang ah khautahin ka hing bawlpiehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na talpang suong taah pen meisasuong sanga tahzaw bangin ka bawlta hi. Amaute giing sinlen, innkuon helhatte hinan u’leh amauh giingin lungke vawt sin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuathamlou in aman ka kungah, “Mihing tapa na kunga ka thugente zousie na lungtangin chiemte inlen na bil in za in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh na mipi saltangte kungah pei inlen, ngaikhie in ngaikhe ut sih u’leh zong, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, chiin akung uah va gen inlen vahil in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n hagau in ahing domtou a, ka nua langah vanpi ging banga ngai aw khat in, Tam mun a kipat in Mangpa thupina khu phat in umta hen, chi kaza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Silhingte ha khat leh khat kizaptuo ging leh agei ua kangtalai kengte ging lemlum husa zong ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n hagau in ahing domkang a ahing pomangta hi; lunggimtah leh lungthah pumin ka peita a, hinanleh Mangpa khut ka tungah ahat mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kebar luipi gei a Tel-Abib a um saltangte kung ka hing tung a, tualeh amaute touna ah ka tou a, alah uah lunggimna chizat huoitah in ni sagi ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh ni sagi abei tah in Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Israel innkuonte adinga galveng mi khat in ka hing bawlta hi, tuaziehin ka kam a thu ngaikhie inlen, kei akipat vauhilna amaute pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Migilou kungah na shi ngei ngei ding ahi ka chia, amauh vauhilna lah pelou a, tualeh ahinna uh huhhingna dinga, tua migilou khu a umdan gilou apat kihei dinga vauhilna thu na genlou leh, tua migilou khu agitlouna ah ashi dinga, hinanleh asisan maw nangma khut ah ka hing phul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh migilou khu na vauhila, hinanleh agitlouna apata akihei tuomlou a, a umdan gilou atawpsan tuomlou leh ama khu akhelna ah ashi dinga, hinanleh nangman na hinna na hunkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh midihtat in adihtatna apat akihei a, sil gilou abawl a, tualeh amasanga kipalpuona ka koi chiengin ashi ding hi. Nang ama kunga vauhilna na piehlou ziehin, akhelna ziehin na shi ding hi, tualeh adihtatna bawlsate akithei ngitnget sih dinga hinanleh amawna sisan khu na khut ah ka hing phul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh midihtat khu khiellou dinga na taihil a, akhel sih leh, aman vauhilna angaisah ziehin ahing ngei ngei ding hi, tualeh nang zong na hinna na humbit ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuamun ah Mangpa khut ka tungah a um a, Ama’n ka kungah, “Dingdoh inlen phaijang ah pei inlen, khunah kang houpi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka dingdoh a, phaijang ah ka peita hi, tualeh En vawi, Mangpa thupina khu Kebar luipi gei a ka mu bangin, khunah ading hi, tuachi’n ka mai a lei suin ka puata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n hagau ka sungah alut a, ka kengin ahing dingsah hi; tualeh ka kungah “Pei inlen, na inn ah kot vakikhumkha in, chiin ahing houpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh nang mihing tapa aw, ngaiin, na tungah khauhuol ahing baat ding ua, ahing kaan ding uhi, tuachi’n na mite lah ah na peidoh thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na lei na dang tawngah ka behsah dinga, na ham thei nawn sih ding hi, tualeh innkuon helhatte ahi zieh un, amauh na phawh nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh ka hing houpi chiengin, na kam ka hing kaah sah ding a, akung uah, “Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, chi’n na gen ding hi; Angaikhe ut in ngaikhie henlen, angaikhe utlou in, ngaikheda heh, aziehpen amaute helhatte innkuon ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Nang mihing tapa tungman tangkhat la inlen na mai ah koi inlen, atungah Jerusalem khopi lim gielin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh tami khopi kisimna dinga ki imkhumna lei kisep sangte bawl inlen, galkapte giehmun zong bawl inlen, kulbang suhsietna ding zawlte akimkot ah koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh sia peh khat zong la inlen, nang leh khopi kikaal ah sia bang dingin tung inlen, tua khopi lang mai ngat in, tua khopi imkhum in aum dinga, nangman tua khu na imkhum ding hi. Tami Israel innkuonte dingin chiemtena ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na veilam netpha in sihlup inlen, Israel innkuonte gitlouna a tungah nga in, atunga na lup sung ni phaza dungzuiin, agitlouna uh na puoh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen amaute gitlou sung kum phaza nang tunga ni phaza a sim ding ka hi, tuaziehin Israel innkuonte gitlouna ni zathum leh ni sawmkuo sung na poding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh tuate na bawl zou chiengin, na zietlang netpha in sihlup kia inlen Juda innkuonte gitlouna ni sawmli sung na poding hi; kum khat khu ni khat a sim ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin Jerusalem ki imkhum lang namaingat dinga na ban na hawh dinga, tua khopi tungah genlawhna thu na phuong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh en in, khauhuol in ka hing kaantom dinga, khopi na sim sung nite na bukim sah masangsie khat lang khat lang ah na kihei thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nangma a dingin, mangbu leh barli bu, be leh belite, mim leh taangte la inlen kuong sung khat ah koikhawm inlen tanghou in kibawl inlen, na pang khat netpha a na lup sung, ni zathum leh ni sawmkuo sungtengin na ne ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh na neh ding akite valeh dinga, nikhat in shekel sawmni ahi dinga, hunbi nei tah a na neh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tui zong tethaw in na dawn dinga, hin khat se guh suo sekhat, hunbi nei tah in na dawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Barli tanghou bangin na ne dinga, mihing eehgaw singa zangin amit mu uah na kang ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n, “Tambangin Israel taten amauh ka delmangna namte lah ah tuabang tanghou suhbuasa ane ding uhi, achi hi, chiin gen in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken, “Ehe, Mangpa Pasian, Ngai in, ka neu lai apat tutan in ka kibuasah nai sih a, ganhing amathu a shi leh gamsa in atha ahisihleh sa sienglou kidahhuoi mawngmawng ka kam sunga lut in, ka ne nai sih hi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama’n ka kungah, “En in, mihing eeh gaw taangin bawng eehgaw ka hing pedinga, tuami toh na tanghou na kang ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Ama’n ka kungah, “Mihing tapa Jerusalem a tanghou puohlut ka tawpsah dinga zauna toh tena a te detdet a hawm in tanghou ane ding ua, tui zong atena a te detdet in lamdangsahna toh adawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh ann neh tui dawn akichin louna dingun tambangin ka bawl ding a, khat leh khat lungkie in aki en tuo ding ua, agitlouna ziehun, amangthai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tualeh nang Mihing tapa, namsau hiemtah khat la inlen, samheute tem zah bangin zang inlen, na lu leh na khamul heu inlen, tuachiin a tena ding khat la inlen, tua samte te inlen khenzah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sethum suo sekhat, na khopi imkhum aum nite achin chiengin khopi sungah mei in hal inlen, se thum suo sekhat khu la inlen khopi kimkot ah, namsau in sat nen inlen, tualeh sethum suo sekhat dang pen hui lah ah thethang in: namsau dohkhie in ka nuadel sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh samzam tawmnoukhat la inlen, na puontuol mongah na tuun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuate lah apat tawmnoukhat la kia inlen, meikhua lai ah pailut inlen, haltum in, aziehpen tuana kipat in meikuong ahing pawtdoh dinga Israel innkuon sung zousie lah ah akuongdoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Tami Jerusalem ahi, namte laikim tah ah ka koi a, akimkot ah gamte ka um sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh ama khu akim avel a um namte leh gamte sangin ka dan thupiehte leh ka dan thugousiete dou in gitlouna bawl in ahel zawtham hi. Tualeh ka vaihawmte leh ka danthupiehte anuol ua, ka dan thuguosiete azui sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Na kim na vel ua umte sangin, na genha zaw ua, ka danthuguotte na zuilou ziehun, ka danthupiehte na kem sih uhi; hinanleh na kim na vel ua um namte vaihawmna dungzui in na gamta zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai un, Kei, keima ngelngel in ka hing dou ahi, tualeh namte mitmu in na lah uah thukhenna ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh na kidahhuoinate zousie zieh un, ka bawl ngainailou leh tuabanga ka bawl ngai nawn lou ding na tung uah ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin na lah uah, paten atapate uh sa ane ding ua, tapaten apate uh sa ane ding uhi; tualeh na lah uah thukhenna ka tungsah dinga, tualeh na lah ua asuohta umsunte hui lah ah ka thethang ding hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in, ka hinna sielin ka gen ahi, na sil mudahuoite u’leh na sil kidahhuoite zousie ua, ka munsiengthou na suhbua zieh un, Ken zong noute ka hing kiemsah dinga, kang hinkhawi sih dinga, lainatna mit in kang en sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na lah ua sethum suo sekhat natpi leh kielin na shi ding ua ashigam ding uhi; sethum suo sekhat na kimvel uah namsau in ashi ding ua, tualeh sethum suo sekhat hui lah ah ka hing thethang dinga, namsau dohsa in ka hing nuadel nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tambangin ka lungthahna ka tungsah dinga, ka thangpaina atung uah ka sungbaw ding a, ka lungkimta ding hi; tualeh, atung ua ka thangpaina ka sunbuoh hun chiengin, Kei Mangpa’n ka phattuom ngaina in thu ka genta, chi ahing thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuathamlouin, na kimvel ua um, namte lah leh na kung ua hing pei mi vahlete mitmu ah bangmalou leh segawpsa leh simmaw huoiin ka hing bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n thangpai tah leh lungthah mama a, nasatah a vauhilna toh na tung ua, ka hing vaihawmkhum chiengin, na kimvel ua namte adingin, simmaw um, nuizat nopna, vauhilna leh chizat huoi, na hi ding uhi. Kei Mangpa’n ka gensa ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na tung ua, shina, sietna leh kielna thaltang, zauhuoitah na tung ua ka hing sawl chiengin, noute sumang dingin ka hing sawl dinga, na tung uah kiel nasezaw sem in ka pungsah dinga, na hinna bul uh ann leh tuite ka sutawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n na tung uah kielna leh gamsagilou ka hing sawl dinga, ta leh nau bei in ahing koi ding ua, na lah uah natpi leh sisan suona atung dinga tualeh na tung uoh namsau ka hing tungsah ding hi, Kei Mangpa’n kana genzousa ahita hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa, Israel taangte lang ah na mai ngat inlen, amauh douna thumavang gen in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nou Israel taangte aw, Mangpa Pasian thu ngai un, Mangpa Pasian in, muol leh taangte kungah, kuomthuhte leh phaijawlte kungah tambangin agen hi. Ngai un, Kei, Keima ngelngelin na tung uah namsau ka tungsah ding a, na munsangte uh ka sumangthai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n na maitamte uh asegawp dinga, na gimnamtui maitamte uh achim dinga, tualeh keiman na mikithatte uh na milimte uh masang ah ka pai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate mishiluongte khu amilimte uh mai ah ka siel dinga; na gute uh na maitamte uh kimvel ah ka paithang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na tenna mun zousie uah, khopite khu tenna lou a nuasie in a um dinga, na mun sangte uh akisuse dinga, na maitamte uh a kisuchim dinga phietmangin a um ding hi; na milimte uh, akisatguoi dinga, akisuse ding hi, na gimnamtui maitamte uh akisattan dinga, tualeh na nasepte uh akiphietmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi kithatte na lah uah apua ding ua, tuachi’n kei khu Mangpa ka hi chi na hing thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Hinanleh gam china thethanga na um chieng un, namte lah a, namsau apat na suotat theina dingun, suohta um sun honkhat ka hing nuasie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n sal a kaimanga a umna uh namte lah a, suohta sunten Kei ahing thei ngitnget ding uhi. Aziehpen a angkawmna lungtangte ua, kei ahing kiheisan ua, amilimte uh lam nga a kizuana mit ha a, akimawlthang nua un, asilgilou bawlte u’leh asil kidahhuoi bawl zousiete ziehun amauleh amauh akimuda ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun Kei Mangpa ka hi chi leh atung ua sil hoilou ka bawl ding chia ka thugente amawhna ahisih chi athei ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: “Na khut bengin, na kengtaw tat inlen, Kadei Aw! Israel innkuonte gitlouna kidah huoi ziehin maw chiin, aziehpen namsau in, kiel in, tualeh natpi, in apua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gamlapi a umte natpi in ashi ding ua, anai a umte namsau in ashi ding ua, asuohta sunte leh hing khawi a umsunte kiel in ashi ding uhi. Tambangin ka thangpaina atung uah ka sungbaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n nouten amilimte zousie kunga gimnamtui alatna mun uh muol sang chinteng tungah, muolvum zousie tungah, sing hing chinteng nuoi leh gangpi sing bawhpha chinteng nuoia amaitamte uh kimkot a, amilimte ulah a, amikithatte a um chiengin, Kei khu Mangpa ka hi chi na hing thei ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute douin ka khut ka laam dinga, Diblah langa atenna mun uh gamdai zousie sanga sezawtham in ka bawl ding hi. Tua hun chieng in kei khu Mangpa ka hi chi ahing thei ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nang mihing tapa, Mangpa Pasian in Israel gam zousie kungah, tambangin agen hi: Tawpna ding! Gam ning li tungah, atawp na ding ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuin tawpna na tungah ahing tungta hi, na tungah ka lungthahna ka hing sawl dinga, na umdan dungzui in vai ka hing hawm khum ding a, na kidahhuoina zousie na tungah, ka hing thuhkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mit in nang ahing khawi sih dinga, lainatna zong ka hing nei sih ding hi. Hinanleh na umdante ka hing thuh ding a, na kidahhuoinate na lah uah a um ding hi. Tuachi’n kei Mangpa ka hi chi nang thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Sietna khat nua ah sietna, En in, ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tawpna ahing tungta, tawpna ahing tungta; nang dou dingin akhanglouta, En in ahing tung petma hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sietna na tungah ahing tungta hi. Aw nang gam sung a tengpa, Ahun a tungta, buoina ni anaita, Tang tung a lungnopna kikou hi lou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin ka thangpaina na tungah ka buohkhum pai dinga, ka lungthahna na tungah ka sungbaw ding hi. Na um dan dungzui in thu ka khen dinga, na kidah huoina zousie ziehin ka hing gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka mit in ahing khawi sih dinga, ka hing lainat sih ding hi. Na umdan dungzui in ka hing gawt dinga, na kidah huoina zong na lah uah a um ding hi. Tuachi’n Kei Mangpa khu nou hing gawtpa, ahi chi na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“En in, ni khu! En in ahing tungta! Na sietna ni apawtkheta, chieng khu apah ta a, kiletsahna amumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hiemngamna khu gitlouna chieng asuohta, amauh koima a umden sih ding ua, akiningchinnate u’leh ahausatnate uh, koima’n a kaa sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahun ahing tungta, ani ahing naita, aleite kipah sih uhenlen, azuate zong da sih uheh, aziehpen lungthahna khu abawn ua tungah tung ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azuatu inlah dam nalai nanleh asil zuasa amu kia nawn sih ding hi; aziehpen kilahna khu abawn ua tungthu ahi ngal a, koima anuakia sih ding ua, Koima gitlouna hinkhuo ah akisuhat zou sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Mizousie kiginna dingin pengkul amut ua, hinanleh kidouna ah koima akuon sih uhi aziehpen ka lungthahna abawn ua tungah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pulam ah namsau a uma, asunglam ah natpi leh kiel a um hi; gam a umte namsau in ashi ding ua, khopi sunga umte natpi leh kiel in ashi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dam a suohta umsunte khu, taang tungvumte ah phaijang vakhu bangin, aum ding uhi. Abawn un michin akhelna chiet uah, kap a lungzuong in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khut zousie azawi dinga, khup zousiete tui bangin anem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sai ip puon asil ding ua, zauna in atuomkhum dinga, amaisuo uah zumna akilang dinga, alutang zousie uh akieu sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Adangkate uh gawlzing ah apai ding ua, asanate uh siengthou loua ngai ahi dinga, adangkate u’leh asanate un, Mangpa lungthahna ni ah amauh ahundoh thei sih ding hi; ahinna uh ataisah sih dinga, agil uh zong avaa sah sih ding hi. Aziehpen tam agitlouna uh kipalpuana ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Akizepna kilawmna uh akiletsahpi ua, tuate akipat akidah huoina uh milimte leh, athanghuoina uh asuohsah zawsawp uhi; tuaziehin ama ua dinga silsienglou ka suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tamte gamdang mite khut ah gallah van dingin ka pedoh dinga, leitunga migiloute kungah gallah sum in ka pe ding hi, Amaun tami asubua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka mai ama-ua pat ka heimang dinga, Amaun ka mun siengthou asubua ding ua, suomhatte alut ding ua asubua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khainieng bawl un, “Aziehpen gam pumpi sisan suona gitlouna in adim siengta hi, tualeh khopi khu hiemngamna in adimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin namte lah a giloupen ka hing pui dinga, amaun a innte uh aluopieh ding ua, mi hatte Kisahtheina ka tawpsah dinga, amun siengthou uh suhbua ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Manthaina ahing tung hi, Amaun lungmuonna asui ding ua, a um sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sietna tungah sietna ahing tung dinga, thuthang tungah thuthang ahing tung ding hi. Tuahun chieng in guolneite apat mengmuna asui ding ua; Hinanleh siempute apat dan thu abeimangta dinga, upate apat thuhilna abeimangta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lengpa’n asuun dinga, lengpa tapa in lungkhamna puon asil dinga, gamsung mite khut akithing dinga, a umdan dungzui un ka bawl dinga, agamtatna dungzui un atung uah thukhenna ka bawl ding hi. Tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi ahing thei ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kum guhna, ahaguhna, tuomi ha ani nga ni in hichi ahing hia, Ka inn sunga ka tou a, Juda upate ka mai a atou laiun, Mangpa Pasian khut ka tungah ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka en a, ngai vawi, mihing lim leh melpuo meikuong banga hing kilang khat ka mu hi, akawng apat anuoilam bangdan a kilang meikuong ahi a, akawng apat atunglam teng sia ki emsan pempom taang setsot bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh aman khut bangbang khat ahing zankhie a, ka zangsam ahing man a; Hagau in van leh lei kikal ah ahing domkang a, Pasian apat mengmuna in Jerusalem huongsung inntuol sungnungzaw a mallam kulkotpi lutna ah ahing tut hi; khunah thangsietna tohthou milim a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh ngai vawi, phaijang a mengmuna ka mu bangin Israel thupina khunah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ka kungah, “Mihing tapa tuin mallam nga in dahtou vawi,” ahing chi hi. Tuachi’n mallam nga in ka dahtou a, maitam kotpi lutna ah, tam thangsietna milim ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaban ah zong aman ka kungah, “Mihing tapa bang ahiei abawl uh na mu ei, ka munsiengthou akipat gamlapi a ka peimang theina dinga Israel innkuonten sil kidahhuoi abawl uh na mu ei? Tuin kihei kia lachin akidah huoi zawsem silte na mu nalai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama’n biehinn huongsung lutna ah ahing zawpi hi; tualeh ka et leh bang vang khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman ka kungah, “Mihing tapa baang khu khuohin,” achi a, tuachia baang ka khuoh leh kot khat ana um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Aman ka kungah, “Lut inlen khuna sil gilou leh kidah huoi abawlte uh en in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka lut a, ka en a, aboh a vah ganhing leh gamsa kidah huoi chinteng lim leh baang tung kimvel a kigiel Israel innkuon milim zousie ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh tuate mai ah, Israel innkuon upate sawm sagi a dinga, amaute lah ah Shaphan tapa Jaazaniah ding ka mu hi. Michin in akhut uah gimnamtui halna hengdai atawi chiet ua, tua gimnamtui khu meilum bangin azamtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman ka kungah, “Mihing tapa Israel innkuon upaten miel lah a, michin in amauh milim pindan sung chiet a asil bawl uh na mu ei? Aziehpen amauten Mangpa’n eite ahing mu sih a, Mangpa’n gam ataisanta hi,” achi uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Ama’n ka kungah, “Kihei kia lachin asil bawl uh kidah huoi thupi zawsem na mu nalai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman mallam a um Mangpa inn kotpi lutna ah ahing zawpi a, tualeh ngai vawi, khunah Tammuz suun a kap numeite atou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman ka kungah, “Tami na mu ei, Aw mihing tapa? Kihei kia lachin, asil bawl uh kidah huoi thupi zawsem na mu ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman Mangpa inn huong sungnung zaw ah ahing puilut a, tua Mangpa biehinn lutna kotkha bul a innhim leh maitam kikaal ah pasal sawmni leh nga ding vel Mangpa biehinn nuangat in amai uh ni suolam ngain a um ua, tualeh amauten suolam nga in ni abie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ka kungah, “Aw Mihing tapa tam khu na mu ei? Juda innkuonte dinga tam mun a silkidah huoi abawlte uh sil neu nou ahiei mah? Aziehpen amaun gamsung hiemngapna in adim sahta ua, ahing sulungthah dingin ahing kinua heisanta uhi. Tualeh en un, anahkuo uah singba asiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin ken zong lungthah in amauh tungah ka gamta dinga, ka mitin mulou in akhawi sih dinga, lainatna zong ka nei vawt sih ding a, tualeh ka bil ah ngaitah in kikou nan u’leh ka ngaikhe sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama ka bilkawm ah aw ngaitahin akikoukhie a; “Khopi vengte zousie shi theina a galvan tawi chiet utoh hing naisah chiet un,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh kotpi sahtazaw mallam nga akipat in pasal guh mi tha theina galvan tawi chiet thakhat in ahing pei uhi. Alah ua mi khat in puonmalngat asil a, apangah laigielmi laitui bawm akuo hi. Amaute ahing lut ua, sum-eng maitam gei ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel Pasian thupina khu aumna ngai cherubimte akipat in Mangpa innkot bul ah apeitou hi. Tualeh Aman puonmalngat sil a apanga laigiel mite laitui bawm kuopa ahan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n akungah, “Khopi Jerusalem sung tuonsuoh inlen, asunga silkidah huoi bawlte zieh a dalekap a maute talpang ah chiemtena bawl in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh midangte kungah, “Ka zah ngelngel in Anuazui unlen khopi sung tuon suoh unlen, that unlen na mit un amu pouma khawi sih unlen, lainatna zong nei sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Putehte leh tangvalte, nungahte leh naupang neute, tualeh numeite, thatgam siengun, hinanleh chiemtena nei mite nai sih un, ka munsiengthou ah pan un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n amaun biehinn mai a um upate ah apan pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama’n akung uah, “Biehinn subua unlen ahuongsung mishi luongin dimsah unlen, pawtkhie un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n apawtta ua, khopi sungteng ah mi athat panta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n tambang ahing hi a, khopi sunga mi atha lai un, Keimatanga nuasie in ka um a, Ka mai a lei suin bohkhup in ka pua a, “AW MANGPA PASIAN” Jerusalem tungah na lungthahna na sunbuohna ah Israel umsunte zong abawn ua thatgam sieng ding na hiei mah,” chi in ka kikoukheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman ka kungah, “Israel leh Juda innkuonte khelna khu alien sengseng a, gamsung sisan suona in adima, tualeh khopi sung khu dihlouna in adimta hi; aziehpen Mangpa’n gam ataisanta a, Mangpa’n amu nawn sih, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Keima mit in zong mu manghil anei sih dinga, lainatna neukhat zong ka nei sih ding hi, hinanleh anasep dungzui un alutung chiet uah ka khuh sah ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuazou chetin tua puonmalngat sila apanga laitui bawm kuopa’n, “Na hing thupieh bangin ka bawlzouta chi’n thu ahing tut hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka en a, Cherubimte lutung zawn a vanthamzawl ah Saphire suongmantam hileh kilawm Mangtoupha mel bang pua khat ahing kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Aman puonmalngat silpa kungah, “Cherubimte nuoi a kangtalai kengte kikaal ah pei inlen, cherubimte kikaal a mei-am na khut dim in la inlen, khopi tungah thethang in, achi hi. Tuabanga ka et lai in ama ava lutta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua mipa ava lut laiin cherubimte Biehinn simlam pangah ading ua, tualeh huongsung sungta zaw dim in meilum ahing zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thupina khu cherubimte apat apeitou a, biehinn lutna innhim ah akhawl a, inn khu meilum in adimta hi; tualeh ainn huongsung leituol pumpi khu Mangpa thupina in atanvah sengsong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh cherubimte hazap ging khu Pasian bangkimbawlthei in thu agen chiengin awging bang maiin huongsung inntuol pawnungzaw dongin akiza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Ama’n puonmalngat silpa kungah thu apie a, “Cherubimte lah a, kangtalai keng kipeite kikaal a mei la in achitah in, ama ava lut pai a,” kangtalai keng gei ah ava dingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh cherub khat in, cherubimte lah a kipat in akhutin, cherubimte kikaal a mei-amte a sawh a bangza ahiei ala a, puonmalngat silpa khut sung ah akoi a, aman tua mei-amte ala a, apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cherubimten aha nuoi uah mihing khut bang nei in akilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka et leh, Cherubimte siih ah kangtalai keng li, cherub khat kungah kangtalai keng khat, kangtalai keng dang cherub dang khat chiet kung ah a um a, tualeh kangtalai kengte mel kilat dan khu beril suongmantam zem abang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua kangtalai keng lite amellat dan uh akibang chiet a, kangtalai keng khat sunga, kangtalai keng dang khat kikokal a kithuop abang chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pei chiengun cherub lite ngatna lam ah apei ua, apei chiengun akihei vateh sih uhi; hinanleh alutang ngatna lam lam ah apei ua, apei pumun akihei ngai vateh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Atahsa pumpi u’leh anua lam uh, akhutte u’leh ahate uh, tualeh kangtalai kengte zong akimkot in mit in adim a, kangtalai keng lite zong tuabang in mit in adim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kangtalai kengte khu, pingpei banga kipei ahi uh, kichi kaza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuate khat in mai li chiet anei ua, mai khatna khu cherubmai ahi a, mai nina khu mihing mai ahi a, mai thumna khu, humpibahnei mai ahi a, alina khu mupi mai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh cherubimte khu dopkangtou in a umta uhi. Tami Kebar lui panga ka mu silhing khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cherubimte apei chiengun, kangtalai kengte agei uah apei uhi; cherubimten lei apat leengtou dinga ahate uh azahtou chiengun kangtalai kengte khu amaute gei apat akihei tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cherubimte adin khinkhian chiengun, kangtalai kengte zong ading khinkhian uhi, cherubimte khat dopkanga a um chiengun, tamte zong amauleh amauh akidomkang mai uhi. Aziehpen silhingte hagau asung uah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thupina khu Biehinn lutna innhim akipat in apawtkhie a, cherubimte tungah ava dingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh cherubimten aha uh azahtou ua, ka mitmu in lei apat aleengtou ua, kangtalai kengte zong agei uah a um uhi, Mangpa inn lutna suolam kotpi bul ah ading chiet uhi, tualeh Israelte Pasian thupina amaute tungzawn ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tami Kebar luipanga Israelte Pasian nuoi a, ka silhing mu cherubimte ahi uh chi ka theikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaute’n maitang li chiet, ha lichiet anei ua, aha nuoi uah mihing khutte bang a um chiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh amaitangte uh kilat dan khu, Kebar luipanga ka mu maitangte bang bang ahi ua, amaute chiet masang zawn ah tangtah in apei chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hagau in ahing domkang a, suolam ngat a um, Mangpa inn suolam kotpi ah ahing tut a; tualeh ngai vawi, kotpi lutna ah pasal sawmni leh nga a um ua, alah uah mipite lamkai Azzur tapa Jaazaniah leh Benaiah tapa Pelatiah ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman ka kungah, “Mihing tapa tam mite khu khopi sunga sietna bawldohte leh lemguotna gilou pe mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amaute’n inn lamna ding hun anei naisih hi; tam khopi khu sa huonna bel ahi a, eite pen asa ihi uh, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaute dou in thu phuongzah in, Aw Mihing tapa va phuongzah in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa Hagau khu ka tungah ahing tunga, ka kungah, “Mangpa’n tambangin a gen hi vachi in, achi hi; Aw Israel innkuonte noute’n tambangin na gen uhi; na lungsim ua na geelte uh, ken ka thei suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam khopi sungah mi na that tam sem sem ua, na gawlzingte uh na mitha luongte un na dim sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: tam na lupsah uh na mithate luongte uh asa ahi ua, tualeh khopi khu asabel ahi; hinanleh tamte lah akipat in noute ka hing notdoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Namsau na ging ua, namsau na tung uah ka hing tungsah ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khopi apat noute ka hing notdoh dinga, gamdang mite khut ah ka hing pekhe dinga, na lah uah vaihawmnadih ka hing tut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Namsau in na pua ding ua, Israel gamgi ah na tung uah thu ka khen ding hi, tuachi’n kei Mangpa ka hi chi nang thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam khopi na sahuonna bel uh ahi sih dinga, noute zong alai a sa na hisih ding uhi, Israel gamgi ah na tungthu uah thukhenna ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh kei Mangpa ka hi chi nang thei ding uhi, aziehpen ka thugousiete leh ka vaihawmnate na zui sih uhi, hinanleh na kimvel ua um namte tawndan na zuizaw uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, tua banga genlawhna thu ka gen laiin, Benaiah tapa Pelatiah ashita mawh hi. Tuachi’n lei lam nga in bohkhupin ka pua a, aw ngaitah in ka kikou a, “Ah! Mangpa Pasian Israel shimawh umsunte nangawn beimangsah sieng talawm ding na hiei mah?” Ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tungkia a, ka kungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mihing tapa na saltaanpi na unaute, na hieng nasante leh Israel innkuon pumpi leh Jerusalem a teng zousiete’n, Mangpa akipat gamlapi ah um un, tam gam ka tan ding ua hing kipie ahi, na chite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: gamlapi a namte lah ah notmang nanleng tualeh gam tengah thethang nanleng zong ava peina gamte uah Keima hun tomkhat sung ama ua dingin amunsiengthou neu noukhat bang ka hi ding hi, chi in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Keima’n namte lah akipat ka hing puikhawm dinga, thethanga na umna uh gamte apat ka hing hankhawm ding a, Israel gam ka hing pe kia ding hi, chi-in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Khunah ahing pei ding ua, khuna silkidah huoite leh luohsuoh huoi zousie apaimang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken amaute lungtang khat ka pe ding a, amaute sungah Hagau tha ka koi ding a, atahsa ua pat asuong lungtang uh ka lakhe ding a, tualeh tahsa lungtang ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin ka danthute azui ding ua, ka thugousiete kem in azuita ding uhi. Amaute ka mite ahi ding ua, kei a Pasian uh ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh asil huot huoite u’leh asil kidah huoite uh lam a alunguh hei nalaite pen asil bawl uh bangin amauh lutung ah ka thuh ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in, achi hi,” chiin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Cherubimten akung ua um kangtalai kengte toh aha uh azahtou ua, tualeh Israel Pasian thupina atunglam uah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh khopi lai akipat in Mangpa thupina khu apeitou a, khopi suolam a muol tungah a khawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hagau in kei ahing domkang a, tualeh mengmuna in Pasian Hagau in Kaldai gam a saltaangte kung ah ahing tutta hi. Tuachi’n mengmuna khu kei apat in apeitouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n saltaangte kungah, Mangpa’n ahing musah zousie ka genta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa mihelhat innkuonte lah a teng na hi, muna ding mit nei napi mulou, zahna ding bil neinapi a zalou, aziehpen amaute innkuon helhatte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mihing tapa saltaanna a pei ding bangin na vante ziel in, kisa inlen amitmu uah suntang lai in kipandoh inlen na umna mun apat mun dang ah saltang ding bangin pei in. Tua hileh innkuon helhatte ahivangun atheisiem khamaw sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saltaang dingte bangin suntaang lai in amuna uah na vante na hing podoh ding hi, tualeh nitah lam chiengin amitmu uah, saltang dinga puidoh bangin na potdoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amitmu uah kulbaang khuohvang inlen khunah potdoh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amitmu uah na vante na liengkou ah puo inlen, khomui in pawtkhie in; tuol na mu theilouna dingin na mai tuom in; aziehpen Israel innkuonte a dingin nang chiemtena in ka hing bawlta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n thupieh a ka um bangin ka bawlta hi. Sunlai in ka vante saltang ding van puo bangin ka podoh a, tualeh nitahin ka khut in kulbaang ka khuohvanga, nitah khawmui in ka potdoh a, amitmu uah, ka vante ka liengkou ah ka puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh zingmawng in Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga, ka kungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mihing tapa, Israel innkuon helhatten na kung ah bang bawl na hiei, ahing chisih uh amah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaute kungah, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Tam puohgih khu Jerusalem leeng tapate leh alah ua um Juda innkuonte zousie tungthu ahi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei khu noute ading in chiemtena ka hi, chiin. Ka bawlsa bangbang in amaute tungah ka bawl ding hi; amaute saltaang dinga puimang in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A lah ua leeng tapa in, khomui chiengin avante aliengkou ah akipuoh dinga, apawtdoh ding hi. A potdohna ding kulbaang akikhuohvang dinga, amit a tuol amulouna dingin amai atuom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka len zong atungah ka zah dinga, ka thang ah a awh ding hi. Kaldaite gam Babilon khopi ah ka pui ding a, khuna shi ding ahivangin tua khopi amu sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama panpi dinga akim avel a umte zousie leh agalkapte zousie hui lah ah ka thethang dinga, namsau dohsa in amauh ka nuadel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Namte lah a amauh ka thethang a, gam chintenga ka thezah chiengin, Kei Mangpa ka hi chi ahing thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahivangin ama u’lah a tawmnoukhat namsau akipat, kiel akipat leh natpi akipat in ka khawi dinga, tuachia nam dangte lah a, apei na zousie ua, akidahhuoina zousie uh aphuondoh theina ding un. Tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi ahing thei ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung kia a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mihing tapa chitun kawm in na ann ne inlen, zau a kithing pum in na tui dawn in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gamsung mite kungah, Mangpa Pasian in Jerusalem leh Israel gam a tengte tungtang thu ah tambangin agen hi: Amauten lungdong pum in a ann uh ane ding ua, zau pum in atui uh adawn ding uhi, agam khu asunga tengte hiemngamna ziehin asunga sil um zousie phietmang a a um theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi tenna khopite zousie suhsiet in a um dinga, agam pen tennalou ahawm asuohta ding hi, tuachi’n kei Mangpa ka hi chi ahing thei ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga, ka kungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Israel gam a miten paunah ana nei uh: Nite asawt a mengmuna zousie lah bangma ahisih hi, kichi khu bang genna ahiei? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin amauh hil in, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Tami paunah ka beisah dinga, Israel gamsungah amauten paunah in azangkha nawn sih ding uhi. Hinanleh amaute kungah, mengmuna zousie atunkimna ding nite ahing naita, chi in gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen Israel innkuonte lah ah mengmuna dihlou leh kisolbawlna ai san mawngmawng a um nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aziehpen kei Mangpa ka hi, thu kagen a, ka thugen khu atangtung dinga, avaigei nawn sih ding hi; aziehpen Aw nou helhat innkuonte, ka thugen pouma na damsung un ka tangtung sah ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung kia a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Mihing tapa, Israel innkuonten, mengmuna amu uh, tu akipat kumtampi nua chienga hing tung ding ahi, tualeh hun gamlapi ding thu agenlawh ahi bou hi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in akung uah, tambang in agen hi: Ka thute khat zong avaigei nawn sih dinga, ka thugente pouma atangtung ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa, alung phut phut ua genlawhna gen Israel guolneite kalna in genlawhna gen inlen akung uah, Mangpa thu Ngaikhie un, chiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Bangma muchienna neiloupi a amauh lungsim ngaituona zui guolneite tung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Israel na guolneite khu khopi sesa nua a si-al umte bang giap ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa ni a kidouna a kulbaangte adinkip theina dingin, tua kulbaang kisete Israel innkuonte a ding a puopha dingin, na kuontou sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaun mengmuna dihlou leh zuouthu a aisannate amu ua, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: achi uhi. Hinanleh Mangpa’n lah amauh asawl sih a, hinanleh athugen uh tangtung dingin akinem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ke’n ka gen vawtloupi, ‘Mangpa’n agen hi, na chi ua, hinanleh mengmuna dihlou leh kisolna aisanna zuou thu giap na gen uh hilou ahiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Thuzuoupi na gente u’leh mengmuna dihloupi na mute uh ziehin, ngai un noute ka hing dou ahi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka khut in mengmuna dihlou mute leh zuouthu a aisan guolneite adou dinga; amaute khu ka mite kikhawmte lah ah atel sih ding ua, Israel innkuonte minkhumna ah zong gellut ahi sih ding uhi, ahisihleh Israel gam sungah zong alut sih ding uhi. Tuachi’n Kei Mangpa Pasian ka hi chi na hing thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen, azieh dihtah khu, amaun muonna umloupi, hamuong un, chiin ka mite ahenem uhi, tualeh kulbaang alep chieng un, amandet theilou senel in azut zol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua banga amandet theilou senel a zutzolte kungah, tua baang chim ding ahi chi’n gen in. Guopi nasatah azu dinga, gieltang lienpipi akedinga, khopi hui in anuoi chim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Adihtahin Kulbaang achip chiengin, mite’n na kung uah na zutmatna uh hei a umta ahiei ahing chisih dinguh amah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ka thangpaina khopihui langin ka phuse sah dinga, ka lungthahna guopi nasatah ka zusah ding hi, tualeh ka lungthahna gieltang lienpipi ten asumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n amantheilou senel a na zut uh kulbaang khu tuol dongin ka chimsah dinga, asuongphum nangawn ka dawhsah ding hi, achim dinga, alah ah suhmang in na um ding uhi. Tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi na hing thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tambangin ka lungthahna baang tung leh amandet theilou senel a zutte tungah ka subuching dinga, tualeh na kung uah, Baang a um nawn sih a, azutmat mite zong a um nawn sih uhi, ka chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuakhu Jerusalem tungtang thugen Israel guolneite muonna umloupi, ama a muonna dinga, mengmuna mute a um nawn sih uh, china ahi, Mangpa Pasian in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tuamabangin Mihing tapa, amauh lungtang apat a thugenlawh na mite tanute, kimaituopi inlen amauh kalin genlawhna gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, chiin: Numeiten mite ban a, zawldei ai bun sah a, mite hinna mat na dinga miliente lukhu khui numeite tung agih hi! Nouma hinna humbitna dingin ka mite hinna na sui tuom ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Barli bu sipdimkhat leh tanghou themkhat thalaw in, zuouthu ngainuom ka mite kunga zuouthu genin ashilou dingte that in, ashi dingte hingkhawi in, ka mite lah ah Kei na hing subua ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai un, vate mat banga ka mite hinna na matna uh na mitphieldawi ai bute uh ka muda a, na ban uapat ka bottan ding hi, va bang a thanga na mat uh ka mite hinna ka hakhe dinga ka pei sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na lu khuna dielte ka botkeh dinga, ka mite na khut apat ka hunkhe dinga, tuachi’n va bet banga na bet dingun na khut uah aum nawn sih ding uhi, Tuachi’n kei Mangpa ka hi chi na hing thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ken midihtat ka lunggim sah lou lai in, nouten zuouthu gen in midihtat na lunggim sah uhi, tualeh, ahinna humbitna dinga migilou a umdan gilou kiheisan ding lai kiheisan lou dingin akhutte uh na suhat zawsop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin nouten mengmuna dihlou na mu nawn sih ding ua, zuouthu zong na genlawh nawn sih ding uhi, aziehpen ken ka mite na khut uapat ka hunkhe ding a, tualeh kei Mangpa ka hi chi na thei ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel upate lawikhat ka kungah ahing haw ua ka mai ah ahing tou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualaitahin Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Mihing tapa tam miten alungtang uoh a milimte uh akoi ua, amasang uah kipalpuana khelnate akoi uhi, Kei amaute kankhiet in ka um ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin amauh houpi inlen akung uah; Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Israel innkuonte michin in alungtang ua milimte a um sah ua, amasang ua kipalpuana khelna akoi ua, guolnei mai a hing pei pouma, Kei Mangpa mama in amilimte tamdan dungzui in ka dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel innkuonten a milimte uh zieh a, ahing kituom bawlsan ziehun, alungtang ua ka mat theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Israel innkuonte kungah thu gen inlen, Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: Kisia unlen, na milimte ua kipat hing kihei unlen, na kidahhuoinate ua pat na maite uh heimang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel innkuonte lah a mi koi ahiei, ahisihleh Israel gam a teng mikhuol hitaleh, Kei akipat a kituomkoi a, alungtanga amilimte vom a, amasang a kipalpuana ding a khelna koi a, guolnei kunga keima tungtang dong dinga ava haw leh Keima Mangpa mama in ka dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua mipa khu ka kimaituopi ding a, ama khu mite chiemte leh Paunah in ka bawl ding a, ka mite lah akipat ama ka satkhe ding hi; tuachi’n kei Mangpa ka hi chi na hing thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh guolnei khu silkhat poupou gen dinga sol leh zawlzou a a umleh, Kei, Mangpa’n tua guolnei khu ka zawlzou ahi ding a, ama dou in ka khut ka lamtou dinga, ka mi Israelte lah akipat ama ka sumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaun agitlouna maw uh akipuoh ding ua, guolneipa zong ama kunga thukanpa toh akigawtna akibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel innkuonte kei akipat avahmang nawn sih ding ua, akhelnate zousie u’toh amauleh amauh akisubua nawn sih ding uhi. Tuachi’n amaute ka mite ahi ding ua, Kei a Pasian uh ka hi ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi,” chiin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung kia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Mihing tapa, gam khat in ka tung ah ginum louna toh gamta akhel chiengin, atungah ka khut ka laam dinga, tua gam ne leh taah kipieh tuona ka sattan dinga, atungah kiel ka sawl dinga, mihing leh sate gam sung apat ka tengsah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam mi thumte: Noah, Daniel, leh Job, tam gamsung ah na um nan u’leh, adihtatna un amauh hinna bep ahundoh ding uhi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ken tua gamsungah gamsate tuonsuoh sah in, tua gam nekhawngin, gamsate ziehin koima vah theilouna khopin kilawita leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam mi thumte nangawn gam sungah umnan u’leh keima ka hin zing mabangin, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi; tapate ahiei, tanute ahiei, ahundoh thei sih ding ua, amaute maimai hutdoh in a um ding uhi, hinanleh agam pen tenna giehna lou in akilawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ahisihleh tua gam tung a namsau ka lensah a, namsau kunga gam sung tuonsuoh inlen, mi leh sa thatgam in ka chi leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tam mi thumte gam sung ah umnan u’leh, Ka hinna sielin ka gen ahi, tapate hiin, tanute hitaleh ahundoh sih ding ua, hinanleh a mauh maimai akihundoh ding uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahisihleh tua gam sunga natpi ka sawl a, tua gam tungah ka thangpaina sisan, sungbuo in, asung a mi leh sate thatgam siengta leng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Noah, Daniel leh Job, asunga um manan u’leh zong, ka hinna siel in ka gen hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi, amauten tapa hiin tanu hitaleh ahunkhe sih ding ua, adihtatna un amauh maimai ahunkhe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Jerusalem khopi sunga mi leh sate thatgam dinga, tam Jerusalem tung a ka thukhenna chizat huoi li, namsau, kiel, gamsa giloute leh hiipi, ka sawl hun chiengin bang chitah a huoisie zaw ding ata diei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahivang in ngai un, khunah tapate leh tanute puidoh a um ding mi asuohta umsun honkhat nuasie in a um ding ua, ngai un na kung uah ahing pei ding ua, a umdan u’leh asilbawlte uh na mu ding uhi, tuachi’n Jerusalem tunga sietna ka hing tunsah pouma tungtang thu ah, ahi, atunga ka hing tunsah sil zousie toh kisai in hamuon in na umta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh a umdan u’leh a silbawlte uh na mu chiengun, ahing hamuon ding ua, atunga ka bawl zousie, azieh bei a ka bawl ahisih chi na thei ding uhi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa grepsing khu sing dangte sangin ahisihleh gammang sing laha ba khat sanga grep sing bangchi dan a hoizaw adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Silmanthei khat pou pou bawlna dingin grep apat sing akila ngai amah? Ahisihleh min van khaina dingin themkhet grepgui apat ala ngai uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuanahsangin, meikhuh ah akivang lut a, among lang ni tuoh, mei in akahtum chiengin alai meihol asuoh a, amanna ding a um eimah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai in, ahoilai in zong bangma phattuomna anei sih leh, akahtuma meihol asuoh nua in, bang in akimang thei nawn diei? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin a gen hi: Mei a vah dinga ka pieh, gammang singte lah a grep singte bangin, Jerusalem a tengte zong ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh amauh ka kimaituopi dinga, meikuong khat apat apei ding ua, meikuong dangin amauh akatum ding hi; tualeh amauh ka kimaituopi tah chiengin, Kei Mangpa ka hichi ahing thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaute aginumlou seng ziehun, tambanga tenna giehna lou in agam uh ka suse ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi,” chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Jerusalem akidah huoinate theisah inlen, akungah gen in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in Jerusalem kungah tambangin agen hi: Na kipatna leh na pienna khu Kanaan mite gam ahi a, na pa khu Amormi ahi a, na nu khu Hit mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na pienna thu ahileh, na pienni in na laigui at ahi sih a, na sienthouna dingin tui in ahing kisil sih a, chi ahing kinu sih a, puon in zong ahing kituom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tam silte na tunga bawl ding leh na tungah lainatna nei dingin koima mit in nang ahing hepi sih a, hinanleh gamlah a paidoh a um na hizaw hi, na pien ni akipat nasatah a deilou leh kidah na hiziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tualeh na kunga ka hing suohkhah laiin nangma sisan lah a na kipeh lai ka hing mu a, sisan lah a na kidie laiin, ‘Hing in’ ka hing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gamlah singnou dawng bangin ka hing khangsah a, tuachi’n na hing khang lien a, na hing piching a, nungah melhoitah na hing hita hi. Na nawite ahing baw a, na sam ahing sau a, ahivangin saguoh leh guohtang in na um nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Na kungah ka hing suohkia a, Ka hing en a, Ngai in na deihuoi hun laitah ahi a, tuachi’n na tungah ka puon mong ka hing zawn a, na guohtanna ka hing khupieh hi. Ahi, na kungah kihahsiel in ka kichiem a, tualeh nang toh thuhun ka bawlta hi, tuachi’n kei a na hing hita hi, Mangpa Pasian in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n tui in ka hing silsienga, Ahi, na tunga sisan bangte hoitah in ka silsienga, tualeh sathau ka hing nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puonzem hoitah ka hing silsah a, savunnem kengtodap ka hing bun sah a, tualeh puonmalngat ka hing silsah a, puonnem nouin ka hing tuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kizepna vante in ka hing zem a, na khut ah tau ka hing but sah a, na ngawng ah, khainieng ka hing awsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na nahkuo ah sana kuol ka hing khai pieha, na bil ah bilba ka hing butsah a, na lutungah lukhu hoileh kilawm kang khusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tambang in, nang pen sana leh dangka in na kizem a, na puonsilte puonmalngat, puonnem leh puonzem kilawmtahte ahi, na ann neh lah tangbuongnel hoite, khuoizu leh sathau ngen ahi, tuachi’n na mel ahing hoi mama a, leenggam khat hithei ding khopin na hing khangdoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na melhoina ziehin namte lah ah na minthangta a, na tunga ka koi thupinate ziehin ahing bukimta hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Hinanleh na melhoina na suongta a, na minthanna ziehin na kizuata hi. Koi hinanleh na kunga suohkha pouma kungah na mingaihatna na hohkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na puonsilte khenkhat na sutkhie a, na munsangte chituom tuom in na zem a, atungah na kizua hi. Tambang silte a um ding ahisih a, atun zong atun ngai ding ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka hing piehsa kizepna manpha, sana leh dangkate na la a, pasal milimte na bawl a, tuate toh ang na kawm a, na kizua nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na puonzem hoilekilawmte na la a, amaute na zawnkhum a, tualeh ka sathau leh ka gimnamtuite amasang uah na lan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na ann neh dinga ka hing piehsa, ka hing vahna tangbuong nel hoi leh sathau leh khuoizute zong amasang uah gimnamtui dingin na lui a, tuabang ahita hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuathamlou in tanu leh tapa kei ding na hing hinpiehte, na zawpi a, katum dingin akung uah kithoina in na lan hi. Tambanga na huasanna nasepte sil neutham ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka tate na that a, amaute meikuong lai ah na peisuoh sah a, meikuongah vangin na lan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na kidahhuoina zousie leh na huana nasep zousie ziehin, na khangdawn lai nite leh saguoh leh guohtanga sisan lah a na kipeh lai na theikha nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tuachi’n hichi ahing hi a, na gitlouna zousie nua in, Na tung agih hi, na tung agih hi, Mangpa Pasian in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangma ding munsiengthou na kilam a, tualeh gawlzing tengah nangma adingin munsangte na kibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lamkathuom chintengah nangma a dingin munsangte na lam a, na melhoina khu kidahhuoi na suohsahta hi. Na kunga hing suohkha pouma kungah, na pum in na kipha a, na huasanna na supung sem sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi etlahat salam a na innveng Izipt mite toh na kingai a, kei hing sulungthah dingin na huana na pungsah sem sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaziehin ngai in, nang douin na tungah ka khut ka laamta a, na ann mudan ngaina ka kiemsahta, tualeh nang hing muda mama Philistin tanute, na huasan dan hing zumpi mamate khut sungah a ut dandan ua ahing bawl ding un ka hing pedohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Assiria mite kung ah zong na kizua a, hunta chi na neilou ziehin, akung uah na kizua a, ahivangin na lungkim thei naituom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuathamlouin na kizua thangtatna in, summet bawlte gam, Babilon dongchieng ah na pungsah semsem a, tambangteng nangawn ah na lungkim zou nai nalai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Bangzata a lungtang zawngkhal nei va-ia talawm a, tambang a numei tele kizuanu umdan banga um talawm na hiei, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lamkathuom chintengah mun sesang na kibawl a, gawlzing tengah inn sang na kilam hi. Ahivang in aman na lah lou ziehin kizua zong na bang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nang zi angkawm, apasal sanga midangte deizaw nu na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Miten kizuate kungah aman ape zel ua, hinanleh nang na angkawmpite kungah aman na pezaw a, heisung mun pou a, nang ahing zot ua, ahing luppi theina dingun, na golgu zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na kizuana thu ah koiman nang luppi dingin ahing chiel sih ua, nangman aman na pieh zawsop a, nang aman ahing kipieh lou ziehin numei dangte toh kilebul na hi, tuaziehin nangpen akilebul na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Tuachi’n tuin Aw nang kizuanu, Mangpa thu na ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, Na kidahhuoina sunbuoh a um a, na angkawmpite toh na pahtatna zieh a, na guohtanna na dohsah ziehin leh akidahhuoi mama na milimte ziehin leh, na tate sisan amaute kunga na pieh ziehin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuaziehin pellouin, nuom na sahpi na angkawmpite zousie leh na itte zousie leh na mudate zousie nangma dou dingin, ka khawm khawm ding a, na kimkot ah ama uh ka hankhawm dinga, amaute mai ah na puonsil ka hawhkhe dinga na guohtanna amu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh nang khu kiten dan botsie leh sisansuo numei vaihawmkhum bangin ka hing vaihawmkhum dinga, Ka thangpaina leh thangsietna sisan phuba na tungah kala ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Akhut sung uah ka hing pelut dinga, amaun na mun dawsangte asuchim ding ua, na munsangte asuse ding uhi. Amaun na puonsilte ahing hawhkhiet pieh ding ua, na suongmantam kizepna hoite ala ding ua, saguoh leh guohtangin ahing nuasie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amaun nang hing dou dingin mipi ahing zawpitou ding ua, suongin ahing sep ding ua, namsau in ahing satnen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Na innte uh mei in ahal ding ua, numei tampite mitmu in na tungah thukhenna abawl ding uhi; tualeh ken na kizuana ka tawpsah dinga, na angkawmpi ding koima na lei nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuachi’n na tunga ka lungthahna ka khawlsahta dinga, ka thangsietna nang akipat akiheimang dinga, ka sip khin khian dinga, ka lungthah nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Na khangdawn lai nite thei ngitnget lou a, tam silte zousie a na hing suh lunggim tah ziehin, Ken zong na silbawlte, pellou in na lutungah ka hing thuh ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi. “Na kidah huoina zousie belapna dingin tambang huana na bawl nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ngai in, michin paunah zang pouma in, na tungah tami paunah azang ding uhi, Tanu in anu asun hi, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nang pen apasal leh atate muda, na nu tanu na hi a, tualeh apasalte u’leh atate uh muda sanggam numeite sanggam numei na hi, na nu khu Hitmi ahia na pa Amormi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Na u numei khu Samaria ahi a, ama atanute toh nanga kipat mallam ah ateng ua, tualeh na nau numei khu nanga pat simlam ateng Sodom leh atanute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Amauh umdan banga na um a, asilkidahhuoi bawlte uh na bawl guoh hilou in, hun tomnou khat sungin amaute sangin, na hing sezawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ka hinna siel in ka gen hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi: Na sanggamnu Sodom leh atanuten zong, nang leh na tanute bawl bangin abawl sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />En in, tami na sanggamnu Sodom khelna ahi: Ama leh atanute, akisathei ua, ann nehval anei ua, nuomsa tah in a um ua, ahivangin mizawng leh tasamte apanpi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tualeh akithupisah ua, Ka masang ah silkidahhuoi abawl uhi, tuaziehin ka mu bepin amauh ka lamangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Samaria in na khelna bawl kimkhat zong abawl zou sih hi, hinanleh amauh sangin na kidahhuoina na supung sem sem a, na kidahhuoi bawlte ziehin na sanggamnute siem na tangsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Na sanggamnute awimawnuin, amaute sanga silkidahhuoi na bawltam zoh ziehin leh na khelnate ziehin, na zumnate nangman na kikhuh ding ahi; amaute khelna sangin, nangma khelnate akidahhuoi zawh ziehin, nang sanga amaute dihtatzaw a kilang uh ahi. Ahi, na sanggamnute dihtatzaw a kilangsah na hi zieh in maizum inlen, na zalatna ki puoh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />“Asaltaanna ua pat ka hing pui kia a, Sodom leh atanute leh Samaria leh atanute a saltaanna ua pat ka hing puidoh kia hun chiengin, amaute lah a nangma saltaangte zong asaltaanna ua pat ka hing puikia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ama ua dinga hamuonna na hi tahzieh a, na zalatna na kipuoh a, na silbawlte zousie na zumpi theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Na sanggamnu Sodom leh atanute masanglai a adinmun ua ahing umkia chieng un, tualeh Samaria leh atanute masanglai a adinmun ua ahing umkia chiengun, nang leh na tanute zong masanglai a na dinmun uah na hing umkia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Aziehpen na kiletsah lai in na sanggam nu Sodom na kam in na genkha ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Na gitlouna mudoh ahi masangin. Tuinvang Siria tanute leh akimvela mi zousie, na kimvel a um Philistin tanute leh akimvel a mi zousie, na kimvel a um Philistin tanute simmaw in na umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Na huana leh na kidahhuoina khelna leh gawtna na kipuoh ahi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, Thuhun palsan a, kichiemna khoh nasah lou ziehin na silbawl bang bangin in ka hing thuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ahivang in na khangdawnlai nite a, nang toh ka thuhun ka thei ngitnget ding a, nang toh kumtawn thuhun ka hung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tuachi’n na u numeite leh na nau numeite, na mu chieng in, na umdante na hing thei ngitnget dinga na zumta ding hi; Ken amaute na tanute hi dingin na kungah ka hing pe dinga hinanleh nang toh ka thuhun zieh ahisih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tualeh nang toh ka thuhun ka sudet ding hi. Tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi na hing thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Na silbawlte zousie ka hing ngaidamtah chieng in, na zumnate na thei ngitnget a, zalatah a um ding na hi ziehin, ham dingin na kam na kaah nawn sih ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa thuhasa khat podoh inlen, Israel innkuonte kungah gentena thu khat gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambang in thu agen hi: Muvanlai lientah, ha lienpi leh sautah nei amul zetuom tuom a pawl bielbuol khat Lebanon ah ahing leenga, sidar singkung sangdawn ah atu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azih dawng sang pen atutan a, summet bawlna gam ah apuo a, summetbawlte khopi ah asuonta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman agam haichi zong ala a, lei hoina mun ah a suon a, tui kiningchinna mun ah akoi a, huisum sing bang in asuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh ahing khangdoh a, grepgui bazam ngiem bilbel, abate ama lam a zamlut, hinanleh ahuite a nuoi ah a umden hi. Tuachi’n grepgui ahing suoh a, abate ahing mengdoh a, anate ahing selnouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Muvanlai lientah, ha lienpi leh mul tampi nei dang khat ahing um hi. Ngai vawi, tami grepgui in ama lam ah ahuite aha a, abate azam sah hi, akisuonna leikuohte a tui abuoh theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abate ahing zamdoh theina ding leh, ahing ga theina dingin, Tualeh grepgui hoitah ahing hi theina dingin, tui tampi gei a, lei hoina mun a kitha suonkia ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: Tami grepgui ahingdoh zouna diei mah? Ahuite a botdohin, agate muot sah in, ana tha hing selnoute vuoisah in, apulsah sih ding amah? Ahui pum a botdoh dingin, ban thahat leh mi tampi angai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mundang ah kitha suonkia nanleh, akhangdoh zou na dieimah? Suolam hui in asem chiengin, avuoi gawp sih ding amah? Apouna mun mama ah, avuoi ding hi,” achi hi, chiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu ka kung ah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tuin helhat innkuonte kungah, Tam silte bang genna ahiei chi na theisih uh amah? Chi inlen, Babilon leengpa Jerusalem ah ahing pei a, leengpa leh amiliente Babilon lang ah azawpita hi, chi in hil in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh aman leengpa hah leh suon mi khat aman a, thuhun abawlpi a, kichiemna aneisah hi. Aman gamsung a mihatte zong apuimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aleenggam aloingiemna ding leh ama thu a adindoh zou lou a, hinanleh athuhun zuina zieh a adindoh theina ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh sakolte leh galkap tampite pe ding a ngen dingin Izipt ah palai sawlin Babilon leengpa tungah ahelta hi. Alawching na diei? Tambang silte bawlpa asuohta na diei? Thuhun palsanin asuohta na diei? Chiin hilin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahinna ka hin laisie Mangpa Pasian in achi hi; pellouin, ama leeng a pangsahpa, kichiemna a simmaw pieh a, athuhun bawl apalsan piehpa leengpa tenna mun Babilon mama ah ashi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kidouna a mi tampi thaliana ding a, lei sesang leh kulte abawl hun chiengun zong, Pharaoh leh agalkap hon hatte leh pawl thupitahten zong, ama dingin bangma abawlpieh thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuhun palsan in, kichiemna asimmawta a, en in, thuchiem dinga akhut apieh nua a, tam silte zousie abawl mawhpen, asuohta vawt sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ahin a ka hinlaisie, pellou in, asimmaw kichiemna leh apalsan tua thuhun ama lutung ah ka thuh ngei ngei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tung ah ka lenthang ka zah ding a, ka thang ah a awh ding hi. Tuachi’n Babilon langah ka zawpi dinga, ka tunga abawl khelnate ziehin khunah ama ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Apawlte toh taizah zousie namsau in ashi ding ua, asuohta sunte hui lah ah ka thethang ding a, tuachi’n Kei Mangpa’n tam thu ka gen ahi chi na thei ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi. “Keima mama in sidar sing sang pen, dawn a azih sangpen ka la dinga, ka suon ding hi. Azihpipen azih dawng ngihngeh khat ka hiehtan dinga, muol kitawi leh sang pen ah ka suon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel muolsangte ah ka suon dinga, abate ahing nei dinga, ahing ga dinga, tualeh sidar sing hoitah ahing hi ding a, anuoi ah va chinteng ateng ding ua, abazam himte lah ah bu abawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gamlah a singte zousie in, Kei Mangpa’n sing sangte ka luoi ngiem a, sing ngiemte ka sangsah a, sing hingte ka gawsah a, sing gawte ka hing sah hi, chi athei ding uhi. Kei Mangpa’n kagenta a, ka tangtung sahta hi,” chiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung kia a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Pate’n grep thua ane ua, tate ha aza hi, chi a Israel gam tungtang a tam paunah na zah uh bang na china uh ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahin a ka hinlaisie, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi, Israel gam ah tami paunah na zang nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai un, hinna zousie kei a ahi a, Pa hinna mabangin tapa hinna zong kei a ahi; khelna bawl hinna pouma ashi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Hinanleh mi adihtat a, dan bang leh thudih abawla ahileh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />muol tunga aneh ngailou a, Israel innkuonte milim pasiente en a, adahtou lou a, a innvengpa zi asuhbua lou a, numei sinei lai ava luppi lou a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Koimakhat zong asuhgenthei lou a, leiba mi kunga akichiemna silkham apieh kia a, hiemngam taha mi asuomlou a, gilkielte kunga ann neh ding apieh a, guohtanga umte puon apieh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a pung del a leitawi sah lou a, sum pung zong la lou a, gitlouna apat akhut anua lahkia a, mihing leh mihing kikaal a, thukhenna dih abawl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka danthupiehte azui a, ka vaihawmnate ginumtah a akep leh, Ama mi dih ahi a, ahing ngeingei ding hi! Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Aman tapa ahin a, suomhat, ahisihleh sisan suomi khat, tualeh tam silte lah a khat pen pen bawl ahi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Abawl dinga mawpuohna silte bawllou a, ahivanga muoltung a biehna innte a aneh a, a innvengpa zi asuhbua a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />mi zawng leh tasamte asuhgenthei a, hiemngam tah a asuom a, Leiba kichiemna silkhamna anuapieh lou a, milim pasiente amit a entou a, ahisihleh silkidahhuoite bawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sumpung del a mi aleitawi sah a, apung alah a ahileh tuabang mi ahing diei? Ahing sih ding hi! Tambang silkidahhuoite abawl leh, ashi ngeingei ding a; asisan maw ama tungah a tuding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Hinanleh tam mipa’n tapa khat nei henlen, apa silgilou bawl zousie amu a, angaituo a, tuabangin abawl sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />muoltungte ah ane sih a, Israel innkuonte milim pasien lang en in amit ahahtou sih a, a innvengpa zi asubua sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Koima bawlgenthei lou a, leiba mi kichiemna silkhamna atuhdenlou a, hiemngam tah a suomlou a, hinanleh gilkielte kunga ann pie a, saguoh a umte puon asil sah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />mizawngte akipat a akhut nualah a, sumpung leh amet lalou a, ka vaihawmte zui a, ka danthupiehte bang a gamta mi khu, apa khelna ziehin ashi sih ding a, ahing ngei ngei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Apa ahileh, aman tatsetah in mi asugenthei a, hiemngamtah a a sanggampa a suom ziehin, tualeh amite lah a, ahoilou silte abawlziehin, En in akhelna zieh in ashi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Hinapi in nouten, bangzieh a tapa in apa khelna polou ding ahiei? na chi uhi. Tapa in danbang leh adih abawl a, ka thupiehte azui a, abawl zieh in ahing ngei ngei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi hinna khiel pouma ahi ashi ding. Tapa in apa mawna aposih ding a, pa in zong tapa mawna aposih ding hi. Midihtat dihtatna khu ama tung ah a um dinga, migilou gitlouna zong ama tung ah a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ahivang in migilouin khelna a na bawl zousie akiheisan a ka thupiehte zousie azui a dan bangtah leh adih abawl leh, tuabang mi khu ahing ngei ngei dinga ashi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Asilbawl khelsate khatbeh zong atungah thei ngitnget ahi nawnta sih ding hi, asildih bawlte ziehin ahing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Migiloute shina ah ka kipah ngai mawngmawng amah? A umdan ua kipat ahing kihei ua ahin chiengun ka kipah zaw sih amah? Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh midihtat khat, adihtatna apat kilehei henlen, khelna bawl in, migiloute silbawl kidahhuoite bawlta leh ahing diei mah? Adihtatna bawlsa zousie khat beeh zong thei ngitnget ahi nawnta sih ding hi; a ginumlouna zieha gitlouna abawlte leh akhelnate ziehin ashi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Hinanleh nouten Mangpa lampi adih sih, na chi uhi. Israel innkuonte aw tuin Ngai un, Ka lampite adih sih amah? Nou lampite hilou i adih louzaw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Midihtat adihtatna apat akilehei a, khelna abawl a, akhelna bawlte a ashi leh akhelna bawl ziehin ashi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahivang in migilou khat agitlouna bawlsate apat akilehei a, dan bang leh dihtah a abawl leh ahinna a hundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Akhelnate zousie angaituo ngetngut a, tuate akiheimangsan zieh in, ahing ngeingei ding a, ashi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh Israel innkuonten Mangpa lampi adihsih na chi uhi. Israel innkuonte aw, Ka lampite dihlou maw? Nou lampite hilou i adih lou?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Israel innkuonte aw, thukhenna hing bawl khum ding ka hi, michin agamtat dan dungzui ua, thukhen ding ka hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi. Kisia unlen na khelnate zousie ua pat kihei un, tuachi’n na khelna uh khu na manthaina uh ahisih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na sil bawlkhelsate zousie uh nou akipat paimang unlen, lungtang tha leh hagau tha kiguon un. Israel innkuonte aw, bangzieha shi ding na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aziehpen koima shina ah kipahna ka nei sih hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi. Tuaziehin lunghei unlen hing un.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaban ah Israel leeng tapate adingin, kaateng lou inlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh na nu khu bang ahiei? Humpibahneinu ahi: Humpibahneite lah ah a lum a; Humpibahnei lunlaite lah ah, anoute avah lien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman anoute lah a khat avah lien a, humpibahnei hattah ahing hita a, Samat dan ahing kizil a, mihingte nangawn anegamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Namten zong ama tungtang azata ua, ahumtawna sung uah amanta ua, tualeh siakhau a khi in Izipt gam ah ahing tutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama’n angah thawn a, a lawsam a, akinepna abeita chi a mu tahin, anoute lah a khat ala kia a, humpibahnei hattah in abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Humpibahneite lah ah avah kawi a, humpibahnei hattah ahing hita a, aman samat dan ahing zil a, mihingte nangawn anetumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman akulpite uh aphetgawp a, akhopite uh tenna louin akoi a, ahumhamna in gam leh, asunga um zousie azausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamkai munchin akipat in, namten ama adou ua, atungah alenthangte uh azahkhum ua, ahumtawkuoh uah amanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siakuoi toh abawm sungah akhum ua, Babilon leengpa kungah ahing zawpi ua, ahawh ging Israel taang tungte a, akizah nawnlouna dingin, kulpi sungah akhumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na nu u’khu na grep huon ua, tui gei a kisuon grepgui bang ahi a, tui atam ziehin ga tamtah asuonga abawhpha mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman vaihawm mite leengchieng ding, akung khautah tah anei a, abazam dangte lah ah asang pen a, abawhpha mamate khupin akimu thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh ama khu lungthahna a bawdoh in a um a, tuol a pai in a um a, suolam hui in agate asem gawta a, aba khautah tahte atawng a, avuoi siengta a, mei in akatum siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuin ama khu gamdai ah, gamgaw leh tui umlouna ah akisuonta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abate khat akipat mei ahing kuonga, tuamin agate akatumta hi, tuachi’n Vaihawmna dinga leengchieng ding, akung khau a um nawnta sih hi. Tami Kaala ahi a, Kaatenga sah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Akum sagina, aha ngana, ani sawm niin Israel upate pawl khat Mangpa thu kan dingin ahing haw ua, ka mai ah atou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Mihing tapa, Israel upate houpi inlen akung uah Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Kei thu kankhe dinga hing pei na hi uh amah? Ahin a ka hinlaisie noute kankhiet dingin ka um sih ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaute tungah thu na khen ding amah? Mihing tapa aw amaute na vaihawm khum ding amah? Apu apate uh kidahhuoina akung uah theisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Akung uah, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Israelte ka tel ni in, Jakob innkuonte hah leh suonte lam ah banzah in ka kichiema, Izipt gam ah amaute kungah Keima ka kitheisah a, banzah in ka kichiem a, akung uah, Kei Mangpa na Pasian uh ka hi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuani in, Izipt gam a kipat amaute ka puidoh dinga, ama ua ding a ka suikhiet nawitui leh khuoizu a luonna gam, gam zousie lah a hoi pen ah ka puilut ding chi in, banzah in ka kichiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua hunlai in amaute kungah, noute michin in, enlatah a na et uh milim kidahhuoite na mit ua pat paikhie unlen, Izipt gam milimte in kisubua sih un, Kei Mangpa na Pasian uh ka hi chiin thu ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh amauh ka tungah ahel ua, ka thu amang sih uhi. Amaun amit ua pat silkidahhuoite zousie apaimang ut sih ua, Izipt gam milimte ataisan tuom sih uhi. “Tuachi’n ken Izipt gam ah atung uah ka lungthahna ka sungbaw ding a, ka thangpaina ka tangtung sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahivang in Izipt gam akipat, amauh ka puidoh na dinga, amitmu ua ka kitheisahnate leh alah ua aumna uh namte masanga ka min subua a aumlouna dingin, ka min ziehin ka bawlzawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin Izipt gam pawtsan dingin amaute gamdai ah ka hing puita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh ka danthubawlte ka pie a, ka danthupiehte zong ka theisah hi; tuate zui pouma ahing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuatebanah Kei leh amaute kikaal a chiemtena hi dingin ka khawlnite zong ka pie hi, Kei amauh susiengthou Mangpa ka hi chi atheina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Israel innkuonte gamdai ah ka tungah ahelta ua, ka danthubawlte azuisih ua, ka danthupiehte mi’n azui a ahileh ahinna ding uh hinapi, asimmaw uhi, tualeh ka khawlnite nasatah in asubua uhi. “Tuachi’n ken gamdai ah amauh thatgam dingin ka lungthahna atung uah ka sungbaw ding hi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahivang in amitmu ua amauh ka hing puidohna namte masangah suhbua a, a umlouna dingun ka min ziehin ka bawlzawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute ka piehsa gam, zousie lah a hoipen, nawitui leh khuoizu luonna gam ah amauh ka puilut sih ding chiin, gamdai ah banzah in ka kichiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen amaun ka vaihawmnate a simmaw ua, ka danthubawlte azui sih uhi, hinanleh ka khawlnite a subua uhi, alungtangte un amilimte uh azui ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahivang in ka mit in amaute sumanglouin a khawi a, gamdai ah amauh ka beimang sah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Hinanleh gamdai ah atate uh kungah, Na pu napate uh danthubawlte zui sih unlen, avaihawmnate u’zong zui tuom sih unlen, amilimte uh zong kisubua sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei Mangpa na Pasian uh ka hi. Ka danthubawlte zui unlen, Ka vaihawmnate kemching unlen bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh ka khawlnite noute leh keima kikaal a chiemtena hi dingin siengthou sah un, tuachi’n Kei Mangpa na Pasian uh ka hi chi na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahivang in atate uh ka tungah ahel ua, Ka danthubawlte azui sih ua, Ka danthupiehte zui dingin apilvang sih uhi, mi’n tuate azui u’leh ahing ding uh chi hinapi, azui ut sih uhi; hinanleh ka khawlnite asubua uhi. “Tuachi’n amaute tungah ka thangpaina ka sungbaw ding a, gamdai ah amaute tungah ka lungthahna ka tangtung sah ding ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahivang in ka khut ka nualah kia a, amauh mitmu leh amauh ka puidohna namte mitmu a ka min suhbua a aum louna ding in ka min ziehin ka bawlzawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Namte lah ah amaute ah ka thezah dinga, gamte lah ah ka thethang ding, chiin gamdai ah amaute kungah banzah in ka kichiem nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen amaun ka danthupiehte azui sih ua, ka danthubawlte asimmaw ua, Ka khawlnite asubua ua, amitte un apu apate uh milimte alunggul uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaziehin danthubawl hoiloute leh ahin zoulou na ding uh vaihawmnate ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh amauh khu asilpieh mama uah ka subua a, ta masa pouma mei apeisuohsahna uah, Kei Mangpa ka hi chi ahing theina ding ua, amauh ka thagam theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Mihing tapa Israel innkuonte houpi inlen, akung uah, Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: Tam thu ah zong na pu na pate un kei ahing gensie ua, ahing suminse nalai uhi, chiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khut zah hiel a kichiem a amauh ka pieh gam a ka puilut tahin, muol sangte leh sing bawhpha chinteng amu ua, Kei hing lungthah sah dingin akithoinate uh alan ua, asilla thangpai huoite uh apie uhi. Amaun khunah gimnamtuite alan ua, adawn sillatte uh asungbuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken amaute kungah, Tam nava hawna zel uh mun sangte bang ahi mawng a ahiei? Ka chi hi. Tuachi’n khum mun min khu tuni tan in Bamah akichi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaziehin Israel innkuonte kungah, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Na pu napate uh dungsun in nouma kisubua in, asilkidahhuoi bawlte uh banga kizua ding na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aziehpen sillatte na lat chieng un leh, na tapate uh meikuong lai a na peisuohsah chiengun, tuni tandongin na milimte ua nouma leh nouma kisubua nalai lai na hi uhi, tuachi’n Israel innkuonte aw, Kei noute kankhiet ding ka hina amah? Ahin a ka hin laisie, noute kankhiet in ka um sih ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Pasian theilou namte bang leh gamdang mite bangin singbul suongbul be mi ihi ding uh chia na lungsim ua, hing um vang ahi ngaingai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Ahin a ka hin laisie, pellou in khut hattah leh banzah pum in, tualeh lungthahna kisungbuo in na tung uah vai ka hawm ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khut hattah toh banzah pum in, tualeh lungthahna kisungbuo toh, namte lah a kipat leh, thezah a na umna uh gamte akipat in ka hing puikhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh noute mipite gamdai ah ka hing puilut dinga, khunah kimaituo in, na tung uah thukhenna ka hing tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Izipt gam, gamdai a na pu napate uh tunga thukhenna ka tut bangin, noute tungah zong thukhenna ka hing tun ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chieng nuoi ah ka hing lutsah dinga, thuhun kikankhawm sungah ka hing puilut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Na lah ua pat mi helte leh ka tunga khielte ka susieng dinga, khuolzin tambang a aumna gam ua kipat ka puidoh dinga, hinanleh Israel gam ah vang alut sih ding uhi. Tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi na hing thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Noute na hi u’leh, Aw Israel innkuonte, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Noute na milip un pei unlen, na milimte uh va kibieh un; tunua chieng a zong ka thu manglou ding na hi u’leh, hinanleh na silpiehte u’leh na milimte un ka min siengthou subua nawn sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Aziehpen ka muol siengthou, Israel muolsang tungah, khum gam a um Israel innkuonte’n abawn un ka nna asem ding uhi; khunah amauh ka sang dinga, tualeh khunah na sillatte u’leh, na kithoina uh na ga masate u’leh, na silsiengthoute zousie uh ka sang theita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Namte lah apat ka hing puidoh a, thezah a na umna gamte ua kipat ka hing puikhawm hun chiengin, gimnamtui mama bangin ka hing sang ding a, namte masang ah noute ah suhsiengthou in ka umta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuachi’n na pu na pate uh kung a pieh dinga banzah a ka kichiemna gam a ka hing puilut hun chiengin, Kei Mangpa ka hi chi na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tualeh khunah na umdante u’leh na sil bawlte ua na kisuhbuanate zousie uh na theidohta ding ua, tualeh na sil bawl hoiloute zousie ziehin nouma leh nouma na kikidahta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Na umdan giloute uh ahisihleh na silbawl setahte uh bang hilou a, ka min zieh a noute ka hing bawlzoutah chiengin, Kei Mangpa ka hi chi na thei ding uhi, Aw Israel innkuonte, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Mihing tapa na mai simlam ngat inlen, simlam douna in thu gen inlen, simlam gammang demna in thu genlawh inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />tualeh simlam gammang kungah, Mangpa thu ngai khie in, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, chi in, Ngai in na sung ah mei ka tawkuong ding a, na sunga sing hing chinteng leh singgaw chinteng akatum ding hi, meikuong amit sih ding a, simlam apat mallam tandong in, maitang zousie a sanggaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Michin in tua mei khu kei Mangpa’n ka tawkuong ahi chi amu ding ua, akiphelmit zou sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken “Ah, Mangpa Pasian! Kei khu, Gentena thu gen hibou lou amah? ahing chi ding uhi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kung ah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa na mai Jerusalem lam ngat inlen, mun siengthou douna in thu gen in, tualeh Israel gam douna in genlawhna thu gen inlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel gam kungah, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi chi in, Ngai in, Ka hing dou ahi, Ka namsau apai apat ka dohkhe dinga, na lah ua midihtatte leh migiloute akibangin ka satkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin na lah ua pat midihtat leh migilou ka satkhieh ding ziehin, simlam apat mallam tandongin mi zousie dou dingin, ka namsau apai apat apawtdoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Michin in Kei Mangpa’n ka namsau apai apat ka dohkhie ahi, chi atheina ding un, akinua siet kia nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mihing tapa lungtang kehzah pum in, amasang ua amitmu ngel uah hasetah a khoisa a nah vahuoi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh amaun bangdinga nah vahuoi na hiei? chia ahing doh chiengun, Thuthang ziehin, chi’n na dawng dinga, aziehpen ahing tun chiengin, lungtang chinteng azun dinga, khut zousie azoi dinga, lungsim zousie aba ding a, khup zousie tui bangin anem ding hi. Ngai in atung ding ahi, hing tung pai ding ahi,” Mangpa Pasian in achi hi, chiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung kia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mihing tapa genlawhna gen inlen, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Namsau, namsau taat hiem ahita a, nawtval zong ahita, chiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mithana zauhuoi tah dinga tat hiem ahita, tunphe banga nawtval ahita. Nop ibawl nalai ding uh adiei? Ka tapa chieng khu sing bang bep in, na simmaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh aman namsau khu nawtval ding leh, zah pai thei dingin apeta hi. Tam namsau khu mithatpa khut a pieh dinga, tat hiem leh notval ahita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing tapa aw, kap inlen mau in, aziehpen tami ka mite tunga tu ding ahi a, Israel miliente tunga tu ding ahi. Namsau pum a zauna ka mite tunga tungding ahi, tuaziehin na malpi beeng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami etkhiehna ahi ziehin, namsau in asimmaw lengchieng um sih nalai leh, bangchita ding?” Lengchieng a um nawn sih ding hi. Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tuaziehin nang Mihing tapa genlawhna thu gen inlen, nakhut beeng in. Athumveina ah namsau in ale ni in sat hen. Tami mithana namsau ahi a, tami namsau mithupite that leh, a innsung tawng ua lut namsau ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Alungtangte uh zunna ding leh, mi tampi puana dingin, akotpi teng uah namsau ka pangsahta hi; ka dei aw! tunphe banga te val sitset mithana ding namsau ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Namsau kimansa aw! Na zietlam sat inlen! Na temma hiem hei inlen, na veilam sat in! Na temma hiem kiheina lam lam ah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ken zong ka khuttum ka ziel dinga, ka lungthahna ka khawlsahta ding hi; Kei Mangpa’n ka genta hi, achi hi” chiin, gen in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tungkia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Babilon leengpa namsau hing peina dingin gam khat akipan a kipankhie lampi ni guot in. Khopi tung ding lampi kathuom ah chiemtena khuom phut in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ammonmite khuo Rabbah leh kulpi a kivengbit Jerusalem a Judate kunga, namsau ahing tun theina dingin lampi khat guotin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen Babilon leengpa lamka thuom, tua lampi kaani kisuhtuona ah, ai san dingin adinga, athaltangte aloh a, teraphim a dong a, sa sin khu a en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A khut zietlam a, a aisan khu Jerusalem tungah atu a, tua khu, bang phuhvangna ding singzawlte bawl ding, mithat ding mi han ding, kidouna aw ngaitah a kikou ding, Kotpite phuhvang na ding zawlte bawl ding, khopi douna dinga lei sesang ding, tualeh kulbangte bawl ding, chi khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh tam pen amauh, kihahsiel a kichiemte mitmu ah, aisan dihlou bang ahi ding a, hinanleh mat a a um theina ding ua, athulimlouna uh thei dohna ding bep ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Na tatkhielnate uh mudoh a um a, na silbawl zousie ua na khelnate uh kilanga, na gitlounate uh thei zing na ding a na bawl tah ziehun, khut a mat in na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuin nang Israel houtu bua leh gilou aw, na ni ahing tungta, na gitlouna zieh a na kigawtna tawpkhawh ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: Na dielkop leh na manglukhu lakhie in; angaina bangin bangma a um sih ding hi. Angiemte tawisang inlen asangte sungiem in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka lumlet ding, ka lumlet ding Ka lumlet sah dinga! Aneipa dihtah hing pei masang sie’n, Angai in aum nawn sih ding, tami ama kungah ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tualeh Mihing tapa genlawhna gen inlen, Mangpa Pasian in Ammon mite tungtang leh amigensietna tungtang uah tambangin agen hi: Namsau, namsau dawsa ahita, mithana dinga nawtval, tunphe banga not tetsetsot ahita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mengmuna phatuomlou nang ahing musah ua, zuouin ai ahing san sah ua, namsau tha ding migiloute ngawng ah a kinga ding hi. Tua nite ahing tungta a, gawtna huntawp atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Namsau apai ah siet kia in, Na pienna mun ah, na hing kipatna gam mama ah, na tungah thukhenna ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka lungthahna na tungah ka sungbaw dinga, ka thangpaina mei na tung ah Ka sem kuong ding a, mitatsetah leh mi sumangthai siemtah, khut ah ka hing pedoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nangpen meikhuh a kivang singkhuo na hi ding a, na sisan gam sungah aluong ding hi. Nangpen theizingin na um nawn sih ding hi. Aziehpen Kei Mangpa’n Kana gensa ahita hi” chiin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaban ah Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tuin nang Mihing tapa thu nakhen diei, tami sisansuohat khopi tungah thu na khen diei? Ahi, akidahhuoina zousie amanu na musah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, chi in, Khopi in ahun ahing tun theina dingin asung ah sisan asuo a, tualeh ama akisuhbuana dingin milim akibawlthu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na sisan suote ziehin amaw na hita hi, tualeh na milim bawlte ziehin nangma leh nangma na kisubuata hi. Na nite na naisahta a, na kumte tawpna na hing tung phielta hi; tuaziehin namte gensiet ding leh gam zousie nuisat in ka hing bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang a kipat anai a umte leh agamlapia um miten, nang minsepuo leh buoina adim, chiin ahing nuisat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“En in, Israel miliente: michin in sisan suona dingin athuneina uh azang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na sungah nulepa asimmaw ua, na lah uah mikhuolte asugenthei ua, na sung ah Pa neiloute leh meithaite abawlsie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka sil siengthoute na simmaw ua, ka khawlnite na buasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na sungah sisansuo dingin mi hehsiet hatte a um ua, na sungah muol tunga milim biehinn a ann ne a um ua, na lah uah kizuana bawlte a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na sungah apate uh zi toh mawna bawl a lumkhawm a um ua, numei sineilai luppite na sungah a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na sungah mi khat in a innvengpa zi toh silkidahhuoi abawl a, midang khat in huasan tahin amounu abuasah a, tualeh na sungah midang in, asanggam numei, apa tanu aluppi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na sungah sisansuo dingin golna ala ua, sum pung leh amet na la ua, na innvengte sum pauhat in amet na pawng lah pieh a, tualeh kei nang manghilta hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tuaziehin en in, dihtat loutah a, sum pung leh amet na lahna tung uah leh na lah ua sisan na suona tung uah ka khuttum ka zielta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuabanga na tung ua ka bawl ni chiengin, na lungtang in athuoh zou na diei? Ahisihleh na khut ahat zouna diei? Kei Mangpa’n ka genta a, ka bawl ngei ngei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang pen namte lah ah ka hing thezah dinga, gam chin ah ka hing thethang ding hi; nanga kipat na sienthou lounate ka lamang sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangma leh nangma namte mitmu ah na kisubua dinga, Tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi na hing theiding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mihing tapa, Israel innkuonte kei a dingin sia ehsie asuohta uhi, abawnpi un haltuina mei lai a, sum-eng, dan, sia leh ngen, ahi ua, dangka sia ehsie bang bep ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, Na bawn ua sia eeh na suoh siengtah ziehun, tuaziehin Ngai un, Jerusalem laikim tah ah ka hing khawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Miten haltuina meiphuolpi lai a zap ding leh haltui dinga, dangka sia, sum-eng, sia, dan leh ngen, akoikhawm bang un, ka lungthahna leh ka thangpaina sung ah noute ka hing koikhawm dinga, hing haltui ding ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi, ka hing khawm ding a, na tung uah ka thangpaina mei ka zap dinga, alai ah na zunmang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Haltuina meiphuolpi lai a dangka azunmang bangin, khopi sungah noute zong na zunmang ding uhi, tuachi’n Kei Mangpa’n na tung uah ka lungthahna ka sungbota hi chi na hing theita ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mihing tapa aw, akung ah nang pen gam suhsienglou leh lungthah ni a atunga guozuh louna gam khu na hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Humpibahnei humham in asamat abawtel bangin alah ua aguolneite thu phielguhna a um a, mite hinna anetum ua, mi goute leh sil manphate alah pieh ua, alah uah meithai tampi abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A siemputen ka dan abotsie ua, ka sil siengthoute abuasahta uhi; Amaun sil sieng leh sienglou akhen sih ua, a sienglou leh a sieng kikhiehna zong atheisah sih uhi, tualeh ka khawlni apat amitte uh aphuolta ua, tuachi’n kei alah uah suh minsietin ka umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A lah ua miliente lah, sisansuo dingin, mite hinna sumang dingin leh, dihlou tah a punna muna dingin, ngia gilkiel asamat uh kitu a bottel bang mai ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aguolneite’n lah akimat theilou senelte in bang azutzol ua, mengmuna dihlou leh zuouthu in ai asan pieh ua, Mangpa’n bangma genloupiin, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Gamsung miten pauhat a sum kilah piehna leh kisuomna abawlta ua, mi zawngte leh tasamte abawl genthei ua, gamdang mite dihloutah in abawlgenthei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gam ka suhsietlouna dingin, alah ua mi khat kulbang bawl ding leh agam taang a, ka mai a, mun awnga ding ding ka sui a, hinanleh koima ka mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka lungthahna atung uah ka sungbota hi; amaute ka thangpaina meikuong in ka katum sahta hi; asilbawlte uh amauh lutung ngei ah ka thuh ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in a chi hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa aw, nu khat hah tanu ni a um ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amaute gel Izipt gam ah akizua mang ua, khangdawng ahi lai ua pat kizua ahita ua, khunah anawi uh akimeh pieh a, akhangdawng nawi uh a meh pieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A u nu min Oholah ahi a, anau nu min Oholibah amaute Kei a ahi ua, tualeh tanu leh tapate anei uhi. Amin uh tambang ahi, Oholah khu Samaria ahia, Oholibah pen Jerusalem ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Oholah kei a ahi pumpum in akizua a, a innveng Assiria mite toh ang akawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaun puonsandup asil ua, galkap lamkai leh vaihawm liente ahi ua, amaute abawn un tangval deihuoi, sakol tungtuong mi ngen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tambangin Assiria tangval melhoi zousie toh, angkawm in alumkhawmta ua, hua in apum a kiphal in anua del a, amilimte uah akisubuata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Izipt akipat a ahing puoh ahuana lah, atawpsan tuom sih a, aziehpen akhangdawn laiin, amanu aluppi ua, anungah chiillai nawi amehpieh ua, atung ah ahuana uh asungbuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin ken amanu akingaipi, apum a akiphalna, Assiriate khut ah ka pekheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amauten asaguohna ahawhkhiet pieh ua, atanute leh atapate alahmang pieh ua, amanu zong namsau in athat uhi; Ama numeite lah paunah khat asuoh a, atungah thukhenna tunsah ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tuin anaunu Oholibah in tami munapi in asanggamnu sangin amingaihatna a uong zaw a, ahuana leh akizuana ah zong a unu sangin a uong zawsem nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman Assiria mi a innveng, galkap lamkai leh vaihawm miliente, kilawmtah a kivon, sakol tungtuongmi abawn ua tangval deihuoi ngentang khu a deigawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama zong akibuasah gawpta chi ka mu a, ani un lampi khat azuikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh amanu’n akizuana a uongzawsem in abawla; aman baanga pasal lim kigielte, Kaldai mite lim asan au a kigiel;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />akawng ua, kawnggah akigah, diel kilawmtah alu ua kop, abawn ua galkap lamkai bang ngen, apienna gam uh Kaldai gam a, Babilon mite bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amit a amauh amu tah in, amauh adeigawta a, Kaldai gam a, amaute kungah thangkou asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Babilon mite amanu kungah, a angkawmna lupna tungah ahing haw ua, ahuana un amanu asubua ua, tuachi’n abuasah zou chiengin adeinawn sih ua, akikhenpita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amanu’n alangtangin kizuana abawl a, aguohtan na ahawhkheta hi. Tuachi’n asanggamnu ka kikhenpi bangin, ama zong ka kikhenpita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh Izipt gam a akhangdawn lai a, akizua lai nite theizingin, akizuana a uongbawl semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen a angkawmpite uh, tahsa sabiltung tahsa bang ahi a, asilpawtte uh sakolte silpawt bang mai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tambangin na khangdawnlai huasanna, Izipt miten na khangdawn lai nawi ahing, mehpieh ukhu na lunggul nalai hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin Aw Aholibah Mangpa, Pasian in tambangin agen hi; “Ngai in, nang hing luppi na lungsim a na huotna, kikhenpisate ka tohthou dinga, kilchin apat nang dou dingin, ka hing puikhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Babilon mite, Kaldai mite zousie, Pekod, Shoa leh Koa mite leh Assiria mite zousie, tangval melhoi leh deihuoi ngen, uhpipate, vaihawmtute, milien leh minthang, galkap lamkaite, sakol tungtuong mite ngen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh amaute nangma dou dingin, asakollengte utoh, galvante toh, kangtalai kengte toh mipi tampi toh, ahing kuon ding ua, lum lien leh lum neu tawi in, sia lukhu khu in, na kimkot ah panmun khawin akichieng ding uhi. Amauh kung ah thukhenna ka koi dinga, athukhenna uh dungzui in ahing vaihawm khum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na tungah ka thangsietna ka tungsah dinga, amauten lungthah tahin ahing bawlse ding ua, na nahkuo leh na bilte atan ding ua, nuasie a umsunte namsau in ashi ding ua, na tapate u’leh na tanute uh, ahing lahpieh ding ua, adam umsunte meiin akatum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na puonsilte ahing hawhkhietpieh ding ua, na kizepna van manphate alamang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tambangin na huasanna leh, Izipt gam a kipat a na kizuana ka tawpsah ding a, tuachi’n amau’lam en in, na mitte na hahsah nawn sih ding hi, Izipt gam zong na thei ngitnget nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi; Pellou in Keima’n noute, na mudate u’leh na kikhenpisate uh khut ah, ka hing pekhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amaun mudatah in ahing bawlse mama ding ua, nasepga zousie ahing lahmangpieh ding ua, nang pen guohtang leh saguoh in ang nuasie ding uhi. Saguoha na kizuana leh na huasannate adawh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tam silte na tungah ka tungsah ding hi, namdangte lunggul a na kizua a, amilimte ua na kisuhbuatah ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na sanggamnu lampi na zuitah zieh in, anou na khut ah ka koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tambangin Mangpa Pasian in thu agen hi; “Na sanggamnu nou lien leh thuhtah, Na dawn ding a, nuisat leh simmaw in na um ding hi. Tua nouin tampi adawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Zukhamna leh lunggimna in na dim ding a, tua nou khu zauna leh sietna ahi a, na sanggamnu Samaria nou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na dawn dinga na tawpkang ding hi, agei na keibal ding a, na sepkeh dinga athem in na nawi a at keh ding hi, aziehpen Kei Mangpa’n ka gensa ahi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Kei nang manghilta a, nang nuangatsantah ziehin, na huasanna leh na kizuana maw na kipuoh ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mangpa’n ka kungah, “Mihing tapa aw, Oholah leh Oholibah tungah thu na khen diei? Tuachi’n asilkidahhuoi bawlte uh, akung uah phuongdoh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amaun angkawmna khelna abawl ua, akhut uah sisan abang hi. Amaun amilimte utoh ang akawm ua, Kei dinga ahin uh atapate uh nangawn kithoina in meikuong lai ah apeisuoh sah ua, akatum sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuathamlouin tami kei tung ah zong abawl ua: Ka munsiengthou tuami ni mama in asubua uh a, Ka khawlnite abotsie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Aziehpen amilimte ua dinga atate uh atha zou chieng un, tuami ni mama in, ahing pei ua, ka munsiengthou sungah alut ua, asubua uhi, en in tambangin ka inn sungah sil abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuabanah zong gamlapi a pat a hing haw dingin mi na vaihah a, mi na sawl hi; tualeh ahing haw ua, amu ding un na kisilsieng a, na mitte mitlou na nu a, kizepna vante in na kizem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Lupna thupitah tungah na tou a, amasangah dawkan khat na bawl a, atungah ka gimnamtui leh ka sathau na koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Khohsahna neilou mipi tampi husa a um hi; tualeh minautangte leh zukham mite gamdai apat ahing zawpi ua, amauten akhuttawng uah tau abun ua, alutung uah manglukhu kilawmtahte akhu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Tuachi’n ken angkawm a tehse vawtnu tungtang thu ka gen hi. Amaun amanu toh, tualeh amanu’n amautoh angkawm angapna ding uoi izaw? Ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ahivang in amauh kizuate kunga ahaw bang un, amanu kungah alut ua, tuachi’n amaute numei kizua Oholah leh Oholibah kungah ahaw ua, huasanna bawl in aluppi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hinanleh midihtatten angkawmte leh sisan suo numeite gawtna thu akhenpieh bangun atung uah thu akhen ding uhi, aziehpen amaute angkawmnute ahi ua, akhut uah sisan abang hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: “Amauh dou dingin mipi puikhawm unlen, amaute chizat huoitah leh gallah vante in bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mipiten amauh suongin asep ding ua, namsau in asatlia ding uhi; Atapate u’leh atanute uh athapieh ding ua, a innte uh mei in ahaltumpieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tambangin gam sung apat huasanna ka beisah dinga, numeite zousie in vauhilna athei ua, na huasanna uh azui louna ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Na tungah na huasanna ahing thuh ding ua, na milim biehna khelnate uh maw nouman na kipuoh ding uhi. Tuachi’n Kei Mangpa Pasian ka hi chi, na thei ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Akum kuona, hasawmna, ani sawmniin Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa ni min tuni mama min giel in, tami ni mama in, Babilon leengpa’n Jerusalem ahing sim pat ni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh innkuonte kungah gentethu khat gen inlen, tambangin gen in, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Lungthu tungah bel suong inlen, asung ah tui sung in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asungah sa atnente bua inlen, asa hoite zousie, amal leh alieng bua inlen, agu hoi ngen bua inlen, tua bel dimsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Belamhon lah a ahoipen la inlen, anuoi ah singtun sie in, mei taw inlen, hoitah in sousah inlen, agubomte khu asungah ui hihen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Sisan suona khopi, bel asung kagep, akagep bei ngailou khu atung agih hi; asa khu tel tuom umlou in beu khat khat in thua in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen asisan suo ama sung ah a um a, aman tami suongpi tungah asungbuo a, leivui a khukhum dingin leitung ah asung bawsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Phuba la ding a lungthahna ahing kipatdoh theina dingin, asisan suongpi tungah ka sungbuo hi, akikhukhum louna dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Sisansuo khopi tung agih hi. Ken zong amei ding sing ka sie vum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sing sie vum unlen, mei tawkuong unlen, sa hoitah in huon min unlen, atuisah dingin menam hal unlen, agute katumsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n bel khu mei-am tungah aguoh in suong den un, a sum-eng ahing sat a akaah theina dingin, tualeh aniehnate ahing zunmang theina ding leh, akagepte akahtum theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chimtah khop a abawl nuain zong, akagepte akohsieng tuom sih a, mei in zong akasieng tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na sienlouna ah huana a um a, ka hing susieng a, na sien tuomlou zieh in, na tunga ka lungthahna ka tunsah masangsie in, na sienlouna khu sawpsieng ahi ngai nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei Mangpa’n tami ka gen zouta a, ahing tangtung ngei dinga, ka bawl ding hi! Ka nua tawp sih ding a, ka hinkhawi sih dinga, Ka lungsim ka hei vawt sih ding hi. Na umdan leh na silbawl dung zuiin, na tungah thu akhen ding uhi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi,” chiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung kia a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mihing tapa na mit hing taisah pen Thakhat in ka hing lahpieh dinga, na suun ding ahisih a, na kaa ding zong ahisih a, na hitui zong na luon sah lou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sip khinkhian in tau hit hit in, mi shi suunna zong bawl sin, na lu ah na diel khip inlen, na kengah na kedap but in, na kam hum sinlen, mihingte daana ann zong ne sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n zingmawng in mipite kungah thu ka gen a, nitahlam in ka zi ashita hi; tualeh azingmawngin thupieh a ka um bangin ka bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mipiten ka kungah, “Tambanga na umdante kou a dingin bang etsahna ahiei, nang hil sih ding amah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken amauh ka dawng a, “Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel innkuonte kungah genin, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, Ngai un, na kisahtheipi mama uh na mittaina uh, na hinna uh kipahna, ka munsiengthou khu buasah ding kahi, tualeh na nuasie uh na tapa u’leh na tanute uh namsau in ashi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh ken ka bawl bangin nouten zong na bawl ding uhi, na kamte uh na hum sih ding ua, mishi suun a lunggim mite ann na nehlou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na dielte uh na lu uah khip unlen, na kedapte uh na but ding uhi, na daa sih ding ua, kap zong na kaa louding uh ahi, hinanleh na gitlounate ziehun khat leh khat kikatuo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tambangin Ezekiel khu noute a dingin etsahna ahi ding a, abawl bangin nouten zong na bawl ding uhi, tambang sil ahing tun chiengin, Kei Mangpa Pasian ka hi chi nang thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Nang Mihing tapa, alungnopna uh, athupina uh, amittaina uh, alunggul uh, alungtang uh angatna uh, tua kulpi leh atapate u’leh atanute u’toh ka lahmang ni chiengin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tua ni chiengin asuohta mi khat in, tam thu na bil a zasah dingin, na kungah ang pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin, asuohta mi kungah na kam akikaah dinga, thu na gen dinga, na sip sih ding hi; tuachi’n nang khu ama ua dingin chiemtena na hi dinga, tualeh Kei Mangpa ka hi chi athei ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa aw, na mai Ammon mite lang ngat inlen, atungtang uh thu genlawhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ammon mite kungah, Mangpa Pasian thugen ngaikhie un, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ka munsiengthou akisuhbua lai a, Israel gam suhsiet a a umlai leh Juda innkuonte sal a puimang ahi lai ua, Awi ngel inge, na chi ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai in, tuaziehin, suolam mite kungah agoutan uh hi dingin ka hing pedoh dinga, amaun na lah uah giehphuol sat in, tenna innte abawl ding uhi, amaun na thei gate uh ane ding ua, na bawngnawite uh adawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Rabbah khu sangawngsaute buh in ka bawl dinga, tualeh Ammon pen belamhonte khawlna mun ka suohsah ding hi, tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi athei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi. Israel gam sietna tunga na khut na beng a, na keng na tat a, na lungtang zousie a na kipah ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai in, tuaziehin, na tungah ka khut ka laam dinga, namte kungah, atomgam ding un ka hing pedoh ding hi. Namte lah akipat ka hing satkhe ding a, gamte akipat ka hing sumang ding a, Ka hing suse ding hi, tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi nang thei ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tambangin Mangpa Pasian in thu agen hi: Moab leh Seir in, En un, Juda innkuonte zong namdang zousie bang thou ahi uh a chi ziehun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin, ngai un, Moab gam ning khat ka susieng ding a, gamgi zul a khopite, agam thupina pente, Beth Jeshimoth, Baal Meon, leh Kirjathaim, ah ka pan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Suolam mite goutan dingin Moab mite Ammonmite toh ka pekhawm ding hi; Ammonmite khu namte lah ah thei ngitnget ahi nawnta sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moab tungah thukhenna ka tun dinga, tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi athei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tambangin Mangpa Pasian in agen hi: Edomin Juda innkuonte tunga phuba la a, asunat seng ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: Ken Edom tung ah ka khut ka laam ding a, tamna kipat mite leh gantate ka satkhe ding a, Teman akipat tenna lou gamsie ka suohsah dinga, Dedan mite namsau in ashi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mi Israelte khut zangin, Edom tungah phuba ka la dinga, ka lungthahna leh ka thangpaina dungzui in Edom tungah abawl ding uhi, tuachi’n amaun ka phubalahna athei ding uhi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Philistin miten phuba la a, kimudana luite zieh a, hing suhmang nopna lungsim pua a, phuba alah ziehun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai un Philistin mite tung ah ka khut ka laam dinga, Kerethmite ka satkhe dinga, tualeh tuipi gei a mi umsunte ka sumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thangpai mama pumin vauhilna toh atungah phuba huoisetah in ka la ding hi; atung ua phubalahna ka tunsah hun chiengin Kei Mangpa ka hi chi athei ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, kum sawm leh khatna, tuami ha, anikhat niin, Mangpa thu ka kung ah ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Tai-ar in Jerusalem tung thu a Awi ngel inge, mite ding a kotpi khu akiseta a, kei a dingin kotpite akihongta a, tua khopi asegawpta a, kei tan hoi ding ahita, achi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai in, Tai-ar aw ka hing dou ahi, tuipi in atuikinawhte avawhsang bangin, nang dou ding in nam tampi ka hing kuonsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaun Tai-ar kulbangte asuse ding ua, a innsangte asuchim ding uhi; ama apat in aleivuite zong ka phietsieng ding a, ama khu suongpi tungvum bangin ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipi lai ah len phouna mun ahita ding hi; aziehpen ka gensa ahita hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi. Tualeh namte gallah van giap ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gamlah a khoneu a um atanute namsau a tha in a um ding ua, tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi athei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Aziehpen Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai in, Tai-ar dou dingin mallam akipat leengte leengpa, Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar khu sakolte toh, kidouna sakollengte toh, sakoltungtuongmi leh galkap hon tampi ka hing pui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman gam lah a khoneu a um na tanute namsau in athat dinga, nangma nanna dingin kulte akhaw dinga leipalte abawl ding a, nang apat kidalna in lumte adomsang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman na kulbangte suhsietna dingin, sing zawlte in ahing sun ding a, aheitangte in na innsangte a satchim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A sakolte a tam seng ziehin leivui in nang ahing tuom dinga, sakoltungtuong mite leh sakolleng keng kipeiging husa in na kulbangte akiling sah ding hi, tualeh khopi kulbangte kisusie a, mite alut ni banga, na kulpi kotte a alut chiengin tuabang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asakolte kengchin in na gawlzing zousie uh atuonchil dinga, namsau in na mite athat ding uhi, tualeh na khuompi dettahte tuol ah leilah ah apua ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaun na hausatnate leh na summet bawlna vante gallah vante in atomgam ding ua, na kulbangte asuchim ding ua, na inn nuomtahte uh asusegawp ding uhi, tualeh na suongte leh na singte leh na leitangte tuili lai ah apailut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh na la sah gingte ka tawpsah dinga, na kaiging husate uh akiza nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangkhu suongpi vum bangin ka hing bawl dinga, len phouna mun na hita ding a lamtha kia na hinawn sih ding hi, aziehpen Kei Mangpa’n tami ka gensa ahita, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mangpa Pasian in Tai-ar kungah tambangin agen hi: Na sunga kithana a um a, miliemte akikou chieng un, na pua ging in tuipi gamte achitunsah sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuipi gei a leeng tapate zousie a mangtouna ua pat ahing kumkhe suh ding ua, aleengpuonte uh asutkhe ding ua, apuonsil zemhoite uh ahawhkhe ding uhi; chitutna puonsil in tuol ah atou zawta ding uhi, tualeh achitun den ding ua, chizat huoi ahing sa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh nanga dingin kaateng alou ding ua, na kungah: Tuisiem mite tenna khopi minthang aw, Tuipi tunga hat, amaleh asunga teng zousie, zausah leh agin mama uh, Bangchidan a suhsiet a um na hiei? achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuipi panga gamte, na pua niin achitun ding ua, Ahi, tuipi gei a gamte na peimang niin abuoita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Aziehpen Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Mi tenlouna banga khopi segawp a ka hing bawl chiengin, tuipi thuhtahte na tunga ka hing vuakhum a, tuiten nasatah a ahing tup hun chiengin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuahun chiengin, hankhuh a na lutsuhte toh ka hing lutkhawm sah dinga, tanglai mite kungah na tung suh ding uhi. Tanglai mun sesa a teng bangin, hankhuh a lut suhte toh nuoilam lei sung ah kang tengsah ding a, na hing kinuale kia nawn sih ding hi, tualeh mihing gam ah thupina ka koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang khu zauhuoi in ka hing bawl dinga, na um nawnta sih ding hi; hing kisui nanleh, ahing kimu kia nawn sih ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi,” chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung kia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tuin Mihing tapa Tai-ar tungtang ah kaateng lou inlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tai-ar kungah genin: Tuipi lutna ding kotpi kung a um Tai-ar aw, Tuipi gei ateng mite kunga summetbawlpa kungah; Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: Aw Tai-ar melhoi bukim ka hi, na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na gamgite tuipi lai ah a um a, na innlam miten na melhoina abukim sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaun Senir apat taasingtein singpeh ahing bawlpieh ua; Lebanon apat sidar singte in na tembawh mung ding abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bashan gam akipat gangpi singin, na kuongzapnate abawl ua, Ashur miten, Saipras tuikuol gam a pat a hing kipuo, taasing peh in tembawh tuong ahing phapieh ua, saiha aphakhum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Izipt gam a pat a hing kila, khut a khui a kizem puonmalngat khu, na tembawh puonzah ahi a, tua khu na diellap uh ahi a, Elisha tuipi gei gamte a kila puondum leh, puonsandup khu ahing zahkhumna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sidon leh Arvad a tengte na kuongzapte ahi ua, Tai-ar aw, na sunga um na mipilte, na tembawh hehte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gebal upate leh amipilte u’khu natembawh phawbit in na tembawh sung ah a um uhi; Tuipi a tembawh zousie leh apute zousie, nang kunga hing pei in summet ahing bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Persia, Lidia leh Libia mite na galkapte leh galhangte ahi uhi, nangma ah alumte u’leh, asialukhute uh akhai ua, na kilawmna atahlang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Avad mite khu na galkapte toh na kimvel a kulbang tung ah a um ua, Gammad mite khu na galvenna innsangte ah a um uhi; alumte uh na kulbang kimkot ah akhai ua, na kilawmna abukim sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Na hausatna chituom tuomte ziehin Tarshish toh summet na bawlkhawm uhi. Amaun dangka, sia, langva leh ngen, in na summet vante uh ahing heng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Javan, Tubal leh Meshek gamten nang toh summet abawl khawm ua, mihing leh sum-eng umlebelte, na zua sumte ahing kihenpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Togarmah miten sakol nasemte, galdou sakolte leh sakolneute in, na summet vante uh ahing kihenpi zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dedan mite toh zong summet na kibawltuo ua, tuikuol gam tampite khu na summet bawlna munte ahi ua, Amaun saiha leh eboni singin na vante uh ahing lei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na gama sil pieng tampite ziehin Siria toh zong summet na kibawltuo ua, Emerald suong, puonsandup, puonzem kilawm, puonmalngat nem, khipi suong leh Rubi suongin na Van zuate ahing kihenpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Juda leh Israel gam in zong nang toh summet abawl ua, amaun na van zuate, Minnith apat mangbu, taang, khuoizu, sathau leh singnai damdawi toh ahing heng zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na hausatna ziehin Damaska toh zong summet na kibawltuo ua, gousil chinteng, Helbon zu leh samul kaang na nei ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Uzal apat Dante leh Javanten na van zuate lei in asuh pei atoupei ua, Sia khensa, singthal leh thangkhuai in na vanzuate ahing heng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dedan in zong nang toh sakol tungtuonna puonpha toh summet abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Arabia leh Kedar milien zousie na van zuate leite ahi uhi, Amaun belamnoute, belamtalte leh kelte a, na summet bawlpite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sheba leh Raamah summet bawl mite toh zong summet na kibawltuo ua, na van zuate, gimnamtui hoi namkim leh suongmantam leh sana in ahing heng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Haran, Kanneh, Eden, Sheba, Ashur leh Kilmad summet bawlmite khu na vanzuate leitute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tamte khu na summet bawlna muna na puon hoipen chinteng, puon dumte, khuta kikhui puonzephoite, leh tuongtung a kipha puon zem tuom tuom pawlte leh khauhuol chiptah a kihehte toh na kungah ahing kivei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tarshish tembawhte khu na van pote ahi ua, “Tuipi lai ah thupina toh na kidimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na tembawh puten tuipi kinawh lai ah ahing puilut ua, suolam huipi in tuipi lai ah ahing mut leengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na hausatna, na sumlepaite na summet bawlna vante, na kuongpute, na kuonghehte, na kuong phawte, na summetbawl mite, na galkap mite na sunga um zousie leh na lah a um mihonte zousie, na manthai ni in tuipi sungah akelum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na kuong hehte kikou husa ah, tuipi gei gamte akithing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kuong zapna tawite zousie, kuongpute leh tuipi tunga kuong hehte zousie, kuong apat ahing kumsuh ding ua, gamgaw tungah ading ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nangma ziehin aw ngaitah in akikou ding ua, hase tahin akap ding ua, alu uah leivui akibuoh ding ua, vut lah ah akilawmlia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nang ziehin alu uh amauleh amauh akiheukieu ding ua, Sai ip puon ateng ding ua, nang a dingin akap ding uhi. Lungtang na sa mama leh, hase tahin nang ahing kaa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nang hing suun a akaa amau chiengun, nang tungah kan ateng alou ding ua, Tuipi lai a suhsiet a um Tai-ar khopi banga gielbang dai, a um ngai amah achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na summet bawlna vante tuipi tung a akipuoh chiengin, nam tampi na lungtai sah a, na hausatna chi tuom tuomte leh, na summet bawlna vante a leitung leengte na hausat sah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanleh tuipi thutah lai a na kehgawp chiengin, na summetbawlna vante leh, na kithuopi mihonte zousie, na lah uah atummang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuikuolkhum gam a tengte zousie in, lamdang ahingsa ding ua, aleengte uh nasatah in a zau ding ua, amel uh muol in achimawta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mite lah ah summetbawl miten, ahing siukohta ding ua, nang khu mi zauhuoi na suohta dinga, tualeh kumtawn in na um kia nawn sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung kia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Tai-ar leengpa kungah gen in: Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi. “Na lungtangin na kiliensah a, Kei pasien khat ka hi a, tui pi lai ah, pasiente toupha, tungah ka tou hi, na chi a, hinanleh, na lungtangin pasien bangin, kigel nanlachin zong, mihing na hi a, pasien na hisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai in, Daniel sangin na pilzaw a! Nang a kipat thuguh kisel a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na pilna leh na theisiemna toh, hauna na kikhol a, na goukholna ah sana leh dangka na kholta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na summetbawl pilna thupitah in, na hausatna na khangsah a, na hauna ziehin, na lungtang akisathei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, “pasien lungtang bang lungtang na puohtah ziehin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin Ngai in, nam zauhuoi gamdang mite nang hing dou dingin, Ka hing pui ding hi, amaun na pilna kilawmna tungah anamsau uh adoh ding ua, na thupina tangpha khu asumuol ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amauten hankhuh ah ahing puikhesuh ding ua, tuipi sunga kithatte shi bangin na shi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang hing thatte masangah, Kei pasien khat ka hi, na chi thei nalai diei? Ahivang in nang hing thatte masang ah, mihing giap na hi ding a, pasien na hisih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gamdang mite khut ah, teptan loute shi bang a shi ding na hi, azieh pen Keima’n ka gen zouta hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaban ah Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Mihing tapa, Tai-ar lengpa tungah, kateng lou inlen akungah, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Nang bukimna chiemtena leh, pilna a dim leh hoina a bukim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang Pasian huon Eden ah na um a; Suongmantam chinteng na kizepna a hi a, Sardius, topaz leh diamond, Beril, Onix leh Jesper; Saphire, Karbunkul leh emeral, sana toh, akiphumkipna leh agelkilawmte khu nangma hing kisiem ni a bawlzou ahita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang khu avengtu sathaunu cherub na hi a, Tuabang dingin nang ka hing koi hi; Pasian muol siengthou tungah na um a, mei-am suongte lah ah na suhvah na touvah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siem a na um ni apat, na umdan apat gitlouna akimudoh tandongin, na hoibukim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na summetbawlna kiningchinna in, hiemngapna in ahing dimsah gawpta a, na khielta hi. Tuaziehin Pasian muol apat, sil sienglou bangin ka hing notkheta hi, vengtu Cherub in ahing notdohta hi, mei-am suongte lah akipat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na melhoina ziehin na lungtang ahing kisathei a, na thupina ziehin na pilna na suseta hi; Tuoltang sena’n ka hing nei a, leengte mai ah ka hing siel a, amauh etnop ka hing hisahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na khelna tampite leh na summetbawl zuoutatnate in, na munsiengthou na buasahta hi. Tuaziehin na lah ua pat mei ka kuongdoh sah a, nang ahing katumta hi. Nang hing ente zousie mitmu ah, leilah a vutvai ka hing suoh sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mite laha nang hing theikha nam zousieten, lamdang ahingsa ua, chizat huoi na suohta, na um kia ngai nawn sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung kia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Sidon lam maingat inlen, atungthu genlawh inlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, chi in: “Ngai in, Sidon aw, nang hing dou ka hi, na lah a pahtawi a um ding ka hi, asungah thukhenna ka tungsah dinga, asunga siengthou a ka kilat hun chiengin, Kei Mangpa ka hi chi, ahing thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen asungah natpi ka sawl dinga, agawlzing tengah sisan ka luongsah ding a, asungah mi liemte, ning chin ah namsau in apua ding ua, tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi ahing thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tua hun chiengin Israel innkuonte dingin amauh suntu leh sunatu loulingnei leh ling hi ngitnget leh amauh simmaw tah a bawl innvengte anei nawn sih ding uhi. Tuachi’n Kei Mangpa Pasian ka hi chi, athei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, ka thethangna namte lah a kipat Israel innkuonte ka khopkhawm hun leh namte mitmu a amaute lah a sienthou sah a ka um hun chiengin, ka suohpa Jakob kunga ka pieh gam ah a teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n asung ah bittahin ateng ding ua, innte alam ding ua, grep huonte abawl ding ua, Ahi, akimvel ua amauh simmaw mite zousie tunga phubalahna ka tunsah hun chiengin lungmuong tah in atengta ding uhi; Tuachi’n amauten Kei Mangpa a Pasian uh ka hi chi ahing theita ding uhi,” chiin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Akum sawmna, aha sawmna khumi ha ani sawm leh ni, ni in, Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Izipt lengpa Pharaoh kimai tuopi inlen, atung thu leh Izipt tungtang thu genlawh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tambangin gen in; Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: “Ngai in, Aw Izipt lengpa Pharaoh, luipidung lah alum Olepi aw Ka luipi khu keima a ahi a, Kei a dinga ka kibawl ahi, chipa Ka hing dou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh na khadang ah ngakuoi in ka hing kuoi dinga, na luipi a ngate na lip ah ka behsah dinga, na luipite sung apat, hing khaikhe ding ka hi. Tuachi’n na luipi a ngate zousie, na lip ah abeh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang leh na luipite a ngate zousie, gamdai ah ka hing nuasie ding a, gamlah ah na pua ding a, top lou leh phohlou in na um ding a, Gamsate leh tungleeng vate ann dingin, ka hing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tuachi’n Izipt gam a tengte zousie in, Kei Mangpa ka hi chi athei ding uhi; aziehpen amaute Israel innkuonte adingin, pumpeng chieng ahita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaun na khut a ahing tuh chiengun, na tawngta a, aliengkoute uh na liem sah a, na tunga ahing kingap chiengun, na tawngsan a, akawngte uh na kiheh sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai in, na tungah namsau ka hing tungsah dinga, nanga kipat mihing leh, gantate ka thatgam sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Izipt gam khu gamsie, koima tenna lou, khogem nua bang ahita ding hi; “Tuachi’n amaun Kei Mangpa ka hi chi atheita ding uh; aziehpen ama’n Nile luipi kei a ahia, Keima bawl ahi achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuazieh in Ngai in, nang leh na luipite ka hing dou ahi, tualeh Izipt gam, Migdol akipat Syene tandong leh Ethiopia gamgi dongin, gamsie leh koima tenna lou, gamtul ka suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihing koima keng ahisihleh ganhing kengin atuon ngai nawnsih dinga, kum sawmli sung koima ateng sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Izipt gam khu, luolou gamsete lah a gamsie luolou gam khat in ka bawl dinga, akhopite zong kum sawmli sung suhsiet a um khopite lah a khopi tulnua ka suohsah ding hi; tualeh Izipt mite khu namte lah ah ka thethang ding a, gam chin ah ka thezah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ahivang in Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Kum sawmli abei chiengin Izipt mite khu ka thethangna gamte lah apat ka puikhawm kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Izipt saltang mite ka hing nuapui kia ding a apienna gam uh Pathros gam ah ka hing kinuale sah ding a, khunah leenggam ngiemtah in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tamkhu leenggam lah a ngiempen ahi ding a, namte tungah akitawisang ngai nawn sih ding hi; aziehpen namte tunga vaihawm nawnlou dingin amauh ka sungiemta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Izipt pen Israel innkuonte a dingin muontham ahi nawnsih ding a, amaute panpina dei a, amauh lam angat uh, akhelna uh ahi zaw chi theidohna ding uh ahi zaw ding hi. Tuachi’n Kei Mangpa Pasian ka hi chi athei ding uhi,” chi in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh kum sawmni leh sagina, ha khatna, ni khat ni in, Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar in Tai-ar douna dingin agalkapten sil thupitah abawlsah a, michin lutang aheukieu pieh a, tualeh michin liengkou akoh sah a, ahivangin ama leh agalkapten Tai-ar adou ziehun bangma lawtah amu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Pellou in Izipt gam khu Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar kung ah ka pe ding a, ama’n tua gam hausatna apomang dinga, Izipt gam asim dinga, gallah vante ala ding a, tuate khu agalkapte thaman ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama’n tuabanga nna aseppen kei a ding ahiziehin, akipahman ding a Izipt gam akhut a ka pieh ahi; Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tua ni chiengin Keima’n Israel innkuonte kii ka poudoh sah dinga, amaute lah ah nakam kaah in thu ka hing gensah ding hi; tuachi’n amaun Kei Mangpa ka hi chi athei ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa genlawhna thu gen inlen, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, chi in: “Kap in, mau in, Ekadei! tuami ni va-ia talawm! chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen ani anaita, Mangpa ni ngel khu anaita, meipizin ni khu, Pasian theilou namte ni ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Izipt gam tungah namsau atung dinga, Ethiopia tungah lungzinna a um ding Izipt gamsunga tha a umte a pua chiengun, ahausatnate alahmang pieh ding ua, akingaatna suongphumte achimzah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ethiopia, Libia, Lidia leh nam chin umkhawmte leh Kub leh akithuopi gam mite zousie Izipt toh, namsau in apua khawm, ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Izipt panpite apua ding ua, akisahtheipi ahatna akengiem dinga, Migdol akipat Syene tandonga umte namsau in apua ding uhi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaute gam sessa leh koima ten nawnlouna gam kiloisa ahi ding ua, akhopite uh zong susiet a um khopite lah ah susietsa ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mei a Izipt gam ka hal a, ama panpite zousie suhmanga, a um hun chiengun, Kei Mangpa ka hi chi athei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tua ni chiengin khohsahna neilou Ethiopia mite zausah dinga, Kei akipat a thupote kuonga akuondoh chiengun, Izipt lungzin chimaw ni bangin, lungzin chimawna nasatah amauh tungah atung ding hi; Ngai un, hing tung pai ding ahita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Babilon lengpa Nebukadnezzar khut zangin, Izipt hausatna tampite ka beisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama leh amipi a umpite, namte lah a huham leh zauhuoi penpente, gam suse ding in ahing kizawpi dinga, amaun Izipt dou dingin namsau adoh ding ua, gam sung pumpi mi kithatte luongin adim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Luipite ka kangsah dinga, tualeh agam migiloute kungah ka zua ding a, Gamdang mite khut zangin, agam leh asunga um zousie ka sumang sieng ding hi: Kei Mangpa’n ka gen zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ken amilimte uh ka suse dinga, Memphis a amilimte uh ka subei ding hi, Izipt gam sungah leeng vaihawm a um nawn sih ding a, tuaziehin Izipt gam sung zousie ah zauna ka koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathros khu gamsie koima tenlouna ka suohsah ding a, Zoan mei in ka hal dinga, Thebes tungah gawtna ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Izipt thahatna Sin tungah ka lungthahna ka sungbo dinga, Thebes mihon tampite ka satkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Izipt mei in ka hal dinga, Sin in nasatah in na asa ding hi; Thebes akehgawp dinga, Memphis nichin in alungkham ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aven leh Pi-Beseth khanglaite namsau in apua ding ua, khopimite zong sal a puimang in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Izipt hahkol ka suhtawngpieh chiengin, Tehaphnehes ah sunlai amiel dinga, akisahtheipi ahatna abeita ding a, amapen meilum in atuomkhum dinga, atanute khopi neute sal a pui in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tambangin Izipt tungah thukhenna ka tungsah dinga, tuachi’n amaun Kei Mangpa ka hi chi athei ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Akum sawm leh khatna, aha khatna, ani sagi niin, Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Izipt leengpa Pharaoh ban ka sutawngta hi; en in, namsau tawi dinga hat ding khopin, damdawi akinu sih dinga, akituom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, Ngai in, Izipt leengpa Pharaoh ka dou ahi; aban ahat lang leh a tawngsa lang zong ani in ka suhtawng pieh dinga, akhut apat in namsau ka Kesah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Izipt mite khu namte lah ah ka thethang ding a, gam chingtengah ka thezah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Babilon leengpa bantha ka hatsah dinga, akhut ah ka namsau ka koi dinga, hinanleh Pharaoh bante ka suhtawng pieh dinga, Babilon leengpa masang ah shi ding khop a liem bangin atau hut hut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Babilon leengpa bantha ka hatsah dinga, hinanleh Pharaoh bante pen azaw ningnieng ding hi; Babilon leengpa khut a ka namsau ka koi a, ama’n Izipt gam tunga, tua namsau alap hun chiengin, Kei Mangpa ka hi chi athei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Izipt mite khu namte lah ah ka thezah dinga, gam chinteng ah ka thethang ding hi; tuachi’n amaun Kei Mangpa ka hi chi athei ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kum sawm leh khatna, aha thumna, ani khat ni in Mangpa thu ka kung ah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Izipt leengpa Pharaoh kung leh, amihon tampite kung ah, gen inlen, “Na thupina ah koi na bang ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai in, Lebanon a sidar sing sang kilawm bazam hoitah leh, bawhphatah leh sangtah Assiria toh ka hing tekah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuiten tua sing akhanglien sah a, leinuoi langa tuiten sangtahin akhang sah a, apouna kimvel ah luituite aluong a, gam a singkungte tui apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin gamlah sing zousie sangin asangzaw a, ahing bawhpha deu deu a, tui nieng tah a akham ziehin, abate asau a, azam zei zoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tungleeng vate zousie in abawh lah ah bu abawl ua, abazam lim nuoi ah gam sate zousie in nou a nei uhi, tualeh nam thupite zousie alim nuoi ah ateng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tambangin athupina leh abazamte sau ziehin akilawm hi, Aziehpen ahuite tui kiningching leh, tamna mun ah alutsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasian huon sung a sidar singten adep zou sih a, tasingte lah ama bawh abang zou sih a, tualeh se singten zong abate apha zou sih uhi; Pasian huon sunga singte’n zong akilawmna apha zou sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ken aba tampi nei in Ka kilawm sah a, Pasian huon a um, Eden a singkung zousie in ama a eeng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: asanna ahing kibelapa, abawhpha lah ah adawn ahing kikhotou a, asanna ziehin alungtang ahing kisathei ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin Ken ama khu namte lah a hattah khat khut ah ka pedoh ding a, ama’n ama khu abawlse ngei ngei ding hi; Ken ama khu agitlouna ziehin ka deldohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh gamdang mite, namte lah a huham leh zauhuoi pente in ama asatkhie ua anuasie ta uhi; Abate khu muoltung lah leh phaiguom zousie ah aketa hi. Abawhte khu gam sunga luidungte ah atawngsa in a umta hi. Leitunga namte zousie alim nuoi apat apawtdoh ua, anuasieta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asietna tungah, tungleeng vate zousie a umden ding ua, tualeh gamsate zousie abahiengte tungah a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n tui a kivah sing zousie akisansah lou ua, azih uh sing bawhphate lah a adawhtouna ding u’leh, tui kham mama sing dang pouma in zong abatphah zoulouna ding ahi. Aziehpen amaute zousie leinuoi thuhtah a, hankhuh sunga Peisuh mihing tate lah a, shina tuoh ding a piehdoh sieng ahita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen Hi: Sheol a apeisuh ni in asuunna ka umsah a, tui thuhtahte ama ziehin ka khukhuma alui luongte ka khawl sah a, tui tamtahte aluong sih uhi. Lebanon in ama ka suunsah a, gamlah sing zousie ama ziehin abata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kokhuh a kesuhte toh ama mishikhuo a ka paikhieh suh lai in, a pua ging za in namte ka kithing sah hi. Tualeh Eden a singkung zousie, Lebanon sing hoipente, tui kham mama singkungte zousie leinuoi thuhtah ah hamuong tah in a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaute zong namsau a thate toh mishikhuo ah apei suhta ua, tualeh namte lah a, alim nuoi a teng akhut akeng hite ngei toh zong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eden singte lah ah thupina leh letna lam ah koi ahiei nang bang um? Hinanleh Eden a singte toh leinuoi thuh pen ah ahing kizawpi suh ding hi; teptanloute lah ah, namsau a kithatte toh na lumkhawm ding hi. “Tami Pharaoh leh amipi tamtahte ahi uh, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sawm leh ni na, aha sawmlenina, ani khat ni in, Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Izipt leengpa Pharaoh a dingin kaateng lou inlen, akungah, “Nangpen namte lah ah, Humpibahnei khanglai bang na hi a, tuipi a awlepi bang na hi luipi a tuite na kiloh sah a, na kengte in tuite na tohphuon a, tualeh luipi tuite na sunieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tambangin Mangpa Pasian in agen hi, Tuaziehin mihon tampi toh ka len in, Ka hing khu dinga, amaun Ka len in ahing kaikhe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n leigaw tungah ka hing nuasie ding a, gam lah ah ka hing paidoh ding hi; tualeh tungleeng vate zousie na tungah ka tusah dinga, leitung pumpi a gamsate na sa ane in ka gilvasah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Taangte tungah na tahsa ka lumsah dinga, luiguomte na luongin ka dimsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gam sung zousie muol sangte nangawn ah, zong na sisan ka luongsah ding a, luidungte ah na luong ka dimsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang ka hing phietmang ni chiengin, vante ka khukhum ding a, aasite ka miel sah ding hi; ni meilum in ka khu dinga, hapi ataang nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Van a taang vah zousie na tungah ka miel sah dinga, na gam tungah mielna ka tungsah ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Namte lah a na sietna ka tunsah hun chiengin, na thei ngailou gamte lah a, mi tampite ka lungkham sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi, mitampite nangma ah, ka chizasah dinga, amasang ua ka namsau ka le hun chiengin aleengpate uh nang ziehin chiza sengin azau ding uhi; tualeh na pua ni chiengin michin ahinna uh taan ding zau in mitphietkaal chin achitun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, Babilon leengpa namsau na tungah ahing tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihat namsau in mihonte ka puasah dinga, amaute namte lah a huham leh zauhuoi pente ahi uhi; “Tuachi’n amaun Izipt thupina asuse ding ua, tualeh mipi zousie suhmangthai in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Agantate zousie luitui tampite gei apat ka sumangthai ding a, mihing kengin asubuoi nawn sih dinga, gantate kengin zong a zausah nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n atuite uh ka siengsah dinga, alui tuite sathau bangin ka luong sah ding hi; Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Izipt gam koima tennalou gamsie ka suohsah hun chiengin, tualeh agam a tengte hausatna ka phietmang chiengin, Kei Mangpa ka hi chi ahing thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tami ama suunna kilou ding kaala ahi, namte tanute’n ama aka ding ua, amaun Izipt leh amihonte zousie suun in akap ding uhi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kum sawm leh nina, tuami ha, ni sawm leh nga niin, Mangpa thu ka kungah a hing tung hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Izipt mihonte kaa in mau inlen, ama leh nam minthangtah tanute, hankhuh a peisuhte toh leinuoi thuhtah ah paikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang koi ahiei melhoina a na khup? Peisuh inlen, teptanloute lah ah valum in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amauh namsau a kithatte lah ah apua ding ua; Izipt khu namsau kunga pieh ahita. Ama leh amihonte zousie kaikhedoh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Galhatmite lah a mihatten, hankhuh sunga pat in ama leh apanpite kung ah thu agen ding ua, teptanlou namsau a kithatte toh alum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Assiria leh alawmte zousie khunah a um ua, akimvel ah ahante a um a, abawn ua thasa, namsau a puasa ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A hankhuhte u’khu leinuoi thuhpi ah a um a, alawmte uh ahankhuh kimvel ah a um uhi; abawn un thasa, namsau a puasa, mihing gam a chizatna umsahte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Khunah Elam leh amihon tampite zousie ahankhuh kimvel uah a um uhi; abawn un thasa, namsau a puasa, teptanlou a, leinuoi thuhpen a, peisuh, mihing gam a, chizatna umsahte ahi ua, amaun hankhuh a peisuhte toh a zumna uh apota uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Akithatsate lah ah ama leh ahankhuh kim a amihonte zousie a dingin lupna abawl ua, amaute abawn un teptanloute namsau a kithat ahi uhi, azau huoina uh khu mihing gam ah a umsah vang un, kokhuh sung tungsuhte toh a zumna leh zalatna uh apuo ua thasate lah ah siel in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Khunah Meshek leh Tubal tualeh amihon tampite a um ua, ahante uh akimvel uah a um hi; amaute abawn un, teptanlou ahinglaite gam a zauhuoina a umsah zieh ua namsau a kithatte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amaute khu hankhuh sunga agalvante u’toh peisuh, teptanlou a pua, mihatte toh alumkhawm sih ding ua, anamsaute uh atangkhap ua, hinanleh mihing gam a mihat zauhuoi hinan u’leh zong; atatkhelnate uh agute uh tungah aumden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi, Nangkhu teptanloute lah ah, na kehgawp dinga, namsau a kithatte toh na lumkhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Khunah Edom, a leengte leh a leengtapate zousie namsau a kithatsate lah ah siel khawm in a um uhi; teptanloute leh hankhuh sunga na peisuhsate toh akisiel khawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Mallam leengtapate zousie leh Sidon mite toh abawn un, mikithatsate toh apeisuhkhawm uhi; azauhuoina u’toh ahatna uh azumpi ua; teptanlou in namsau a thasate toh a lumkhawm ua, hankhuh sunga peisuhte toh azumna, uh apokhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Pharaoh leh agalkap hon in amaute amuding ua; Pharaoh leh agalkap honte ziehin amauh tungah akihenem ding uhi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ken mihing gam ah ka zauhuoina umsah nanleng zong, Pharaoh leh amihonte zousie teptanloute lah ah namsau a, thate toh siel khawm in a um ding uhi; Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung kia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa na mite kungah thu gen inlen, akung uah, gam tunga namsau ka lensah chiengin, agam miten alah ua mi khat ateldoh ua, galveng dinga akoi u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />aman gamtunga namsau hing tung ding amu chienga, mipite kigalginna ding a, pengkul amut chiengin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />mi koipou tua pengkul gin za napi a, khohsalou a aum leh; namsau hing tung a, tuabang mi hinna alah leh, asisan maw ama lutungah atu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman pengkul ging za napi a, khawh asahlou ziehin asisan maw ama lutungah atu ding hi. Hinanleh akigalgingpa in ahinna ahumbit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh galvengpa in namsau hing kuon mu napi a, mite kigalginna dinga pengkul amut sih leh namsau ahing tun a, alah ua pat mi koi ahiei khat hinna alah leh akhelna ziehin lahmang ahi dinga, hinanleh a sisan phuba khu galvengpa tungah ka la ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tuachi’n Nang Mihing tapa, Israel innkuonte dinga galvengpa in ka hing koi ahi; tuaziehin ka kam a thupawt ngaikhie inlen, Kei apat in amauh kigalging sah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Migilou kunga, Aw Migilou na shi ngeingei ding ahi ka chi a, tua migilou khu agamtatna kiheisan ding a na hil sih leh, tua migilou khu agitlouna ziehin ashi ding a, hinanleh a sisan phuba na tungah ka la ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahivang in, migilou khu a umdan apat kihei dinga na hil a, a umdan apat akiheituom sih leh akhelna ziehin ashi dinga, hinanleh nang na hinna na humbit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tuaziehin nang Mihing tapa aw, Israel innkuon kungah thu gen in, nouten tambangin na gen uhi, I tatkhelnate leh ikhelnate i tung uah a um a, tuate zieh a tummang suh ihi u’leh, bangchin ihing thei ding uoi? na chi uhi, chiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaute kungah, Mangpa Pasian in ahin a ka hin laisie; Keima’n migiloupa shina ah kipahna mawngmawng ka nei sih a, hinanleh migilou khu a umdan gilou apat ahing kinuahei a hin khu ka deilam ahi, na umdan gilou ua pat hing kinuahei un, hing kihei un, aziehpen bangdinga shi ding na hi uoi mah? chiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin nang Mihing tapa na chi na namte tate kungah gen in: Midihtat adihtatna in atatkhelna ni in ahundam sih dinga, migilou khu agitlouna apat ahing kihei ni in, apuasih ding a; midihtat zong akhel niin, adihtatnate ziehin ahing tuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Midihtat kunga na hing ngeingei ding ahi ka chia, aman adihtatna muong a, silgilou abawl leh, asil bawl dihtatte lah a khat beeh zong akithei ngitnget sih dinga, hinanleh asilgilou bawl ziehin ashi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh migilou kunga na shi ngeingei ding ahi ka chi kia a, aman akhelna akiheisan a, danbangtah leh adih a abawl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />migilou in sum leitawi a kichiemna sil alahte anua pieh kia a, avan guhsate anua pieh kia a, hinna danpiehte azui a, gitlouna bangma abawl sih leh, ahing ngeingei ding a ashi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ana bawlsa khelnate khat beeh atungah thei ngitnget ahi nawnsih ding hi, aman danbang leh adih abawl ahita a, ahing ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Hinanleh na mite taten Mangpa sil bawldan adih sih achi uhi. Ahivangin amauh bawldan ahi adihlou zaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Midihtat in adihtatna akiheisan a, silgilou abawl leh ashi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh migilou khu agitlouna apat ahing kihei a, adih atang abawl leh, tua asilbawl ziehin ahing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh nouten Mangpa sil bawldan adih sih, na chi uhi. Aw nou Israel innkuonte, michin asilbawl dungzui un, atung chiet uah thu ka khen ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh ka saltaan uh kum sawm leh nina, aha sawmna ani nga ni in, Jerusalem apat a suohta mi khat ka kung uah ahing pei a, “Khopi apuata,” ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua mi suohta pa hing tun masang nitahlam in Mangpa khut ka tungah a um hi. Tualeh zingmawng a tua mipa, ka kunga ahing tun masangsie in ka kam ahing kaahsah a, tuachi’n ka kam akikaah a hamtheilou in ka um nawnta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mihing tapa, Israel gam sesa mun a tengten: Abraham mi khat maimai hinapi, aman tam gam aluo hi. Hinanleh eite mi tampi ihi ua, gam khu iluo ding ua hing kipie ahi, chiin agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaziehin akung uah, Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: Sa a sisan toh na nekhawm ua na mitte uh milimte langah na dahtou sah ua, sisan na suo ziehun, gam na luo ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na namsau uh na muong ua, sil kidahhuoite na bawl ua, noute michin in na innvengpa uh zi na subua chiet uhi. Tuabangpi in gam na luo ding uh amah? achi hi, chiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tambangin akung uah gen in, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ahin a ka hin laisie, gam sesa a tengte namsau in ashi ding ua, gamlah a umte khu gamsate nehmang dingin ka pe dinga, kulpi sunga umte leh kolhawm sunga umte natpi in ashi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aziehpen gam khu koima tenlouna gamsepen ka suohsah dinga, akisahtheipi ahatna ka beisah ding a, Israel taangte koima totnawnlou gamsie leh akinuasie gam ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n sil kidahhuoi abawlte zousie zieh ua, akiloisa gamsie ka suohsah zou chiengin, Kei Mangpa ka hi chi athei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Mihing tapa aw nang na hileh, na mite tate in nangma hing gensie kulbaang geilah leh inn kotkhabul lah ah akihoudap uhi, tualeh khat le khat kihouin michin in a unaupa kungah, hepitah in hing pei vawi, Mangpa a kipat a thupawt bang ahiei chi ngaikhe un, akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute mite hing pei bang in na kung ah ahing pei ua, na masangah ka mite bangin atou ua, na thugen angaikhie ua, hinanleh abawl sih uhi, akam un itna thu nasatah in agen ua, hinanleh alungtang un huoiham tah in punna adel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />En in, nangpen ama ua ding in, aw ngainuom huoitah neimi la hoitah bang leh tumging tum siemtah ging bang na hi, amaun na thugen aza ua, hinanleh azuituom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh tamte ahing tun chiengin, (ngai in hing tung ngei ngei ding ahi,) tuachi’n amaun alah uah guolnei aum hi chi a thei ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Israel belampute demna in genlawhna gen in. Akung uah genlawhna gen inlen, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ama uleh amauh kivahthau Israel belampute tung agih hi! Belamputen belamhon avah ding uh hizawlou ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Athaute na ne ua, amulte puon in na kisil ua, akivahthaute na that ua, hinanleh belamhonte na vah sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azawngkhalte na suhat sih ua, achinate na kemdam sih ua, aliemte lah na tuom sih ua, nawmanga umte lah na hing nuapui kia sih ua, amangte lah na suidoh sih uhi; hinanleh thagum leh giloutah in atung uah vai na hawmkhum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n belampu umlou zieh in, amaute akithezahta ua, tuabanga akithezah chieng un, gamlah a gamsate ann asuohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka belamte taang sangte leh muol tung lah ah avahvaita uhi; Ahi, Ka belamhonte leitung maikai ah akithethang zou siengta ua, Koiman asui sih ua, kan lah akankhe sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tuaziehin nou belampute aw, Mangpa thu ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in ahin a ka hin laisie: ka belamten belampu anei lou ua, ka belam honte samat mai ahing hi ua, gamsate ann asuohta ua, ka belamputen lah amauh suilou ua, hinanleh ama u’leh amauh akivah ua, ka belamhonte a vahsih uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin nou belampute aw, Mangpa thu ngai un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai un, Belampute ka dou ahi, tualeh ka belamhonte sisan man akhut uah ka phuut dinga, belamte avahna uh ka sutawp ding a, belampute ama u’leh amauh akivah nawn sih ding uhi. Akam sung ua pat ka belamte ka hundoh ding a, amaute ading in ann ahi nawn sih ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Aziehpen Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai in, Keima mama in, ka belamte ka kankhe dinga, ka suidoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Belampu in kithethangte lah a, a um lai a, abelamte asuidoh mabangin, Ken zong ka belamte ka suidoh dinga, khonim leh miel lah ah zong akithethangna mun zousie ua pat ka hundoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh namte lah a kipat in amaute ka puidoh ding a, gamchin apat ka puidoh dinga, amauh gam ngei ah ka polut dinga, Israel taangte ah, luipangte ah leh gam sunga mite tenna mun chintengah amauh ka vah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hampa hoina munte ah amauh ka vah dinga, Israel muol sangte tungah amauh ka va ding hi. Khunah huong hoitah sungah aboh ding ua, Israel taang hampa hoina munte ah amauh ka va ding a, akhawldamta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima’n ka belamhonte ka va dinga, amaute ka khawldam sah ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amangte ka suidoh dinga, avahmangte ka nuapui kia dinga, aliemte ka tuom ding a, achinate ka hatsah dinga, hinanleh athaute leh ahatte ka sumang ding a, vaihawmna in ka va ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tualeh noute nahi u’leh, Aw ka belamhonte, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai un belam leh belam kikaal tualeh belamtal leh keltal kikaal keima’n, thukhenna ka bawlpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Loupa hoina mun nou a dinga na kivah na ding ua neutaluo ahithei a, na ann maina uh loupa mundangte nangawn na keng un na tuonchil ding uh amah? Nouten tuichimtah na dawnzou chieng un, na dawnmawhte nangawn uh na keng un na pal nieh tei tei ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh ka belamten ahileh, na keng ua na totchilsate uh ane ua, tualeh na keng ua na palniehsate uh adawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in akung uah tambang in agen hi: Ngai un, Keima mama in ganta thau leh ganta gawng kikaal thu ka khenpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen nouten na pang u’leh na liengkou un, belam zawngkhal leh hatloute na phu ua, na delmang masangsie uh na kii un na su uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin ke’n ka belamhonte ka hundam ding a, samat ding ahinawn sih ding ua, tualeh ken belam leh belam kikaal thu ka khenpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh atung uah belampu khat ka koi ding a, amauh avaa ding hi, ka suoh David ngel in amauh avaa ding a, a belampu uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Kei Mangpa khu a Pasian uh ka hi dinga, ka suohpa David khu alah uoh leengtapa ahi ding hi. Kei Mangpa’n tami ka gensa ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ken amau’toh lemna thuhun ka bawl dinga, gamsung apat gamsa giloute ka beisah sieng dinga, gamdai ah bittah in ka tengsah dinga, tualeh gammang lah ah zong nuomtah in a imu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama uleh ka muol kimvel a munte ka guolzawl ding a, ahun hun in guo ka zusah ding a, guolzawlna guo azu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamlah singten ga asuota ding ua, leitungin aga apungsah ding a, agam uah bittah in a um ding uhi, tualeh ahahkol uh ka suhtawng a, sal a mante khut apat amauh ka hutdoh hun chiengin, Kei Mangpa ka hi chi atheita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh namdangte samat giap ahi nawnta sih ding ua, gamsate nehmang ding bep ahi nawn sih ding uhi; hinanleh lungmuongtah in a teng ding ua, Koiman azausah nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama ua dingin annte louhing kichinna huon minthang tah ka siem pieh ding a, kiel in amauh asumang nawn sih ding hi, tualeh nam dangte simmawna zong a thuoh nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tambangin Kei Mangpa a Pasian un, amaute ka umpi a, tualeh amauh Israel innkuonte ngei khu, ka mite ahi uh chi, ahing theita ding uhi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Noute ka belamhonte, ka gantatna mun a ka belamte, ka mite na hi ua, Kei na Pasian uh ka hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi,” chiin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaban ah Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung kia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Seir muol lang maingat inlen, ama douna thu genlawh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh akungah, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, chiin: Ngai in, Aw Seir muol ka hing dou ahi, nang dou in ka khut ka lam ding a, koima tennalou gam setawp in ka hing bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na khopite ka suse dinga, akisie leh akiloi khopi na suoh dinga, tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi na thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen Israeltate, khanglui lai apat na muda tawntung ua, atatkhelna uh gawtna nukhia pen a sietna atuoh ni un, namsau thahatna in a sisan uh na suo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuaziehin ahin a ka hinlaisie, Noute sisan a dingin ka hing bawlkhol ding a, sisan in ang nuadel ding hi; sisan na huotlou zieh un, sisan in ahing nuadel ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tambangin Seir muol koima tennalou a kiloi leh kisegawp ka suoh sah ding a, khuna pawtdohte leh hing lut kiate pouma khuna pat ka satkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh a muol leh taangte mi kithatsa siluongin ka dimsah ding a, na muolte leh na phaiguomte ah leh muol kikaal guomthuh zousie ah ka dimsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asegawp leh loi den in ka hing bawl ding a, na khopite akiluo kia nawn sih ding a, tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Nang: tam nam nite leh tam gam nite khu kei a ahi ding ua, Mangpa khunah umtamananleh iluo ding uh, na chi zieh in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuaziehin A hinna ka hinlai sie, Na lungthahna bang dungzui leh amauh na mudana zieha na suhlat, na thangsietna dungzui in ka hing bawl dinga, tualeh na tunga thu ka khen zou chiengin amaute lah ah ka kitheisahta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi leh, suhsiet in aumta ua, koima tenna lou a susiet dingin ikung uah pieh in a umta uh chi a, Israel muol leh taangte na gensietna zousie ka zata hi chi na hing thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tambangin na kam un ka tungah na kiuongsah ua, ka tung ah na thu uh na tamsah uh, chi kaza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: leitung pumpi lungnuom a akipah laitah noute koima tenna lou a kiloi gamsie ka hing suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel innkuonte goutan suhsiet leh loi ahi laitah a nang lungnuom a na kipah ziehin, tuamabangin nang zong kang bawl ding hi. Aw Seir muol leh Edom zousie abawn in asegawp ding uhi. Tua hun chiengin, Kei Mangpa ka hi chi athei ding uhi, chiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tualeh nang Mihing tapa Israel muolte kung ah genlawh inlen, nou Israel muolte aw Mangpa thu ngai un, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Melma in na tung tang ah: Ka chita vele! nidanglai muol sangte, eite tan ahing hita achi ziehun:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin genlawhna gen inlen, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Amaun nang ahing suhsiet ua, namdang umsunten nei na hing theina ding a, ning chin a, ahing nawmval ua, mi kamtamte houlim nopna leh mite gensiet a ahing um sah zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin Nou Israel taang te aw, Mangpa Pasian thu ngai un, Mangpa Pasian in taangte kungah; luite, phaiguomte leh mun sesate, nuasie a um khopite kungah, akimvel a um namdangte samat ding giap nuisat ding leh nuizatbuh hing hite kungah tambang in agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: Adihtah in, lungtang kipahtah leh sim mawna lungsim toh, ka gam amauh tan dinga ana kiguot tawm a, gallah vante a na bawltum, namdang umsunte tungleh Edom zousie tung ah, ka thangsietna meikuong pumin thu kana genta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin Israel gam tungtang genlawhna thu gen inlen, muol leh taangte kungah, luiguomte leh phaiguomte kungah, gen in, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai un, namte simmawna na thuoh ziehun ka thangsietna leh ka thangpaina zieh in thu ka genta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: na kimvel ua namten zong simmawna athuoh ding uhi, chiin banzah in ka kichiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ahi vangin nou, Aw Israel taangte, na bazamte uh hoitah in na mengdoh sah ding ua, Ka mi Israelte kung ah ga hoitah suong un, aziehpen hing pei pai ding ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai un, nou lam a pang ka hia, nou lam ka nga ding a, hawin na um ding ua, haichi tuna in na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachiengin na tungah mihingte ka pungsah ding a, Israel innkuonte abawn un, tualeh khopite akiluo ding a, tualeh akisesate akilamtha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tungah mihing leh gantate ka pungsah dinga, ahing chipha ding ua, ga ahing suong ding uhi; nidanglai mabangin mi ka hing tengsah dinga, na kipatchil laisang ua hoizaw in ka hing bawl ding hi; Tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi, na tungah ka mi Israelte ka vahsah kawi kawi ding a, tuachi’n amaun nang ahing luo ding ua, agoutan uh na hi dinga, atate uh na taansah ngai nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Aziehpen amaun na kungah, Nouten mite na ne gam ua, a nam u’leh atate uh na taansah leng uhi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin nouten mi na negam nawn sih ding ua, na namte na taansah ngai nawn sih ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Namte hing phinna ka hing zasah nawn sih ding a, namte simmawna zong na thuoh nawn sih ding ua, na nampite zong na kipalpua sah nawn sih ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaban ah Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Israel innkuonte amau’gam sung ua aten lai un, a umdan u’leh asil bawlte un gam abuasah uhi; agamtatna ukhu kei a dingin numei asinei lai ua asienthoulou bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin amauten gam sunga sisan aluonsahna uh amilimte ziehin atung uah ka lungthahna ka sungbota hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken amauh namte lah ah ka thezahta a, gam chin ah akithethangta uhi, a umdan uh dungzui leh a silbawl uh dungzui in amaute tungah thukhenna ka tunta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Namte lah a apeina chin uah, tamte Mangpa mite ahi ua, hinapi agam ua patpeidoh ahi uh chia, anachizel na uah ka min siengthou asubua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh Israel innkuonten apeina uh namte lah a asuhthanghuoi uh ka min siengthou ka lainat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Israel innkuonte kungah gen in, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, Israel innkuonte aw, tam sil ka bawlte noute zieh ahi sih a na tenna uh namte lah a na suhbua uh ka min siengthou zieh ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh ka min thupitah namte lah a suhbua a um, na lah ua na suhbua u’khu, ka susiengthou ding a, tuachi’n noute vanga namte lah a suhsiengthou a ka um hun chieng in, namdangten kei Mangpa ka hi chi ahing theita ding uhi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen namte lah a kipat ka hing ladoh dinga, gamchin apat ka hing puikhawm ding a, nouma gam ngei ah ka hing puilut kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n na tung uah tui sieng ka hing the dinga na hing siengta ding uhi; na niehna zousie ua kipat leh na milimte zousie ua kipat ka hing susieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lungtang tha ka hing pe ding a, na sung uah hagau tha ka koi ding hi. Tualeh na salah ua pat suong banga taah lungtang ka ladoh dinga, sa bang a nip lungtang ka hing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh na sung uah ka hagau ka koi dinga, ka danthupiehte ka hing zui sah ding, tualeh ka vaihawmnate na kem ding ua, na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n na pu napate uh kunga ka pieh gam ah na teng ding ua, noute ka mite na hi ding ua, Kei na Pasian uh ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na sienthou lounate zousie ua pat, ka hing hundam dinga, tualeh bu leh bal ka piengsah ding a, ka pungsah ding a, na tung uah kiel ka tungsah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na sing gate u’leh na louma hawsuohte uh ka pungsah dinga, tuachi’n namdangte lah ah maizumna na thuoh nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin na umdan giloute u’leh na silbawl hoiloute uh na hing theidoh ding ua, tualeh na gitlounate u’leh na kidahhuoinate ziehun, na mitmu uah nouma leh nouma na kikidah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Noute zieh a tami ka bawl ahi sih chi thei un, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi. Israel innkuonte aw, na umdan zieh un zum unlen, zala un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Na khelnate zousie ua pat ka hing silsieng ni chiengin, khopite ah zong ka hing tengsahta ding a, asesate akilam tha kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Gam kiloisa leh sesa, atuonkha zousie mitmu a asesa hi nawn lou in, gam sesate akihou kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauten gam sesa leh kiloisa khu Eden huon ahing bangta hi, tualeh khopi tulsa leh mangsate khu tuin kulpi a im leh luokia in ahing umta hi, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua hun chieng in na kim na pam ua nuasie a umten, Kei Mangpa’n gamsesa munte ka bawl tha a, gam tulsate ka pua tha ta hi, chi ahing thei ding uhi, Kei Mangpa’n tami ka gensa ahi a, ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: Tami ama ua dinga bawlpieh dingin Israel innkuonte nget leh kandoh in ka um nalai ding a, amite uh belamhon bangin ka pungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kithoina siengthou a zah ding ganhon bangin leh pawi bawl thupitah ni a, Jerusalem a belamhon bang khop in, khopi sesate khu mihonpi in ahing dimta dinga, tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi atheita ding uhi, achi hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa khut ka tungah a um a, tualeh Mangpa hagau in ahing puidoh a, gu ngen a dim phaijang laikim tah ah ahing koi suhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n a lah uah ahing vahsah ta a, Ngai vawi, phaijang ah gu ngentang atam a tam a um lemlum a, tualeh en vawi, agawta ngen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh ama’n ka kungah, “Mihing tapa tam gute ahing thei ding uoi? achi hi. Tuachi’n “Ken Mangpa Pasian aw, Nangman na thei hi,” chi in ka dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman ka kungah, “Tam gute kungah thu gen inlen, nou gu gawte aw, Mangpa thu ngai un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tam gute kungah tambangin agen hi, Ngai un, na sung uah nahna hu ka lutsah dinga, na hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na tung uah thagui ka koi ding a, na tung uah tel lehvou ka umsah ding a, vunin ka hing tuom ding a, na sung uah nahna hu ka koi ding hi; tuachi’n na hing hing ta ding ua; tuachi’n kei Mangpa ka hi chi na thei ding uhi,” chi in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n thupieh a ka um bangin ka genta hi; tuabanga thu ka gen lai in, thawmging husa ahing um a, thakhat in akigawttuo lemlum ging ahing um a, gute ahing kizuontuo ua, gute khat leh khat ahing kizop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai vawi, ka et leh thagui leh tahsa tel lehvoute atung uah ahing um a, vun in akhukhum hi; hinanleh ama uah nahna hu a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ka kungah, thu gen in, “Mihing tapa nahna hu kungah, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Aw nahna hu kawlmong ning li akipat hing pei inlen, ahintheina dingun tam mikithatsate tungah na hu hing hakhum in,” chiin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n thu ahing kipieh bangin, thu ka genta a, tuachi’n hinna hu amaute sungah ahing lut a ahing hing ta uhi; tualeh akeng un ahing dingta ua, galkap hon tampi ahing hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama’n ka kungah, “Mihing tapa, tam gute khu Israel innkuon pumpi ahi uhi. Ngai in, amauten ka gute uh a gawta a, ka kinepna uh abeita a, satkhieh ka hita uh achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin thu gen inlen akung uah, Mangpa Pasian in tambang agen hi: Ka mite aw ngai un, na hankhuhte uh ka hong ding a, na hankhuhte ua pat ka hing pawtdoh sah dinga, Israel gam ah ka hing puilut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua banga na hankhuhte uh ka hon a, na hankhuh te ua pat a noute kang lahkhiettou chiengin, Aw nou ka miten, Kei Mangpa ka hi chi na theita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na sung uah ka hagau ka koi ding a, na hing ding uhi; tualeh nouma gam sung mama ah ka hing koi ding hi. Tua hun chiengin Kei Mangpa’n ka gensa, ka bawl ahi chi na theita ding uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi, chiin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kung ah ahing tung kia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mihing tapa chieng khat la inlen, atungah Juda ading leh akipawlpi Israel tate a ding, chiin giel in, tuazou chiengin chieng dang khat lakia inlen, atung ah Joseph a ding, Ephraim chieng, tualeh akipawlpi Israel innkuon pumpi a ding, chi in giel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n chiengte khu khat leh khat zoptuo inlen, tuachi’n tua chiengte na khut ah khat ahing hita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh na mite taten na kunga; Tamte bang na china ahiei, koute na hing theisah sih ding amah? chi a ahing doh chieng un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />amaute kungah, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ephraim leh akipawlpi Israelte khut a um Joseph chieng khu ka ladoh dinga tua khu Juda chieng toh akizop dinga, chieng khat ka hisahta dinga, ka khut ah khat ahita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh atunga lai na gelna chiengte amit mu un amasang uah tawi inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />amaute kungah tambangin gen in, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Pellou in, Israel tate apeimangna namte lah apat ka la doh ding a, ningchin apat ka puikhawm dinga, amauh gam mama ah ka puilut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh amaute Israel gam sunga muol leh taangte tungah minam khat in ka bawl dinga, amaute zousie tungah leengpa khat a um dinga, nam ni ahi nawn sih ding ua, leenggam ni in akikhen ngai nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amilimte uh ahiei, asilkidah huoi bawlte uh ahiei, abawlkhelnate uh ahiei in akisubua nawn mawngmawng sih ding ua, hinanleh atenna ua a khelnate ua pat ka hundam ding a, ka susiengthou ding hi, tuachi’n amauh ka mite ahi ding ua, Kei a Pasian uh ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Amaute tungah ka suohpa David leengpa ahi ding a, amauten abawn un belampu khat anei ding uhi. Ka thukhennate azui ding ua, ka danthupiehte a kem ding ua, abawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka suoh Jakob kunga ka pieh na pu napate uh tenna gam ah ateng ding uhi; khunah ama u’leh atate u’leh atute uh kumtawn in atengta ding uhi, tualeh ka suohpa David khu kumtawn in aleengpa uh ahidenta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaban ah amautoh kilemna thuhun ka bawl dinga, tami amau’toh kumtawn thuhun ahi ding hi. Amaute ka sudet dinga, ka pungsah ding a, ka munsiengthou khu amaute lah ah ka koiden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka biehbuh zong amaute toh a umkhawm ding a, a Pasian uh ka hi ding a, ama uzong ka mite ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka munsieng thou khu alah ua kumtawn a aum hun chiengin namte zousie in zong, Kei Mangpa’n Israelte ka susiengthou ahi chi atheita ding uhi,” chiin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Meshek leh Tubal lamkai lienpen Magog gam a Gog lang ngain ama douna thu genlawh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi. Ngai in, Meshek leh Tubal lamkailienpen Gog aw, ka hing dou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hing kinuahei sah dinga, na khadang ah ngakuoi ka baat ding a, na galkap honteng toh, na sakolte leh galvan bukim a kigalvonsa sakol tung tuongte lum lien leh lum neu tawi mihonte abawn ua, namsau lehte toh hing kaikhe ding ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Persia, Ethiopia leh Libia toh abawn ua lum leh sia lukhu neite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gomer leh agalkap honte zousie mallam gam a, Togarmah innkuonte leh agalkapte zousie leh mitampi nang toh apangkhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Kiging inlen, nang leh na kipawlpite na kunga umte zousie kigingsa in um unlen, nang amaute vengtu in pangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nitampi nua chiengin hatkhawm na hi ding ua, kum nukhia lamte ah namsau a kipat kinuapui leh nam tampite lah akipat a puikhawmte umna gam sesa leh kiloisa, Israel taangte dou ding in na hing kuon ding uhi; namte lah apat puidoh ahi ua, abawn un hamuong tah in ateng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang leh na galkapte zousie, na kunga um nam tampite toh khopihui laang bangin na kuontou ding ua, meilum bangin khum gam na tuomkhum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: Khum ni chiengin, na lungsim sung uah kingaituona giloutah nei in sil na geel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n nangman kulbaang neilou khoneute umna gam ah ka kuontou dinga, abawn ua, kulbaang neilou a lungmuongtah a tengte, kulkot leh kulkot khana zawl zong neilou a bittah a tengte ka dou ding, na lungsim in na chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gallah sumte leh gallah vante la ding leh gam tulsa leh kiloisa nua luokiate leh namte lah a kipata puikhawm ganhonte leh neitah tampi nei gam lailunga tengte tungah khut hah na tum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sheba, Dedan leh Tarshish summet bawl mite, a humpibahnei khanglai zousieten na kungah gallah sumte tomkhawm dinga hing kuon na hiei mah? Gallah vante sana, dangka leh gantate pomang dinga, na galkapte toh hing kuon na hiei mah? a hing chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Mihing tapa genlawhna thu gen inlen, Gog kungah Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ka mi Israelte galmuonga aten uh tua ni chieng in na theina sih diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mallam gamlapi a na umna mun akipat in nang leh na umpi mi tampite a bawn ua sakoltungtuong ngentang, pawl thupitah leh galkap hon toh nang kuon ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka mi Israelte dou dingin meilum in gam a tuom khumbang in nang kuon ding uhi. Tami ni nukhialam chieng in ahi ding, nangma zieh a amitmu ua suhsiengthou a ka um hun chiengin namten Kei ahing theina dingun, Gog aw, nang ka gam dou dingin ka hing pui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Nidanglai a ka suoh Israel guolneite, khum hun laia kum tampi sung thu na genlawhte zanga, amauh dou dingin ka hing pui ding, ka chipa khu hilou na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel gam dou dinga, Gog ahing kuon hun chiengin ka lungthahna ka maitang ah ahing kilang ding hi; Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thangsietna zieh a, ka lungthahna meikuongin thu ka genta hi. Tua ni chiengin pellou in Israel gam ah zilling thupitah a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuipi a ngate, tunga leeng vate, gamlah a gamsate leh ganhing leitunga bohvah zousie leh leitung a teng mihing zousie, ka masang ah akithing ding uhi. Taangte paidoh ahita dinga, kawlte achimta ding ua, kulbang zousie lei ah apua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka taangtung teng ah Gog dou dingin namsau ka han ding a, michin in namsau in asanggampa asat ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Gog tung ah natpi leh sisansuona gawtna ka tungsah ding hi; Ama leh agalkap hon leh akipawlpi nam tampite tungah, gielpi leh mei leh kaat ka zusah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tambangin Keima leh keima ka kitawisang ding a, ka kisusiengthou ding hi, Nam tampite mitmu ah thei in ka umta ding hi. Tuachi’n amaun Kei Mangpa ka hi chi atheita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tualeh nang mihing tapa aw, Gog douna thu genlawh inlen, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai in, Meshek leh Tubal lamkai lien Gog aw, ka hing dou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kang lengatsah dinga, ka hing pui zel ding a, mallam gam tawp apat ka hing puidoh ding a, Israel taangte tungah ka hing puitung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n na veilam khut a pat na thalpi tawilai ka hing suhtawng pieh dinga, na khut zietlam apat na thaltangte ka kesah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel taang tungte ah na pua ding hi, nang leh na galkap honte leh na pankhawmpi namte toh; sa sielne va chinteng leh gamlah gamsa kung ah nehgam dingin ka hing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gamlah ah na pua dinga, aziehpen Keima’n ka gensa ahita hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Magog tung ah leh tuipi gei a, galmuongtah a tengte tungah mei ka sawl ding hi. Tuachi’n amaun Kei Mangpa ka hi chi athei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tuachi’n ka min siengthou ka mi Israelte lah ah ka theisah ding a, Ka min siengthou amauh ka subuasah kia nawn sih ding hi; tua namten Kei Mangpa Israelte Siengthoupa ka hi chi athei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pellou a hing tung pai ding ahita, bawlzou pai ahi ding, tua khu ka gensa ni khu ahi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tuachi’n Israel khopite a tengte akuonkhe ding ua, agalvante, lumte leh phawte, thalpi leh thaltangte, chiengzumte leh teipite, kum sagi sung mei in avaang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amauten gamlah a sing aponawn sih ding ua, gammanga sing zong asat uh ngai nawnlou ding ahi, aziehpen agalvante uh singin avang ding ua, amauh na tomgamte, ale tomgamta ding ua, avan uh na lahpiehte, a nualahpieh kia ding uh, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tua ni chiengin Israel gam sunga, tuipi suolampanga khuolzin mite phaiguom ah Gog a ding in kivuina mun ding ka pe ding hi. Tua mun a Gog leh a mihon tampite kivui ding ahizieh in khuolzin mite lampi adal ding hi. Tuaziehin tua mun khu Hamon Gog phaijang akichi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gam sung asuhsiengna ding un, ha sagi sung Israel innkuonten amauh avui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi, gam sung mi zousie in, amauh avui ding ua, tamini khu ama ua dinga pahtawi a ka umna ni minthangtah ahi ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaun agam uh susieng dingin, khuolzin mite toh luong vuiloute suidoh a vui dingin mi a guoi ding uhi. Ha sagi bei nua chiengin asui pan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Shi luong sui pawl in gam sung a tot suoh chieng ua, alah ua mi khatpou pou in mishi gu amu leh hankhuh touten Hamon Gog phaijang a tua gu avui masangsie un, gu amuna mun ah, chiemtena khat aphut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua khopi min zong Hamonah akichi ding hi. Tambangin amaun gam sung asusieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tualeh nang Mihing tapa Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: va namkim kungah leh gamlah a gamsa chinteng kungah thu gen inlen: Hing kikhawm unlen, hing pei un, Noute a dingin, kithoina sillat bawl ding ka hi, Israel taangte tunga kithoina thupitah ah, ning chin a kipat hing kikhawm unlen, tua mun a, sa ne a, sisan na dawn theina ding un, hing kikhawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihatte sa na ne ding ua, leitunga miliente sisan, belamtalte, belamnoute leh kelte, bawngtalte, Bashan gam a bawngtal vahthaute zousie, sisan na dawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Noute ding a kithoina sillat ka bawlna ding ah, gilvatah in sate thau nane ding ua, na kham masang sie un sisan na dawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gilva tah in ka ann kuong ah, sakolte leh atungtuong mite, mihatte, tualeh galsat mite zousie sa na ne ding uhi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ken ka thupina, namte lah ah ka koi dinga, Nam zousieten, ka suhtangtunsa ka vaihawmnate leh ka khut hatdante amu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel innkuonten, Kei Mangpa a Pasian uh ka hi chi, khum ni apat in atheiden ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n namdangten, Israel innkuonte akhelna zieh ua sal a puimanga um ahi uh chi athei ding uhi; aziehpen amaute kei a dingin agin um sih uhi, tuaziehin amaute apat ka mai ka phuol a, amelmate uh khut a ka piehdoh ahi; tuachi’n namsau a tha in a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A sienthou louna dungzui u’leh, abawsietna dungzui un atung uah ka bawlta, ama ua pat in ka mai ka phuolta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: Tuin Jakob saltaangte ka hing nuapui kia dinga, Israel innkuon pumpi tungah lainatna ka nei ding a, Ka min siengthou ka kihuhpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amauh gam mama a, hamuongtah a aten ua, koiman amauh asuhzau nawnlou chiengin, amuolphouna u’leh ka tunga amuonhuoi louna zousie uh amanghilta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Namte lah apat amaute ka puikia a, amelmate uh gam apat ka khopkhawm a, nam tampite mitmu a, amau’zieh a suhsiengthou a, ka um hun chiengin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kei Mangpa a Pasian uh, namte lah a sal a puimangsahpa leh amau’gam mama a nuapui kia a khat beeh zong sal a taang dinga nuasie loupa ka hi chi atheita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh ama ua pat ka mai ka phuol ngai nawn sih ding hi, aziehpen Israel innkuonte tungah ka hagau ka sungbota hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka saltaan uh akum sawmni leh nga na, kum kipatna ha, ni sawm achin ni, khopi siet nua kum sawm leh lina kum in, tuami ni mama in, Mangpa khut ka tung ah ahing um a, aman khunah kei ahing pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasian mengmuna in, Israel gam sungah ahing pui a, muol sangtah mai tungah ahing koi a, tuami hanglampang ah khopi umsa lim leh guong bang khat a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman khunah ahing pui a, tualeh ngai vawi, amel kilatdan sum-eng bang mikhat ana um hi. Aman a khut ah, khaujen khat leh tena chieng khat tawi in, kotpibul ah ana ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua mipan ka kungah, “Mihing tapa ka hing musah dingte zousie, na mit in en inlen, na bil in za inlen, na lungsim in ngaituo in; aziehpen amauh ka hing etsah theina dinga tam mun a ka hing pui ahi, na sil mute zousie Israel innkuonte kung ah phuong doh in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai vawi, biehinn pulam kimkot a imsuohna bang khat a um a, tualeh tua mipan akhut ah tena chieng tong guh a sau atawi hi, tualeh tong khat leh zabeeh a sau ahi, tuachi’n aman inn vailam ate a chiengtawn khat ahi a, a saulam zong chiengtawn khat ma ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama khu suolam nga kotpi ah ava pei a kalbite ah akahtou a, kotpi lutna inndan sung ateta a, chiengtawn khat a lien ahi a, tualeh inndan sung khat zong ate kia a, chiengtawn khat ma a lien ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kotpi gei a inndante saudan leh letdan chiengtawn khat tuoh tuoh ahi a, tualeh inndante kikaal tong nga chiet kihal ahi; tualeh kotpi lutna inndan sunglam innhim khu chiengtawn khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman kotpi sunglam innhim zong ate a, chiengtawn kimkhat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n kotpi innhim ate a, tong giet ahi; khuna kotpi khuomte tong ni chiet ahi; tualeh kotpi innhimte khu asung langah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh suolam a kotpi inndan neute khu langkhat ah thum a um a, a langkhat dang ah thum ma a um hi, tua khuom thumte akikim chiet uhi, tualeh tamlang panga khuomte leh khumlang pang a khuomte akikim chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh kotpi lutna letdan ate a, tong sawm ahi a, kotpi saudan tong sawm leh thum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Inndan neute mai ah mun awng a um a, tamlang pangah tong khat ahia, khumlang pang ah zongtong khat ma ahi, tualeh mun awngte khu alang ni in tong guh tuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman kotpite ate a, inndan neu inntung khat apat inntung dang khat tandong, tong sawmni leh nga, ahi, kotkha leh kotkha kisutuo in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman huong sung kotpi khuomte zong ate a, tong sawmni a sang ahi a, kotpilampi huong sung pumpi khu kotpi khuomte toh kisutuo ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A sung lutna kotpi mai akipat, kotpi sungnung zaw innhim mai tandong tong sawm nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Inndan lutna kotpi pulam baang ah kotta neu a um chiet a, inndan sungnung zaw baang kikaalte azong kotta a um chiet hi, tua kotpi bieng chin ah tum sing lim a um chiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman kei huongsung ponung zaw ah ahing puilut a, tualeh khunah pindante leh huongsung kimkot ah keng lampite a um hi. Pindan sawm thum in tua kenglampi lang amaingat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kelkot siih ah keng lampite a um a, tua kotpi lutna lampi saudan bang a bawl ahia, tuakhu keng lampi nuoinung zaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman kotpi nuoinung pen maizawn a kipat pulam a huong sungnung zaw maizawn tandong letdan ate a, suolam leh mallam ah tong zakhat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh huongsung ponungzaw mallam nga a um, kelkot saudan zong ate a, aletdan zong ate hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kelkot lutna gei a inndante, tamlangpangah thum khumlangpang ah thum a um a, akotpi khuomte leh a innhimte khu kotpi masa pen chie ahi, adung tong sawm nga, avai tong sawmni leh nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Akottate ainnhimte leh akizepna tumsingte suolam nga kelkot lutnate toh akikim chiet uhi; kalbi sagi a kaltou ahi a, innhimte amaizawn ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huong sungsungnung zaw kelkot khu mallam kelkot toh kizawn in a um a, suolam nga a um kelkot bangbang ahi, tualeh aman kelkot khat apat kelkot dang kikaal ate a, tong zakhat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuazou in aman simlang ah ahing zawpi a, khunah simlang nga kelkot khat a um hi; aman kotpi khuomte leh innhimte tam tena dungzuiin ate hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua kelkot lutna leh innhim in, kelkot dangte mabangin kotta akimkot in a nei a, adung lam tong sawmnga ahi a, availam tong sawmni leh nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tanah kaltouna ding kalbi sagi akidawtou a, tuate toh kizawn in innhimte a um hi, tualeh apang tuoh ah kelkot khuomte kizepna tumsing limte a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh simlang huong sung, sungnung zaw ah simlang nga kelkot khat a um a, aman simlam a kelkot leh kelkot kikaal ate a, tong zakhat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman simlam kelkot kunga huongsung inntuol sungnung zaw ah ahing lutpi a, tualeh simlam kelkot khu atena dungzui in ate hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kelkotpi gei a inndante leh akhuomte leh a innhimte, tam tena dungzui in ate a, kelkot lutna leh a innhimte kimkot ah kottate a um a, tong sawmnga a sau leh tong sawmni leh nga a lien ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh akimvel a innhimte khu tong sawmni leh nga a sau ahia, tong nga a lien ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ainnhimten huongsung ponung zaw lam anga ua, tumsing lim a kizem khuomte a um a, kaltouna kalbi giet a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman suolam nga, huongsung sungnung zaw ah ahing lutpi a, kelkot khu atenate dungzui in ate hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kotpi gei a inndante, akotpikhuomte leh a innhimte zong tam tena dungzui in ate hi; asungah leh a innhim kimkot ah, kottate a um a, tami tong sawmnga in asau a, tong sawmni leh nga in alien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A innhimte khu huongsung ponung zaw lam nga ahi a, akelkot khuompite apang lang tuoh ah tumsing limte a kizem a um hi; tanah kaltouna kalbi giet a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman mallam kelkot ah ahing lutpi a, tam tenate dungzui in ate hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Kelkot gei a inndante leh akhuomte leh a innhimte, tualeh akimkot a kotta umte asaulam tong sawm nga ahi a, availam tong sawmni leh nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A kotpi khuomten huongsung ponungzaw lam anga a, akhuomte apang tuoh a tumsing lim a kizem a um hi; tanah akaltouna kalbi giet a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Inndante leh asunga lutna ding lampi khu kelkot khuompite kungah a um hi; khunah halmang sillatte asawp zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua kelkot lutna innhim ah, apang tuoh ah dawkan ni tuoh a um a, khunah, halmang sillat, khelna sillat leh tatkhelna sillatte a ding gan akigou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua innhim pulampanga, mallam kelkot lutna tandong ipeitou leh dawkan ni a um a, tualeh alelampang kelkot innhim ah dawkan ni aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Dawkan li tamlangpang ah a um a, dawkan li khumlangpanga kelkotpi pangah a um hi; akithoina sa thana uh dawkan giet a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Dawkan lite khu halmang sillat latna ding a suong kikheng, tongkhat leh akim a sau, tong khat leh a kim alien, tualeh tong khat a sang ahi, tuate tungah halmang sillatte leh kithoinate athana uh hiemzatte akoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A sunglam ah zabeeh chia alien, akimvel a kikanbeh kuoika a um a, tualeh dawkante tungah sillat sate akikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Kelkot sungnungzaw pulam ah, mallam kelkot gei a um huongsung sungnung zaw ah lasamite inndan a um a, simlam amaingat a, khat pen simlam kelkot pangah mallam nga in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ka kungah, Tam simlam ngat inndan khu, biehinn a na sem siempute umna ding ahi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />mallam nga inndan pen khu maitam a nasem siempute umna ding ahi. Tamte pen Mangpa nasem dinga, Ama kung nai a hing pei Levi tapate lah a Zadok tapate ahi uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tualeh aman huongsung khu ate a, tong zakhat a sau, tong zakhat a lien ahi a, ning li kibang chiet anei a, tua maitam khu biehinn mai ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman biehinn innhim ah ahing zawpi a, innhim kotkhuomte ate a, tamlang pang ah tong nga, khumlang pang tong nga ahi a, tualeh kelkot lutna letdan, tamlangpangah tong thum khumlang pangah tong thum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Innhim saudan tong sawmni ahia, aletdan tong sawm leh khat ahi, tualeh aman akaltouna uh kellei ah ang zawpitou a, kotbieng khuomte kungah sutpi khat tamlangpang ah, khumlang pang ah sutpi khat a um hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman munsiengthou ah ahing zawpi a, tualeh kotkhuomte ate a, apang langkhat tong guh in alien a, alelampang zong tong guh ma a lien ahi a, tuakhu biehinn vailam letdan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Alutna kot vailam leldan tong sawm ahia, alutna kot azietle vei a bangte khu tong nga tuoh ahi uhi. Tualeh biehinn sung ate a, adung tong sawm li ahia, avai tong sawmni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama inndan sungnung zaw ah alut a, kotkhuomte ate a, tong ni chiet a lien ahi ua, tualeh alutna vailam tong guh ahi a, tualeh alutna gei a bangte tong sagi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama’n inn sung saudan ate a, adunglam tong sawm ni ahia, availam zong tong sawmni ma ahi a, biehinn laikim tellou in, tualeh aman ka kungah, “Tami munsiengthou pen ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman biehinn bang ate a, tong guh ahi, biehinn pang chinteng kim kot a inndante pen tong li alien chiet ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Apanga inndante khu sawng thum ahia, khat tunga khat kisuong sawn ahia, sawng khat ah inndan sawmthum chiet a um hi. Tua baangte kimkot ah apanga inndante tuhdetna aum a, apanga inndante tuhdetnate pen biehinn baang a thunlut ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biehinn kimvel a, apanga inndante khu sawngkhat tunga sawngkhat kilamtou in akimkot in alientou deudeu hi, a ziehpen biehinn baang kingapna zawlte kellei banga kikaltousah ahizieh in asang sem sem hi; atuong nuoinung pen a kipat in, atuong laita pen zawttou in asawng tungnung pen tandong akaltou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ken biehinn kimvel a a inn sandan ka mu a, apang a inndante kingatna suongphumte khu tong guh a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Apulam a apanga inndante bang sadan tong nga ahi a, tualeh amohteng khu asung lam a um apang pindan mun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh inndante kikaal pen biehinn kimkot suohin tong sawmni a lien a kikaah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Apanga inndante kotte khu mun awng lam nga a hon ahi a, kot khat mallam nga ahia kotdang khat simlam nga a hon ahi, tualeh akimvel a mun awng khu tong nga a lien ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh tumlam a biehinn sia a mun awng mai a inn khu avai tong sawmsagi a lien ahia, adung tong sawmkuo a sau ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman biehinn khu ate a, tong zakhat a sau ahi a, biehinn-sia mun awng leh tua inn baang sadan simtel in tong zakhat ma ahi a, biehinn huongsung leituol khu tong zakhat alien ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Suolampanga biehinn huongsung leituol, biehinn mailam huopin zong tong zakhat ma ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuazou in aman biehinn nualang huongsung lam nga akilam apang tuoh a kem kidaw te pumin ate a; Biehinn laikim a mun singthoupen leh inndan sungnungzaw leh inn mai leituol pum in tong zakhat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kotkhuomte toh, kotta hontheiloute toh akimvel a, tuong kidawsang sawng thumte khu kot tunglam tandong in, tuol apat kottate tandongin singpeh a thuop ahi a, tualeh kottate zong singpeh a thuop khum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Akot tunga mun awngte leh munsiengthoupen leh apulam baangte nangawn akimkot a, te suoh sieng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh tamte cherub lim leh tumsing limte a zep ahi a, tualeh tumsingte khu cherub leh cherub kikaal ah a um zel hi, tualeh cherub chin in mai ni anei chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n mihing maitang bang in langkhat ah tumsing lang a nga a, humpibahnei khanglai maitang bangin lelampang ah tumsing lang anga hi; Biehinn kimkot in tuabangin akigiel suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuol apat kottung hawm tandongin, munsiengthou pulam baang tungah, cherubte limte leh tumsing limte khuohthawin akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Biehinn sung laikimtah a kotkhuomte ningli nei ahi a, munsiengthou mai ah zong tuabang ma a kibawl a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sing a kibawl tong thum a sang maitam khat a um a adung tong ni asau, avai lamzong tong ni ma a lien, ataw leh apangte zong sing a kibawl ngen ahia; tualeh aman ka kungah, “Tami Mangpa mai a um dawkan khu ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Biehinn laikim leh munsiengthoupen in kotpi ni tuoh anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Akotpiten kotpeh ni tuoh akibuptuo anei ua, kotpeh nite akihip thei ding in akhaina kopza abul uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Biehinn laikim tunga, kotte tungah, bangte tunga khuohthaw a kigel bangin, cherub limte tumsing limte khuohthaw in akigiel hi, innpulam a innhim mai tungah singpeh nihimsun abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua innhim baang langkhat tuoh tuoh leh innpi pang pindante tung leh singpeh a kibawl nihimsunte tungah vathangkal leh tumsing limte a um hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuazouin aman sahlam panga um huongsung ponung zaw ah ahing zawpi a, biehinn huongsung leituol zawn leh mallam pang baang ponung zawn inndante ah ahing puilut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mallam panga inn um khu adung tong zakhat asau, availam tong sawmnga a lien ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huong sungnung zaw mun awng tong sawmni lam ngat in leh huong ponungzaw suong kilem lam ngat in, chiel kidaw sawngthum tuoh aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Inndante mai ah asunglam zotna lampi tong sawm a sau, tong khat a lien khat a um a, a kotten mallam angat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chiel kidawten mun aluo ziehin, Inndan tungnungte pen innsawng laita leh asawng nuoinunga inndante sang in a neu zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen inn sawng thum a lam ahi a, huongsung pulamte nei banga khuom aneilou ziehun, inndan tungnungten, innsawng laita leh innsawng nuoinung inndante sangin mun neuzaw aluo ua akochihzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh huongsung ponungzaw gei ah, tua inndante toh kizom hilhel in bang khat a um a, tong sawmnga a sau ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huongsung ponungzaw toh kizom, agei a inndan aguola kizomte tong sawmnga a sau ahi a, tualeh biehinn zula inndan pen khu tong zakhat a sau ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Inndan nuoinungte suolam pang ah, huongsung ponungzaw akipat Inndan sung lutna khat a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simlam pangah zong, mun awng zawn a, kulbaang zul a, biehinn mai ah inndante a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Inndante peina khu, mallam inndante peina bang bang ahi a, asaudan leh aletdan akibang hi; tualeh apawtdohnate leh alutnate akigeeldan dungzui a bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh simlam panga um kotte dungzui in tua inndante lutna ding peisuohna tawp suolam bangzul ah kot khat a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ka kungah, “Mun awng lam nga simlam leh mallam pindante khu, Mangpa kung lam hing zuon siemputen sillat siengthou pente aneina ding uh inndan siengthoute ahi; khunah amaun sillat siengthoupente, ann sillatte, khelna sillatte leh bawsietna sillatte, akoi ding uhi, mun siengthou ahizieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siempute tam sunga alut chieng un mun siengthou apat huongsung ponungzaw ah apeidoh sih ding ua, hinanleh khunah anasepna puonte uh anuasie ding uhi; aziehpen tuate asiengthou ahi uhi. Amaun puondang asil ding ua, mipite lah ah a pei thei ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman biehinn sungnungzaw atezou in suolam ngat kotpi ah ahing pawtkhietpi a, akimvel in ate hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman suolampang tena chiengin ate a, tena chienga te in tong zanga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mallampang ate a, akimvel a tena chienga te in, tong zanga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Simlampang ate a, akimvel in tena chienga tein, tong zanga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tumlampang kimvel in akihei a, tena chiengin tong zanga ate hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman aning li in ate a, akimvel ah baang tong zanga a sau, tong zanga a lien, mun sieng leh sienglou munte kikaal ah kikhenna bang aum hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuazou in aman suolam nga kotpi langah ahing zawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh ngai vawi, Israel thupina khu suolam apat in ahing pei hi. Tualeh a aw khu tuitampi ging abanga, leitung athupina in ataanvah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tami khopi suse ding a ka hing pei lai a ka mengmu leh kebar luipi gei a ka mengmu bang ahi a, tualeh kei khu khupboh in ka puata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa thupina khu suolam kotpi tawn in biehinn sungah ahing lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n hagau in ahing domtou a, huong sungnungzaw ah ahing puilut a, tualeh ngai vawi, Mangpa thupina in biehinn aluodimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi khat ka kunga adin laitah in aman biehinn apat kei ahing houpi ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh aman ka kungah, “Mihing tapa, tami ka mangtoupha umna mun leh ka kengtongatna mun, Israel tate lah a kumtawn a ka tenna ding mun leh ka min siengthou khu Israel innkuonte’n amauh hiin, a leengpate uh hitaleh, akizuana uh ahiei leh, a mun sangte ua, a leengte uh luong in abuasah ngai nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A innhimte uh ka innhim toh kizom in abawl ua, akotbiengte uh ka kotbieng toh kizomin a bawl in, kei leh amauh kikaal ah baang khat maimai in ahing hal sah ua, asil kidahhuoi bawlte un ka min siengthou asubuata uhi, tuaziehin ka lungthahna in amauh ka sumangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuin akizuanate u’leh aleengte uh luongte keima akipat gamlapi ah koimang uhen, tuachi’n alah uah kumtawn in ka teng denta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mihing tapa Nang akhelnate uh azumpi theina ding un, biehinn thu Israel innkuonte kungah gen inlen, akibawldan zong te uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A sil bawlsate zousie uh azumpi ua ahileh, biehinn kigelkhieh dante, akilep dante, apawtdohnate leh alutnate leh alim amel kigeldan zousie leh a kizat ding dan, dante leh thupiehdangte zousie toh amaute theisah in. Akigelkhieh dante, thei a, akizat ding dan, dante zousie muonhuoitah a azui theina ding un amaute mitmu ah giel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami biehinn toh kisai a dan ahi: Muolvum tung jang kimvel mun zousie asiengthou pen ahi ding hi. Tami biehinn toh kisai a dan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tami tonga te a maitam let dan ahi (tong khat chipen tongkhat leh zabeeh a sau ahi) akingahna tong khat a sang ahia, tongkhat a lien ahi, tualeh agei guol khap khat peisuoh a pawng ahi; tami maitam sandan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua maitam tuoltunga akingaatna apat dawdan nuoinungzaw tandong tong ni a sang, tong khat a lien ahi, dawdan neuzaw apat dawdan lienzaw tan tong li ahia, aletdan tongkhat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maitam taptung khu tong li a sang ahi a, maitam taptung apat kii li adawhtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh maitam taptung khu tong sawm leh ni a sau, tong sawm leh ni a lien, adung avai kibang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua dawdan khu tong sawm leh li asau, tong sawm leh li a lien, adung avai kikim ahi; tualeh agei guol tong kimkhat in a pawng hi, tualeh akingaatna khu akimvel in tong khat ahi a, tualeh maitam kalbiten suolam a ngat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh aman ka kungah, “Mihing tapa, Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: Tamte khu maitam kidawzou chienga, halmang sillatte latna ding leh atunga sisan thena ding toh kisai a maitam zah ding dante ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangman Zadok hahlesuon, Levimite ka nna hing seppieh dinga ka kung hing zuonte kung ah khelna sillat ding in, bawngtal tuoi khat na pe ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asisan themkhat nala dinga, maitam kii lite leh dawdan ninglite, tualeh ageiguol tungah na taat ding hi, tambangin maitam na susieng dinga, na siengsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khelna thoina dingin tua bawngtal tuoi na la dinga, munsiengthou pulam a, biehinn huong sung tuami ding a kiguotna mun ah na haltum ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ani ni niin, genbanglou keltal khat, khelna sillat in na lan ding a, bawngtal tuoi a asiensuo bang un, maitam asiensuo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuami na siensuo zou chiengin, genbanglou bawngtal tuoi khat leh belamhon lah a belamtal khat tuoh na lat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuate Mangpa mai ah na lan ding a, siemputen atung uah chi abuoh ding ua, tuachi’n Mangpa kungah halmang sillat dingin alan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ni sagi sung nichin in khelna sillat dingin, keltal khat mansa in na koi dinga, genbanglou bawngtal tuoi khat leh belamhon lah a belamtal khat zong mansa in na koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ni sagi sung maitam asiensuo ding ua, asusieng ding uhi; tualeh ama u’zong akisusiengthou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tam nite abei chiengin, ani giet ni apat in, siemputen na halmang sillatte u’leh na lemna sillatte uh, maitam ah alan ding ua, tuachi’n ka hing pomtheita ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in chi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman suolam ngat munsiengthou kotpi ponung zaw ah ahing nuazawpi kia a, hinanleh tua kotpi ana kikha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n ka kungah, “Tam kotpi akikha dinga, akihong sih ding hi, tami kotpi ah koima alut sih ding hi, Mangpa Israel Pasian lutna ahizieh in, akikha den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leengtapa ahileh, leeng tapa ahiziehin asungah ann ne ding in Mangpa maiah atou ding hi; tua kotpi innhim lampi ah alut ding a, tuami lampi mama ah apawtdoh ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman biehinn mai a mallam kotpi tawn in ahing zawpi a, tualeh ka en a, ngai vawi, Mangpa thupina in Mangpa inn aluodim a, kei pen bohkhupin ka puata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka kungah, “Mihing tapa chiemte hoi inlen, na mit in en inlen, tualeh Mangpa biehinn toh kisai a zahdan ding zousie leh, adanthute zousie tungtanga, ka gen zousie na bil in ngaikhie inlen, biehinn sung lutna leh munsiengthou a pawtdohna zousie melchi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin ahelhat Israel innkuonte kungah, Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Aw nou Israel innkuonte na silkidahhuoi bawlte uh hunsah ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mun siengthou sungah gamdang mite, lungtang teptanloute leh tahsa a teptanloute na puilut ua, ann leh sathau leh sisan na lat sung un ka biehinn na buasah uh a, ka thuhun na palsan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh ka silsiengthoute na kemsih ua, hinanleh midangte ka munsiengthou kem ding in na koizawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Lungtang teptanlou leh tahsa a teptanlou gamdang mi mawngmawng Israelte lah a teng gamdang mi nangawn ka mun siengthou a alutlou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israelte alampielmang lai ua, gamlapi a hing taisan a, amilimte uh nua del a kei hing pielmangsan Levi miten akhelna maw uh akipuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh biehinn kotpite vengin leh biehinn a nasem in, ka munsiengthou sungah nna asem ding ua; halmang sillatte leh mipi kithoina gantate athat ding ua, amaute naseppieh in amai uah ading ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaun amilimte uh masang ah ana aseppieh ziehun, Israel innkuonte khelna ah apuasah uhi; tuaziehin atung ua banzahin ka kichiemta hi, tualeh akhelna maw uh akipuoh ding uhi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh amaute khu ka kung nai a siempu nasem ding ahiei, ahisihleh munsiengthoupen a ka sil siengthoute kungnai a ahing pei ding uh ahisih hi, hinanleh azumna u’leh asilkidah huoi bawlte uh akipuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahivang in amaute biehinn kepna a mawpo ding leh asunga sep leh bawl ding zousie mawpo dingin ka guong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Hinanleh Israel taten ahing pielmangsan lai ua, ka munsiengthou a nasem Levi mi, siempu Zadok tapaten ka nasem dingin ka kungah ahing nai ding ua, ka kunga sathau leh sisante lan dingin ka masangah ading ding uhi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaute ka munsiengthou ah alut ding ua, ka nasem dingin ka dawkan ahing nai ding ua, ka nasem in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh huong sungnung zaw kotpi a alut chieng un puonmalngat asil ding ua, huong sungnungzaw kotpi sung leh innsung lam a anasep sung un atung uah samul puon mawngmawng akibat sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Puonmalngat diel alutang uah akhip ding ua, puonmalngat puonsungsilte ateng ding uhi, khosa pawtsah thei puon mawngmawng asil ding uh ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huongsung ponungzaw a mipite umna a ahing pawtdoh ding chieng un, anasepna puonte uh asutkhe ding ua mun siengthou inndan sungah akoi ding ua, puonsil dang asil ding uh ahi, tuachia amaun mipite apuonsil pum un asusiengthou sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Alutang uh aheukieu ding uh ahisih a, asam uh zong akhoisau ding uh ahi sih, asam uh hoitah a apawnam ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huong sungnungzaw a alut chiengun, siempu koima in zu adawn vawt lou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Meithai ahiei khulsa numei ahiei, zi ding a akitenpi vawtlou ding uh ahi, hinanleh Israel innkuonte hahlesuonte nungah siengthou ahisihleh siempute zi na hisa meithaite akitenpi thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh amaun ka mite asieng leh abua kibatlouna ahilchien ding uhi, tualeh asienglou leh asieng khensiemna azilsah ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thubuoi zousie ah siempute thukhen in apang ding ua, ka danthupiehte dungzuiin thu akhen ding uh ahi; tualeh ka guot tuom pawi bawl ni chiengin ka danthupiehte leh ka danguotte azui ding ua, ka khawlnite atang siengthou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama uleh amauh kisubua dingin mishi luong kunga ahing peilou ding uh ahi, hinanleh, apa ahiei, anu ahiei, atapa ahiei, atanu ahiei, asanggampa ahiei, pasal neilou asanggamnu ahiei ahileh akisubua thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Akisiensuo zou chiengin ni sagi zia atang nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh munsiengthou huong sungnungzaw a munsiengthou a thunasem ding a alut ni chieng in, ama a dingin khelna sillat alan ding hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tami ama ua dingin agoutan uh ahi dinga, keima agoutan uh ka hi; Israelte lah ah tanvou bangma na pesih ding uhi, kei amauh tanvou ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amauten ann sillatte, khelna sillatte leh bawsietna sillatte ane ding ua, Israel gam a sillat chinteng amauh tan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ga masa zousie lah a ahoipente, na sillat chinteng lah ua hoipente leh na kithoina chinteng uh siempute ading ahi ding hi. Na inn sung ua guolzawlna a umden theina dingin, na anntha huon masah pente uh siempu kungah na pe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Siemputen apul ahiei ahisihleh shingaina lou a shi va hiin ganta hitaleh gamsa in athasate mawngmawng aneh vawtlou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tuaban ah goutan dinga aisan a gam na hawm chiengun, Mangpa a dingin gam adung saudan tong tul sawmni leh nga, availam letdan tul sawmni, mun khat na pe ding ua, tami gamsung pumpi ah asiengthou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tami lah apat in munsiengthou a dingin adunglam tong zanga, availam tong zanga ma, ningli kikim munsiengthou a, ding ahi ding ahi. Tualeh akimvela te a, tong sawmnga a lien mun awnga koi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua gam khenkhieh kitedoh lah apat adung tong tul sawmni leh tul nga leh avai tong tul sawm alien na tedoh ding a, tam sungah mun siengthou leh mun siengthoupen a um ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam gam guot siengthou mun khu Mangpa kunga thu nasem ding a hing pei, mun siengthou a nasem siempute a ding ahi ding a; a inn mun ding u’leh biehinn dinga a mun siengthou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua gam tong tul sawmni leh tul nga a sau leh tong sawm a lien khu biehinn sung thunasem siemputen atenna ding un akitan ding ua, khunah inndan sawmni amaun akinei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Gam siengthou dinga kiguot tuom zul ah khopi tanvou ding mun avai tong tul nga a lien adung tong tul sawmni leh nga a sau na guot ding uh ahi; tami Israel innkuon pumpi ading ahi, ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Leng tapate gam dingin, gam siengthou latsa ding a kiguotdoh siih tuoh a kigi gam leh tua khopi gam toh kigi atang ding hi, tuakhu tumlampang leh suolampang ah akihung suh ding a, tumlam apan suolam leh anam anam a gam tan khat toh kizom hilhel in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tami Israel gam sung ah ama goutan ahi dinga, ka leeng tapaten ka mite asugenthei nawn sih ding uhi, tualeh gam um nalai teng Israel innkuonte kungah anam anam dungzui in a pe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ahunta hi! Aw Israel leeng tapate, na hiemngamna u’leh na minuoisiete tawpsanta unlen, thudih leh dihtatna toh vaihawmna bawl unlen, ka mite na deldoh u’pen tawpsanta un, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tena dih leh buhna dih, ephah dih leh bath dih na zah ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephah leh bath khu tena kibang ahi ding a, bath khat khu homer se sawmsuo sekhat dawl ahi dinga, ephah zong homer se sawmsuo sekhat ahi ding a, Homer pen atena dih etna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Shekel khat ahileh gerah sawmni ahi dinga, shekel nga khu shekel nga na ahi ding a, shekel sawmni leh nga leh shekel sawm leh nga khu nou a dingin mina khat ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tam sillat, na lat ding uh ahi; mangbu homer khat lah a kipat ephah seguh suo sekhat, buman homer khat lah akipat ephah seguh suo sekhat ma na pe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sathau bath a te a lat ding dan khu, kor khat apat bath se sawm suo sekhat na lan ding uhi. Kor kichipen homer mabangin bath sawm dawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Israelte gantatna loudawng hoina mun akipat belamhon lah a zani lah ah belamnou khat pieh ding ahi. Tam pen ann sillat, ding leh halmang sillat ding leh lemna sillat ding, tualeh amaute ding a kilemna bawlna ding a alat ding uh ahi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gam sunga mi zousiein, Israel leengtapa a dingin tam sillat ape ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n, pawite, hathate leh khawlnite ah, tualeh Israel innkuonte pawi ni poimawte zousie ah, halmang sillatte, ann sillatte leh dawn sillatte pieh khu leengtapa ngaituo ding ahi ding hi. Aman Israel innkuonte ading a kilemna, bawlna dingin, khelna sillat, ann sillat leh halmang sillatte leh lemna sillatte asihpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ha khatna tuami ha, ni khat niin, bawngtal tuoi genbanglou khat na la ding a, munsiengthou na siensuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Siempuin khelna sillat sisan ala ding a, biehinn khuomte tungah leh maitam dawdan ning lite tung ah leh huong sungnungzaw kotpi khuomte tungah ataat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh tuami ha, ani sagi ni chiengin zong atheilou zieh u’leh atheisiemlou zieh ua khelna bawlkha pouma a dingin, tuabang main na bawl ding a, tuachi’n biehinn a dingin siensuona na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Aha khatna tuami ha, ani sawm leh li ni in, peikan pawi ni sagi sung na nei ding ua, tolsawlou tanghou na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh khum ni chiengin leeng tapa in ama a ding leh gamsung mite zousie a dingin, khelna sillat dingin bawngtal khat atuoh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ni sagi pawi kibawl sung, nichin in ni sagi sung, bawngtal sagi, belamtal sagi leh khelna sillat ding keltal khat, genbanglou ngen Mangpa kunga halmang sillat dingin ni sagi sung atuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ann sillat adingin bawngtal khat zel ah tangbuongnel ephah khat, belamtat khat zel a ding in tangbuong nel ephah khat, tualeh tangbuong nel ephah khat zel a dingin sathau hin khat atuoh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aha sagina, khumi ha ani sawm leh nga ni in, khelna sillat, halmang sillat, ann sillat leh sathau lat dungzui in, tuabangin ni sagi pawi bawl sungtengin atuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Nesep hun ni guh sung suolam nga huong sungnung zaw kotpi akikha dinga, ahivangin khawlni in akihong ding a, tualeh ha tha niin zong akihong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lengtapa khu pulam apat in tua kotpi innhim ah alut ding a, kotpi khuom kungah ading ding hi. Siemputen a halmang sillat ding leh alemna sillatte alan ding uhi. Aman kotpi lutna innhim ah Pasian abe ding hi. Tua zou chiengin apawtdoh ding a, hinanleh kotpi khu nitah dongin akikha sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuamabangin agam mipiten zong khawlnite leh ha tha nite in tam kotpi lutna ah, Mangpa mai ah Pasian abe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khawl nia leengtapa in Mangpa kunga alat ding halmang sillat khu genbanglou belamnou guh leh genbanglou belamtal khat ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh ann sillat ding, belamtal khat a dingin ephah khat, belamnoute adingin apieh zou zaza; tualeh ephah khat ah sathau hin khat ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ha tha ni in genbanglou bawngtal tuoi khat leh belamnou guh leh belamtal khat ahi ding a, genbanglou ngen ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman ann sillat in, ephah khat bawngtal khat a ding in, ephah khat belamtal khat a dingin, tualeh belamnoute a dingin apieh zou zaza, ephah khat zel ah sathau hin khat atuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lengtapa alut chiengin kotpi innhim tawn in alut ding a, tualang ma ah apawtdoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hinanleh agam mipite pawi siengthou hun chienga Mangpa mai a ahing pei chiengun, Pasian be ding a mallam kotpi a lut pouma, simlam kotpi ah apawtdoh ding ua, tualeh simlam kotpi a lut pouma mallam kotpi ah apawtdoh ding uhi, ahing lutna kotpi ah ahing kinuale sih ding ua, hinanleh alelam kotpi ah apawtdoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Leng tapa khu alah uah aum dinga, amaute alut chieng un alut dinga, amaute apawtdoh chieng un, apawtdoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Nop bawlna leh hunbinei a pawi bawl nite a, ann sillat adingin, bawngtal khat ah ephah khat, belamtal khat ah ephah khat, belamnoute a dingin apieh zou zaza, tualeh ephah khat ah sathau hin khat ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh leengtapa in ama ut thu a halmang sillat alat ahiei, lemna sillat ahiei, Mangpa kunga alat nuom chiengin, suolam nga kotpi akihon pieh dinga, khawlni a abawl bangin ahalmang sillat leh, alemna sillatte alan dinga, tuazou chiengin apawtdoh dinga, apawtdoh zou chiengin kotpi akikha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Nichin a Mangpa kunga halmang sillat dingin belamnou kumkhat a upa genbanglou khat na zang ding a, zingmawng chin a na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh zingmawng chin in ann sillat ding in, ephah seguh suo sekhat leh tangbuong nomsah dingin sathau hin khat sethum suo sekhat na bawl dinga, tami ann sillat Mangpa mai a kitatloua bawl den ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tambangin, amaun, halmang sillat tanlou a, zingmawng chin a, lat dingin belamnou leh ann sillat leh sathau angaituo ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: Lengtapa in, a tapate lah a koipen ahiei kunga agoute silpieh a apieh leh tua agou khu atapate a, ahi ding hi; tuakhu agouluo uh ahi mai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh asuohte lah a khat kungah agou themkhat silpieh a pieh leh salpawtkhietna kum tandong ama a ahi ding a, tuami nua chiengin leeng tapa kungah anuapieh kia ding hi. Hinanleh agou khu atapate a ahi dinga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaban ah leeng tapa in amite neilelam apawng lahpieh ding ahisih a, a inn leh lou uapat anawdoh lou ding ahi; ama neilelam apat a atapate goutan apieh ding ahi, tuachi’n ka mite khat zong ainn alou ua pat akithethang sih ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuazou in aman mallam nga siempute inndan siengthou lutna kotpi gei a um lampi zui in ahing zawpi hi, tualeh khuna, tumlam pang mong tawp ah mun khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ka kungah, “Tam mun khu siemputen bawsietna sillat leh khelna sillat sa ahuonna ding mun uh ahia, tualeh ann sillat akanna ding mun uh ahi; tuachia mite suhsiengthouna ding a, huongsung ponungzaw a, atawidoh louna ding un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuazou in aman huongsung ponungzaw ah ahing puidoh a; huongsung ning lite zuul ah ahing peisah a, tualeh ngai in, huongsung ning chin ah huong dang khat a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huongsung ning li ah, huongsung ki-im, tong sawmli a sau, tong sawmthum alien, a ning lite khu akikim chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua huongsung ning lite kimkot ah suong inn aguol in akilem hi, tua suong guol kilemte nuoi ah ann huonna ding tapjang akibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama’n ka kungah; “Biehinn a nasemten mipite kithoina sillatte a huonna ding uh annhuonbuh tamte ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman biehinn lutna kotlam ah ahing nuapui kia a, Ngai vawi biehinn kotpi bul nuoi apat suolam manaw in tui ahing luongkhie a, biehinn khu suolam nga ahi a, tualeh tui khu biehinn zietlam pang nuoi a pat in, maitam simlam pangah ahing luong suh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman mallam kotpi lampi zui in ahing puidoh a, akimkot a pei in, suolam nga kelkot ponungzaw tandong ahing zawpi a, ngai in, azietlam pangah, tui aluong khie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akhut a tena khau tawikawm in suolam manaw in apeidoh a, apei kawmin tong tul khat atedoh a, tualeh tui palkai in ahing zawpi a, tui khu ka siehmit tan agei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman tong tul khat ate kia nalai a, tui palkai in ahing zawpi kia a, tui khu khup tan gei ahi; tualeh tong tul khat ate kia a, ahing palkaipi kia a, tui khu kawng tan gei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman tong tul khat atedoh kia a; ka palkai zou guollou luipi ana hita hi; aziehpen tui khu athuhta a, azap a zaplou a, palgalkai zou ding guol ana hita sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman ka kungah, “Mihing tapa tami na mu ei?” ahing chi hi. Tuachi’n ahing zawpi a lui gei ah ahing nua tut kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khuna ka hing tun kia tahin, tua lui gei lelam tuoh ah singkung tampi ana um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ka kungah, “Tam luite khu suolam gam manaw a luong ahi ua, phaijang ah aluong suh ua, tuipi ah a luonglut uhi; tuipi ah aluonglut ding ua, atuite a sudam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua luitui luon khahna pouma ah, ganhing pia thei chintengin ahin lawding ua, Tam tuite khuna aluonlut zieh un, nga atam atam ahing um ding a, tui asientah zieh in, luitui luonna pouma ah sil chinteng ahingta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hiding a, Engedi apat En-eglaim tandong in ngaman mite atung uah ading ding ua, len phouna mun ahita ding hi; angate uh tuipi lien a ngate bang in, nga chituom tuom atama tam a hiding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh buonnaang munte leh tuiveina mun a tuite asieng sih dinga, chikhuh dinga nuasie ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua luigei ah, luigei lang ni tuoh ah, anate vul ngailou ding, agate pul ngailou ding, aga neh ding theikung chi tuom tuom apou ding hi. Munsiengthou apat luongkhie tuite ahizieh in, ha chin in ga tha asuongdoh ding a, tualeh agate khu ann ahi dinga, anate damna ahi ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: “Tami Israel nam sawm leh nite lah a, agoutan ding ua, gam hawm dan ding ahi: Joseph in tan ni atang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaute lah ah akikim chiet in gam na hawm pieh ding ahi; na pu na pate u’kunga pieh ding a banzah a kana kichiemna gam ahi a, tam gam na goutan gam uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tami gam pumpi gamgi ahi ding hi: Mallam pang ah: tuipi lien apat in Heth-lon lampi zuiin Labo-Hamath paltan in, Zedad tandong in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hamath, Berothah, Damaska gamgi leh Hamath gamgi kikaal a um Sebraim leh Hauran gamgi zula um Hazar-Hattikon tandong in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamgi khu Tuipi akipat in apei dinga, Damaska gamgi Hazar-enon tandong ahi ding hi; tam pen mallam pang gamgi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tualeh suolam pang ah Hauran leh Damaska kikaal ah gamgi apei ding a, Gilead leh Israel gamgi kikaal a Jordan lui zui in Tamar dong in suolam tuipi tandong ahi ding hi, Tami suolam pang gamgi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Tualeh Simlam pang gamgi pen, Tamar apat in Meribah Kadesh tuite tandong in apei dinga, khuna kipat in Izipt luipi a zui dinga tuipi ah alut ding hi, Tami simlam pang gamgi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tumlam pang ah Lebo-Hamath gal a Tuipilien tandong gamgi ahi ding hi. Tambangin tumlam pang gamgi apei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tuachi’n tam gam khu Israelte nam dungzui in na kihawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Noute leh na lah ua teng talenau nei gamdang mite tan dingin ai san a na hawm ding uh ahi. Tua gamdang mite khu gamsunga pieng Israel tate mabanga na ngai ding uh ahi. Israel namte lah ah noute mabangin goutan na got ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua gamdang mi koi nam lah ah tengta nan u’leh zong, agoutan ding uh na pieh teitei ding uh ahi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tuin tamte anamte uh minte ahi: Mallam pang gamgi akipat in Hethlon lampi zuiin, Lebo-Hamath apat in Hazar-Enon tandong (tua khu mallam a Damaska leh Hamath gamgi ahi) ahi ding; tamte khu suolam leh tumlam pang ah, Dan tanvou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asher in gam tan khat atang dinga, suolam apat tumlam dongin, Dan toh akigamgi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Naphtali in gam tankhat atang ding a, suolam apat tumlam dongin, Asher toh akigamgi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Manaseh in gam tankhat atang ding a, suolam apat tumlam dong in, Naphtali toh akigamgi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ephraim in gam tankhat atang dinga, suolam apat tumlam dong in, Manasseh toh akigamgi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Reuben in gam tankhat atang ding a, suolam apat tumlam dongin Ephraim toh akigamgi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Juda in gam tan khat atang ding a, suolam apat tumlam dongin Reuben gam toh akigamgi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Suolam apat tumlam donga Juda gam toh kigamgi, atuoma silpieh a na lat ding uh gam khu availam tong tul sawmni leh nga ahi dinga, adunglam suolam pang a pat tumlam pang dongin, tanvou dangte gam tan chie chie ahi ding hi. Tua gam laikimtah ah munsiengthou a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gam guottuom silpieh a na lat ding u’khu adunglam tong tul sawmni leh tul nga availam tong tul sawm ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh siempute a ding a gam lat siengthou ahileh tamte ahi ding: mallam ah adung tul sawmni leh tul nga, tumlam ah avai tong tul sawm, suolam ah avai tong tul sawm, tualeh simlam ah adung tong tul sawmni leh tul nga ahi ding a, alaikimtah ah Mangpa munsiengthou a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tami Israel tate apielmang lai ua, Levi mite pielmang banga pielmanglou ka thu kem mi Zadok tate lah a suhsiengthou a um siempute a ding ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua gam guot tuom siengthou apat a amaute a ding a kilan tuom mawngmawng ahi dinga goutan siengthoupen ahi ding hi Levite gam toh kigi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Siempute gamgi zawnah Levimiten gam adunglam tong tul sawmni leh tul nga, availam tong tul sawm anei ding uh ahi, adung saudan atawnsuoh in tong tul sawmni leh tul nga, avai lam tong tul sawm ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siemputen tam gam azua ding uh ahi sih a, sil toh zong akihenpi ding uh ahisih hi; agam hoina munte zong midang kunga apieh vawtlou ding uh ahi, aziehpen Mangpa a dinga siengthou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tualeh availam tong tul nga leh adung lam tong tul sawmni leh tul nga um nalai teng, khopi in zahna tangpi a azah ding, tenna inn lamna ding leh gantatna mun ding, ahi ding hi. Tua gam laikim tah ah khopi a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Akitedan tambang ahi ding hi: Mallam pang tong tul li leh zanga, simlam pang tong tul li leh za nga, suolam pang tong tul li leh zanga, tualeh tumlam pang tong tul li leh zanga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh khopi a dinga gam awng, mallam pang ah tong zanileh sawmnga, simlam pangah tong zani leh sawmnga, suolam pangah tong zani leh sawmnga, tualeh tumlam pang ah tong zani leh sawm nga ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gam val umnalai teng, gam guottuom kilansa teng toh, adunglam a kigi, suolam pang ah tong tul sawm, tumlam ah tong tul sawm, ahi ding hi. Gam lat siengthousa kimvel zul ahi ding hi, tualeh asunga ga piengte khu khopi a nasem mite neh ding ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khopi a nasemmi Israel nam zousie apat a miten agam louin ahou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua gam let dan apumpi in adung tong tul sawmni leh tul nga, availam tong tul sawmni leh tul nga ahi dinga, gam guot tuom lat siengthou ning li nei khu, khopi gam tan toh na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Gam guottuom siengthou akilan gam pang tuoh a, gam umnalai teng leh khopi gam neiteng leengtapa ading ahi. Gam siengthou tong tul sawmni leh tul nga ban a kipat suolam gamgi tan, tumlam pang tong tul sawmni leh tul nga, ban ah gam guottuom dangte zulzul khu leeng tapa a ahi dinga, tua khu gam lat siengthou ahi ding a, alaikim tah ah biehinn munsiengthou a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaban ah Levite gam tan leh khopi gam tan leengtapa tante kikaal ah a um ding a; Juda gamgi leh Benjamin gamgi kikaal khu leeng tapa tan ding ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Nam um nalai dangte ahileh suolam apat tumlam dongin, Benjamin gam tan khat chie atang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Benjamin gam tan toh kigamgi in Simeon in gam tan khat atang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Simeon gamgi zul ah suolam apat tumlam dongin Issakar in gam tan khat atang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Issakar gamgi zul ah, suolam apat tumlam dongin Zebulun in gam tan khat atang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Zebulun gamgi zul ah, suolam apat tumlam dongin Gad in gam tan khat atang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Gad gamgi zul ah, simlam pang ah, simlam manaw in gamgi, Tamar a kipat in Kadesh-Meribah tuite leh tuipi Lien lam a luineute tan ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tami Israel namte kunga, agouluo ding ua ai san a na hawm ding uh gam khu ahi a, tualeh tamte khu agam tan dingdan uh ahi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Tamte khu mallam panga khopi pawtdohnate ahi, tena tul li leh zanga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khopi kotpite khu Israel namte min dungzui a phuo ahi. Mallam ah kotpi thum: Reuben kotpi khat, Juda kotpi khat, Levi kotpi khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Suolam pang ah tena tul li leh zanga, kotpi thum: Joseph kotpi khat, Benjamin kotpi khat, Dan kotpi khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Simlam pang ah tena tong tul li leh zanga, tualeh Kotpi thum: Simeon kotpi khat, Issakar kotpi khat Zebulun kotpi khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tumlam pang ah tong tul li leh za nga, akotpi thumte: Gad kotpi khat, Asher kotpi khat leh Naphtali kotpi khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A kimkot a te a asau dan tong tul sawm leh tul giet ahi ding a, tua ni akipat khum khopi min khu, MANGPA KHUNAH AUM HI, chi ahita ding hi.”
  </para>
</usx>
